31">You</g> are required to confirm the new sleeve using one of the following options: <x id="32"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13"><x id="28"/> <g id="31">Você</g> deve confirmar a nova ponteira, usando uma das seguintes opções: <x id="32"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="13" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="95"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="95"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">rXFbywTwaZLfaXKmfu/umNs2Fr0aLSTCT+rDA/Z0im0=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:04:05</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">rXFbywTwaZLfaXKmfu/umNs2Fr0aLSTCT+rDA/Z0im0=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1696216932</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="df588dc1-7942-4b71-9737-818fcaac68dd"><source>Activating the <g id="39">New Sleeve Attached</g> option when filling in a new Rx, as described in <x id="40"/>.This method is minimally intrusive and will not alarm the patient.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">Activating the <g id="39">New Sleeve Attached</g> option when filling in a new Rx, as described in <x id="40"/>.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="15">This method is minimally intrusive and will not alarm the patient.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">Ativando a opção <g id="39">Nova Luva Anexada</g> ao preencher um novo Rx, conforme descrito em <x id="40"/>.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="15">Este método é minimamente intrusivo e não irá alarmar o paciente.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="14" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">678641558</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">V8rkCpLdrjIr72gKbpMqOv2VVO+bYvXP504wY6KH3VA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="15" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/09/2019 19:46:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/23/2019 00:16:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">591989429</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">E9l5gR9pjxy5da5O3kOfqe+qDKrbQJzDFATP34t88HQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0f19562b-ac16-4187-a9b9-a7f65dba8440"><source>Pressing either of the wand buttons or tapping <g id="50">OK</g> when prompted, when trying to access Scan mode <x id="51"/>, as described in <x id="52"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="16">Pressing either of the wand buttons or tapping <g id="50">OK</g> when prompted, when trying to access Scan mode <x id="51"/>, as described in <x id="52"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="16">Pressionando qualquer um dos botões do leitor ou tocando em <g id="50">OK</g> quando solicitado, ao tentar acessar o modo Digitalizar <x id="51"/> conforme descrito em <x id="52"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="16" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/20/2024 11:29:45</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:36:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1521506786</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">XMhjix8b869mILQ4ZCJ8V8l3S5ZtwNrV3fJtKZJ1Adg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="763db7a4-354d-429d-be4e-42dd9d88edc2"><source>Failure to confirm a new sleeve will block you from starting a new scan.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17">Failure to confirm a new sleeve will block you from starting a new scan.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17">A não confirmação de uma nova<mrk mtype="x-sdl-location" mid="4d9ab95b-bbf7-43ad-9bf9-68ebd5a21041"/> ponteira impedirá que você inicie uma nova digitalização.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="17" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="94"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="94"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">hLW2JaWw0jZew8AJCsnOIDxbRT8BSyqaPoz5HySrpUY=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:04:42</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">hLW2JaWw0jZew8AJCsnOIDxbRT8BSyqaPoz5HySrpUY=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 16:37:32</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-2038839151</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="256cd611-0f6b-48a4-be05-f36c27f187ee"><source>Both methods of sleeve confirmation are documented in the log file, which contains the name of the user who confirmed the new sleeve, as well as the timestamp.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18">Both methods of sleeve confirmation are documented in the log file, which contains the name of the user who confirmed the new sleeve, as well as the timestamp.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18">Ambos os métodos de confirmação <mrk mtype="x-sdl-location" mid="c65b0dd5-7304-42cb-aefd-d9fac47f3dd3"/>de ponteira estão documentados no arquivo de log, que contém o nome do usuário que confirmou a nova <mrk mtype="x-sdl-location" mid="fd48e62a-8992-4ea8-a54e-374a8736dc69"/>ponteira, bem como a marca temporal.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="18" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="95"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="95"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">WIDj74p0Qq3tNiPB+QaqRs8ij1c5EY20gIPk0KwVlfw=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:05:17</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">WIDj74p0Qq3tNiPB+QaqRs8ij1c5EY20gIPk0KwVlfw=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 16:37:44</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-37029659</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="9a0be0d0-9dc3-4e13-917c-982491528b88"><source><g id="67"><g id="65">Note:</g> The following sections describing the sleeve confirmation in the software are not relevant for iTero Element 5D Plus Lite systems.</g></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19"><g id="67"><g id="65">Note:</g> The following sections describing the sleeve confirmation in the software are not relevant for iTero Element 5D Plus Lite systems.</g></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="19" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">VMl5sRrnSTN6WUh9eNx9NFIH0nJ37n4OdLA4X1F2Hq4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="14"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="49625929-9ebb-466a-ae06-79a895455dcd"><source>Confirming the new sleeve when filling in the Rx</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">Confirming the new sleeve when filling in the Rx</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">Confirmando a nova ponteira ao preencher o Rx</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="20" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="91"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="91"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">p1l/e6W/RI111BZVsHKI9p/8o+QEzlo2UUWOBMiUHMM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:05:01</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">p1l/e6W/RI111BZVsHKI9p/8o+QEzlo2UUWOBMiUHMM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 16:37:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1962974242</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="84f09fca-e30c-4c68-bbcb-6f490fba1c0e"><source>In the <g id="78">New Scan</g> window, turn on the <g id="81">New Sleeve Attached</g> toggle to confirm that a new sleeve is attached to the wand.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">In the <g id="78">New Scan</g> window, turn on the <g id="81">New Sleeve Attached</g> toggle to confirm that a new sleeve is attached to the wand.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">Na janela <g id="78">Nova Digitalização</g>, ative o botão de alternância <g id="81">Nova Ponteira Anexada</g> para confirmar que uma nova ponteira está conectada ao leitor.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="21" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="96"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="96"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">+4n31OkR9+4y33zBTKAiLK3VNVHsDpd/p3lTE0HFJ78=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:09:42</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">+4n31OkR9+4y33zBTKAiLK3VNVHsDpd/p3lTE0HFJ78=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-577327094</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a795e26a-7a9b-4553-b99c-e4b84f1864fe"><source>Confirming that a new sleeve is attached</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">Confirming that a new sleeve is attached</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">Confirmando que uma nova ponteira<mrk mtype="x-sdl-location" mid="241cd92a-1322-4cf9-9407-2deec8e6b687"/> está anexada</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="22" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="89"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="89"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">OhOJaP6BpCqUUqt3nvT7PaPDGCslBHSrmt5xS0T6nWE=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:10:04</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">OhOJaP6BpCqUUqt3nvT7PaPDGCslBHSrmt5xS0T6nWE=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 16:38:02</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-500024122</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="53f53ec5-9af6-470e-9f6c-166465eb8447"><source>If the <g id="88">New Sleeve Attached</g> toggle is turned on, you will not see any further messages and are able to scan upon entry to Scan mode.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">If the <g id="88">New Sleeve Attached</g> toggle is turned on, you will not see any further messages and are able to scan upon entry to Scan mode.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">Se o botão de alternância <g id="88">Nova Ponteira Anexada</g> estiver ativado, você não verá mais nenhuma mensagem e poderá digitalizar ao entrar no modo Digitalizar.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="23" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-403932147</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">54/C2EWtbDSPYmLXClajAtsE7JghB89P9hiidI97GaU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="15"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2b900739-cc53-4d43-8559-3996fee7f1a3"><source>If the <g id="95">New Sleeve Attached</g> toggle is not turned on, you will be blocked from accessing Scan mode and will have to confirm the new sleeve, as described in the following section.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">If the <g id="95">New Sleeve Attached</g> toggle is not turned on, you will be blocked from accessing Scan mode and will have to confirm the new sleeve, as described in the following section.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">Se o botão de alternância <g id="95">Nova Ponteira Anexada</g> não estiver ativado, você será impedido de acessar o modo Digitalizar e precisará confirmar a nova ponteira, conforme descrito na seção a seguir.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="24" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="97"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="97"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">8r7gpXHRxSBHa7wWG8+lENFVvEBX4nqNukd4BN8OYMo=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:10:17</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">8r7gpXHRxSBHa7wWG8+lENFVvEBX4nqNukd4BN8OYMo=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 16:38:47</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">2049519995</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="14"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0a1bc921-a8d5-463a-9382-5c105b4b15b5"><source>Confirming the new sleeve when accessing Scan mode</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Confirming the new sleeve when accessing Scan mode</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Confirmando a nova ponteira ao acessar o modo Digitalizar</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="25" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="90"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="90"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">tvBe08Qz491lovKyyY9qU4aZm9PRC7IuYH5x8ouqHWY=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:10:50</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">tvBe08Qz491lovKyyY9qU4aZm9PRC7IuYH5x8ouqHWY=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 16:39:02</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-73028620</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="cc8b8f91-590f-43c0-8512-c77ef4eb4e61"><source>If you did not turn on the <g id="103">New Sleeve Attached</g> toggle when filling in the new Rx, the following message is displayed when tapping the Scan tool <x id="104"/>:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26">If you did not turn on the <g id="103">New Sleeve Attached</g> toggle when filling in the new Rx, the following message is displayed when tapping the Scan tool <x id="104"/>:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26">Se você não ativou o botão de alternância <g id="103">Nova Ponteira Anexada</g> ao preencher o novo Rx, a seguinte mensagem será exibida ao tocar na ferramenta Digitalizar <x id="104"/>:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="26" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">853614666</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">lK91RrCPSfVIq0H+W3C1MNUJ4ENsTI54pRZ4xG3WqJQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3e0dafce-a755-4794-bc22-c3980b0aebbc"><source>Popup confirmation message before scanning</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27">Popup confirmation message before scanning</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27">Mensagem pop-up de confirmação antes da digitalização</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="27" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/11/2019 14:55:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/23/2019 00:23:16</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">17013125</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ePB0e/MuJ1r0JEmvgAgo0daADPEAxvTlKDu8FHSGz38=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0e5d121b-6cae-4f3e-9d52-cc2dfd455465"><source>You are blocked from scanning until you tap <g id="110">OK</g> on the screen or press either of the wand buttons.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28">You are blocked from scanning until you tap <g id="110">OK</g> on the screen or press either of the wand buttons.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28">Você fica impedido de digitalizar até tocar em <g id="110">OK</g> na tela ou de pressionar qualquer um dos botões do leitor.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="28" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl: