/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d6c2dcff-b339-41f2-a876-6590710092b6"><source>The <g id="5">Study Model/iRecord</g> procedure requires a simple scan without any additional modification.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">The <g id="5">Study Model/iRecord</g> procedure requires a simple scan without any additional modification.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">O procedimento <g id="5">Modelo de Estudo/iRecord</g> requer uma digitalização simples sem qualquer modificação adicional.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1793579598</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">fIbWWeaMy746UKcInpgU3FLHSItXkXNWaUawUDQZ+Do=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="f910c1d0-ab4b-4b2c-a27f-83ad7c7566c4"><source>If you are an Invisalign doctor, all scans will be uploaded to the Invisalign Doctor Site and will be available in the ClinCheck software.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">If you are an Invisalign doctor, all scans will be uploaded to the Invisalign Doctor Site and will be available in the ClinCheck software.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Se você for um dentista Invisalign, todas as digitalizações serão enviadas para o site Invisalign Doctor e estarão disponíveis no software ClinCheck.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 11:24:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 00:44:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2137623671</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">HDfzF8POL38dp0mRoMxZT1icw8ME5PKNLE+P6uGFJlA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="1ea5eef3-d191-489b-8c98-f5fefa2d4025"><source>To fill in the Rx for a Study Model/iRecord procedure:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">To fill in the Rx for a Study Model/iRecord procedure:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Para preencher o Rx para um procedimento Modelo de Estudo/iRecord:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 11:25:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 00:44:33</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">48246460</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">8GhditpXwvGd6k269/M1i+sloIT+Fg4L9/OdU0/BQYY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="58873a16-e3ad-4090-ba49-bc8b48426f65"><source>In the <g id="17">Order</g> area, select <g id="20">Study Model/iRecord</g> from the <g id="23">Procedure</g> drop-down list.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">In the <g id="17">Order</g> area, select <g id="20">Study Model/iRecord</g> from the <g id="23">Procedure</g> drop-down list.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Na área <g id="17">Pedido</g>, selecione <g id="20">Modelo de Estudo/iRecord</g> na lista suspensa <g id="23">Procedimento</g>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="7" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">794339438</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">3UD8emJfMVuFMbe0i7hiHgmtS8kRkpg58XHNBNhMvWg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="55558bf7-c179-473e-8c57-6ef2cbce27f7"><source>The <g id="35">New Scan</g> window <x id="36"/>is displayed as follows:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">The <g id="35">New Scan</g> window <x id="36"/>is displayed as follows:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">A janela<x id="36"/> <g id="35">Nova Digitalização</g> é exibida da seguinte forma:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="8" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:54:43</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1797852411</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">o5YfHJ6kVQAJCSRtfNHIErNzPkRog3zf8yWpNQDKROU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt