ource><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">rvZYA9sOD321hmbs/kMkhqHcqsrIhN5guZt4imLOGmg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ccca1c96-2315-4dcf-99da-b2b18b26e7fd"><source>Subject to regulatory or other required approvals and commercial availability in your country/region.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Subject to regulatory or other required approvals and commercial availability in your country/region.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:rep id="UERZFX5+98MTR8WdcBMUnldH2rv3SakCX8uhGZlpMrY="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">UERZFX5+98MTR8WdcBMUnldH2rv3SakCX8uhGZlpMrY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="b606a7d3-4429-4c7f-81d8-aad0ede23967"><source>Filling in the Rx</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Filling in the Rx</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Preenchendo o Rx</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="Source"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/09/2019 12:15:45</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/22/2019 14:45:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">676506546</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Yndx+U90Z8ltS3RUboaOroXlFZ8BEra0cu9R4YBUaGw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="948ec584-4f2d-44b3-8187-38c62c8a63a2"><source>The first step in the scanning process is filling in the Rx (prescription) form.<x id="19"/><x id="22"/><g id="29"> The <g id="27">New Scan</g> window has a simple, intuitive workflow that covers all </g><x id="30"/><g id="33">orthodontic procedures or applications.</g></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">The first step in the scanning process is filling in the Rx (prescription) form.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6"><x id="19"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7"><x id="22"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8"><g id="29"> The <g id="27">New Scan</g> window has a simple, intuitive workflow that covers all </g><x id="30"/><g id="33">orthodontic procedures or applications.</g></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">A primeira etapa do processo de digitalização é preencher o formulário Rx (prescrição).</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6"><x id="19"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7"><x id="22"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8"><g id="29">A janela <g id="27">Nova Digitalização</g> tem um fluxo de trabalho simples e intuitivo que abrange todo os </g><x id="30"/><g id="33">procedimentos e aplicações ortodônticos .</g></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/04/2022 12:26:32</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:47:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1208075110</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">4/uRAz9IxmT0P+JvKMMYAs1URDc+zJ6eWcmrpbfIbZA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="7" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="8" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:54:43</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">99619166</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">a69ZrNCKPvAy4PPpczBfffiXxAdkgcGzSFYHMXyfy7s=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0c4e548a-c18b-4d8b-87bc-9e0de5cfb3db"><source>After entering the patient details, you can enter the details about the required procedure and procedure type, if relevant, <g id="42">select whether to include NIRI data in the scan, </g>as well as enter notes for the lab regarding the scan.Fields marked with a red asterisk are mandatory before scanning.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">After entering the patient details, you can enter the details about the required procedure and procedure type, if relevant, <g id="42">select whether to include NIRI data in the scan, </g>as well as enter notes for the lab regarding the scan.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Fields marked with a red asterisk are mandatory before scanning.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">Após inserir os detalhes do paciente, caso seja relevante, você pode inserir os detalhes sobre o procedimento necessário e o tipo de procedimento, assim como inserir notas para o laboratório sobre a digitalização. <g id="42">Selecione se você deseja incluir dados NIRI na digitalização.</g></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Antes de realizar a digitalização, é obrigatório preencher os campos marcados com um asterisco vermelho.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="9" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="82"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">SB2uP+PS5mgE+FhZcyz8ePsINlKgnYL8+LkdPBM6XYc=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:26:53</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">SB2uP+PS5mgE+FhZcyz8ePsINlKgnYL8+LkdPBM6XYc=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/29/2024 03:57:21</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">SB2uP+PS5mgE+FhZcyz8ePsINlKgnYL8+LkdPBM6XYc=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl