K1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="27" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="20"/><sdl:cxt id="21"/><sdl:cxt id="22"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="dac16e7b-dd35-4bf2-a7fd-00184b1a491e"><source><g id="115">Study Model/iRecord:</g> A simple scan with no additional modification, which can be used for the fabrication of restorative devices (full crown, onlay, inlay, implant-based, and bridge) and for studying purposes and referencing, instead of storing the plaster model as required by law.It can also be scanned as iCast, and is available on your Invisalign Doctor Site.For more information, see <x id="118"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28"><g id="115">Study Model/iRecord:</g> A simple scan with no additional modification, which can be used for the fabrication of restorative devices (full crown, onlay, inlay, implant-based, and bridge) and for studying purposes and referencing, instead of storing the plaster model as required by law.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">It can also be scanned as iCast, and is available on your Invisalign Doctor Site.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">For more information, see <x id="118"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28"><g id="115">Modelo de Estudo/iRecord:</g> uma digitalização simples, sem modificação adicional, que pode ser utilizada para a fabricação de aparelhos restauradores (coroa completa, onlay, inlay, baseados em implantes e ponte) e para fins de estudo e referência, em vez de armazenar o modelo de gesso, conforme exigido por lei.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">Também pode ser digitalizado como iCast e está disponível no site do Invisalign Doctor.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">Para mais informações, consulte.<x id="118"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="28" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/04/2024 14:10:45</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:54:43</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">655686592</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">P0yjGna7/JZa3IlDqWy0fD9JyK68pEf4w2nsdA3rP2w=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="29" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/04/2022 12:54:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/04/2022 12:54:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1058710447</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">+M6N3ydqGrLVaOWjqofdfLGpfJtySd7+w1yaC/+Jg90=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="30" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id=