tails</g> area.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="53">Depending on the procedure and procedure type selected, enter the relevant details in the additional areas that are displayed, for example, the <g id="282">Tooth Diagram</g> area or the <g id="285">Denture Details</g> area.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="53"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="53" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">3l8whAo8mlbH21lLjwuc+z4ifhCJhamV2nrNKNnibSI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="39461362-9e63-4977-80d7-458e5b32102c"><source>Tap <x id="288"/> on the toolbar to move to Scan mode to scan the patient, as described in <x id="289"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="54">Tap <x id="288"/> on the toolbar to move to Scan mode to scan the patient, as described in <x id="289"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="54">Toque em <x id="288"/> na barra de ferramenta para passar para o modo Digitalizar para digitalizar o paciente, conforme descrito em <x id="289"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="54" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="Source"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-685656250</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">aZCDYGZTHvGH0tx3qoKUQqFtjIl3ahsKKafkT/jduIk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\Resources\PageLayouts\2-Col.flpgl.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2"