magnetic radiation </g> <x id="128"/> - When used as directed, the iTero scanner’s level of electromagnetic radiation is similar to that of a personal computer<x id="129"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="88"><g id="127">Electromagnetic radiation </g> <x id="128"/> - When used as directed, the iTero scanner’s level of electromagnetic radiation is similar to that of a personal computer<x id="129"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="88"><g id="127">Radiação eletromagnética </g> <x id="128"/> - Quando usado conforme as instruções, o nível de radiação eletromagnética do scanner iTero é semelhante ao de um computador pessoal<x id="129"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="88" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:03</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">734323998</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">nzhF+Nn3gegHGdx6l9CQtEhN2XU6MPY429w1sCVcE7c=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="33"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2cd9a674-6615-499a-9d3b-7230cc894ef8"><source><g id="135">Laser and LED radiation</g> - When used as directed, the iTero scanner’s level of Laser and LED radiation is incapable of producing damage to eyes or other human tissue and complies with International standards IEC 62471 and IEC 60825-1.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="89"><g id="135">Laser and LED radiation</g> - When used as directed, the iTero scanner’s level of Laser and LED radiation is incapable of producing damage to eyes or other human tissue and complies with International standards IEC 62471 and IEC 6082