red to read and understand these safety instructions.</g></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="253"><x id="316"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="254"><x id="319"/> <g id="322">Antes de utilizar o sistema, todos os usuários devem ler e compreender estas instruções de segurança.</g></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="253" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="254" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/04/2024 21:33:07</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1513725302</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">JBrfHeS4deiZweCSiFWfwfT5PLhyTmxojCVfu6nOT3Q=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="44"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="fdea5d03-a938-4ceb-81ec-b66318a2020f"><source>CAUTION ­­</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="255">CAUTION ­­</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="255"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="255" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Wb03zKfLJI3A7jNXBSl/NWCImemakdC5FvPDhKTmf9Y=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="45"/><sdl:cxt id="46"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ade4116a-f45b-4eed-af2a-04569c17381f"><source><x id="324"/><x id="327"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="256"><x id="324"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="257"><x id="327"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="256"><x id="324"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="257"><x id="327"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="256" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="257" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="47"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="009f89f2-8a6d-440c-a7eb-665e7a252f8b"><source>Laser and LED safety</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="258">Laser and LED safety</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="258">Segurança do laser e LED</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="258" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1961439707</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">GnmNzgua3nrhMmZ/RlF2vGd46lSBT7+MznpYeV+ij9Q=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="48"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d5889eb3-946a-4365-8e23-db1d3d4139c9"><source>The <x id="330"/> wand is classified as a class 1 laser product per IEC 60825-1, Safety of laser products, and Group 1 per IEC 62471, Photobiological safety of lamp and lamp systems (LED).</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="259">The <x id="330"/> wand is classified as a class 1 laser product per IEC 60825-1, Safety of laser products, and Group 1 per IEC 62471, Photobiological safety of lamp and lamp systems (LED).</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="259">O leitor do <x id="330"/> é classificado como produto a Laser de Classe 1 conforme a norma IEC 62471 de Segurança fotobiológica de lâmpadas e sistemas de lâmpadas (LED).</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="259" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/04/2024 21:34:55</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-255860854</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">pBlNztGLya0JdgDn7DsQLZ0WnQum8pBUlDPXY/m3coQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="48"/><sdl:cxt id="49"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0f699931-b89b-4145-b3c1-d5b14022529a"><source><g id="336">Warning:</g> Avoid eye contact with the laser beam or the flickering white LED emission.Eye contact could cause damage to the eyes.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="260"><g id="336">Warning:</g> Avoid eye contact with the laser beam or the flickering white LED emission.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="261">Eye contact could cause damage to the eyes.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="260"><g id="336">Aviso:</g> evite contato visual com o feixe de laser ou com a emissão piscante do LED branco.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="261">O contato visual pode provocar danos aos olhos.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="260" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/04/2024 21:39:16</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1894108650</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">AMvsww1s/b3VCu69N2QV8mVGyV56WgqABZU5PSlu5KY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="261" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/28/2020 15:56:59</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/22/2020 07:25:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">361065561</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">wKv2gf2se9VfEbeCTwM0rej3SDOm8zp4LjJ9T531AM8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="48"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="17a1c089-f932-4816-8f55-107c26244568"><source><g id="344">Warning:</g> Avoid activating the wand while the tip of the wand is outside the patient’s mouth, in order to reduce the risk of eye damage.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="262"><g id="344">Warning:</g> Avoid activating the wand while the tip of the wand is outside the patient’s mouth, in order to reduce the risk of eye damage.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="262"><g id="344">Aviso:</g> evite ativar o leitor enquanto a ponteira do leitor estiver fora da boca do paciente, para reduzir o risco de danos aos olhos.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="262" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/04/2024 21:42:37</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1470430194</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ynV9Pa2KqQRQ3/wdXU77H8+f8MxG/NLRGxkq2d0qA5c=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="50"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="05c2bfd3-7003-4ae8-94af-26389f197f9d"><source><g id="350">Warning:</g> In order to prevent eye contact:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="263"><g id="350">Warning:</g> In order to prevent eye contact:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="263"><g id="350">Aviso:</g> para evitar contato com os olhos:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="263" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/04/2024 21:43:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2022944360</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">vPbfrKG4154exJUjUaUAo9SxC5ery+IrkrI2luuVgyg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="51"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ffe7b221-355d-4fc0-9242-c93022971ed5"><source>Avoid shining the wand directly into anyone&apos;s eyes.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="264">Avoid shining the wand directly into anyone&apos;s eyes.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="264">Evite que o brilho emitido pelo leitor seja direcionado aos olhos de alguém.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="264" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="YLHUOG6CvLOoNbtxzdP6Q2M+lhDBOqqeYbv7/r2yO/g="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1862371102</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YLHUOG6CvLOoNbtxzdP6Q2M+lhDBOqqeYbv7/r2yO/g=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="51"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="79546e34-7a67-4ac7-842a-fe1cd30287a7"><source>Avoid activating the wand while the tip of the wand is outside the patient&apos;s mouth.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="265">Avoid activating the wand while the tip of the wand is outside the patient&apos;s mouth.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="265">Evite ativar o leitor enquanto a ponteira do leitor estiver fora da boca do paciente.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="265" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1942390876</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">jM9Ml0YWhDpXNLDoEhXHVzrYafIWZsRB2MfpWP7D2n4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="51"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="47404066-14df-4e23-9586-ddc9b80119e7"><source>Avoid placing the wand in the cradle while the scanning operation is still active.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="266">Avoid placing the wand in the cradle while the scanning operation is still active.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="266">Evite colocar o leitor no suporte enquanto a operação de digitalização ainda estiver ativa.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="266" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/06/2019 21:01:57</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/22/2019 17:12:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-25904749</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">hYGEl3MLWhEFxniX91i4X2XEd00puq1DzWJ4BbZVTKY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="51"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5882bad9-fa4a-4184-8c17-5ee42a062329"><source>Place the wand in the cradle with the optical window facing the cradle.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="267">Place the wand in the cradle with the optical window facing the cradle.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="267">Coloque o leitor no suporte com a janela óptica voltada para o suporte.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="267" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1358703639</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">teAHGbXM4qJkPlbORL8FK4/WLin4EkbUKK3UQyonPwE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="48"/><sdl:cxt id="49"/><sdl:cxt id="52"/><sdl:cxt id="53"/><sdl:cxt id="54"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="98c3332c-8229-418f-916f-c72f88f2a3f9"><source><x id="357"/><x id="360"/><x id="362"/>The wand emits blue laser light (450nm Class 1), green laser light (520nm Class 1), as well as white LED emissions and NIRI illumination, operating at 850nm pulsed illumination.Avoid shining the wand directly into anyone&apos;s eyes.<x id="365"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="268"><x id="357"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="269"><x id="360"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="270"><x id="362"/>The wand emits blue laser light (450nm Class 1), green laser light (520nm Class 1), as well as white LED emissions and NIRI illumination, operating at 850nm pulsed illumination.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="271">Avoid shining the wand directly into anyone&apos;s eyes.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="272"><x id="365"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="268"><x id="357"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="269"><x id="360"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="270"><x id="362"/>O leitor emite laser de luz azul (450 nm Classe 1), laser de luz verde (520 nm Classe 1), bem como emissões brancas de LED e iluminação NIRI, operando  em iluminação pulsada de 850nm,.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="271">Evite que o brilho emitido pelo leitor seja direcionado aos olhos de alguém.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="272"><x id="365"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="268" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="269" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="270" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="79"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="79"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">cczsu1O87neMd1PoSWjCrBkZntoU/klqr0gBYWPNHZA=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:35:42</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">cczsu1O87neMd1PoSWjCrBkZntoU/klqr0gBYWPNHZA=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1939398987</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="271" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="YLHUOG6CvLOoNbtxzdP6Q2M+lhDBOqqeYbv7/r2yO/g="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1862371102</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YLHUOG6CvLOoNbtxzdP6Q2M+lhDBOqqeYbv7/r2yO/g=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="272" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="e91e3641-5d25-4d20-a768-5e69715c696e"><source>Power supply</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="273">Power supply</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="273">Fonte de energia</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="273" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="7WIMe4x3SJLxPxWqe/r9KErqNfjH7WQ1mIhjDiRF6zI="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/06/2019 20:32:39</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-689643742</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">7WIMe4x3SJLxPxWqe/r9KErqNfjH7WQ1mIhjDiRF6zI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="55"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="200f50c0-88b9-4aab-b9f7-3534dcf6d984"><source>Power is supplied to the system via a medical-grade power supply.In <x id="375"/> cart-configuration scanners, the power supply is enclosed in the base of the wheel stand.In <x id="377"/> mobile-configuration scanners, the power supply is external.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="274">Power is supplied to the system via a medical-grade power supply.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="275">In <x id="375"/> cart-configuration scanners, the power supply is enclosed in the base of the wheel stand.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="276">In <x id="377"/> mobile-configuration scanners, the power supply is external.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="274">A energia é fornecida ao sistema através de um alimentador de nível médico.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="275">Nos scanners de configuração com carrinho do <x id="375"/>, a fonte de alimentação está contida na base do suporte com rodas.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="276">Nos scanners <x id="377"/> de configuração móvel, a fonte de alimentação é externa.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="274" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/31/2022 14:14:57</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/31/2022 14:14:57</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">328680274</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">8ee1SwW3oNZIGpW32xroFw5ATsKnpz2lYL/4UxdVvn4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="275" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:28:02</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1367604479</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">V39z5HIPJmEAXJD/LLqiFLBKrQmj+M1YGGJda3kG5R8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="276" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:28:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">822531515</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">eVafx2CRI0fN9C4T8xB9ej35xP6i6uu1jmIlV/oCyYw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="56"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="fdf942ec-0534-4b41-90c3-4de802a87949"><source>Battery power</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="277">Battery power</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="277">Potência da bateria</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="277" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/06/2019 20:22:47</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/31/2020 17:44:27</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">821217197</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ZrQRzvN6fHWHQPcLU1pAu6fCFZi9Gqqra76ABHK2oPY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="57"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="425d1f27-dcce-42cc-85df-be3726f03d7f"><source>Charging – the scanner battery will be fully charged after being plugged into a power source for <x id="388"/>2.5 hours<x id="389"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="278">Charging – the scanner battery will be fully charged after being plugged into a power source for <x id="388"/>2.5 hours<x id="389"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="278">Carregamento – A bateria do scanner estará totalmente carregada após ser conectada a uma fonte de energia por <x id="388"/>2,5 horas<x id="389"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="278" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/15/2020 09:34:59</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1610477414</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">1glEZkMD0Q6L/vnsPtX3uB35H6vP6O9fSMYcT3mbpmQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="58"/><sdl:cxt id="59"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="207f5766-f079-4695-b4c4-34bd227bf260"><source>With a fully-charged battery, you can scan for up to 30 minutes using the <g id="395">wheel-stand or </g>cart-configuration scanner, or 10 minutes using the mobile-configuration scanner.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="279">With a fully-charged battery, you can scan for up to 30 minutes using the <g id="395">wheel-stand or </g>cart-configuration scanner, or 10 minutes using the mobile-configuration scanner.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="279"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="279" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Sj1e2Yo47Ha6i6In714LYCdSZKRm4luCp/r2MyIJ8gc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="60"/><sdl:cxt id="59"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="05bb1570-31ff-4a01-9cbd-d81382688c63"><source>A fully-charged battery supports a total of 30 minutes scanning using the cart-configuration scanner, or 10 minutes using the mobile-configuration scanner.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="280">A fully-charged battery supports a total of 30 minutes scanning using the cart-configuration scanner, or 10 minutes using the mobile-configuration scanner.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="280">Uma bateria totalmente carregada suporta um total de 30 minutos de digitalização usando o scanner de configuração de carrinho, ou 10 minutos usando o scanner de configuração móvel.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="280" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1012158708</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">4n34PEzX9Y86NLM