x id="862"/> <g id="865">Somente para configuração com carrinho: </g>não remova a unidade de computação do suporte.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="408" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:05</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1180157541</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">OjZbnB4xwlzTrXyrc7ls0Fx5R1wWjuE7xB/jiDOTheE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="79"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="e60bb30e-dfed-47e0-8287-a2819022c2c8"><source>Follow the instructions to store the wand (probe) tip under proper conditions, as described in <x id="867"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="409">Follow the instructions to store the wand (probe) tip under proper conditions, as described in <x id="867"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="409">Siga as instruções para armazenar a ponta do leitor (ponteira) em condições adequadas, conforme descrito em <x id="867"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="409" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:05</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2124764566</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">bqyWvXNvog2Zcaa7pmJF3xE2xIO1AxlHerQxORe8SPY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="79"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="9fdbdbe9-e8e1-41cc-938c-e2110bb5b1fe"><source>Follow the instructions to properly clean and disinfect the device, as described in <x id="869"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="410">Follow the instructions to properly clean and disinfect the device, as described in <x id="869"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="410">Siga as instruções para limpar e desinfetar adequadamente o dispositivo, conforme descrito em <x id="869"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="410" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:05</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">344358930</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">g3Vbjh59A73OT7G/BD82l0xDjOSolRdaZP++yHIBnK8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="79"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ae738e27-b986-4fd6-b119-0e2a37130521"><source>Follow the instructions to properly maintain and handle the instrument in the specified manner and condition, as described in <x id="871"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="411">Follow the instructions to properly maintain and handle the instrument in the specified manner and condition, as described in <x id="871"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="411">Siga as instruções para conservar e manusear adequadamente o instrumento de forma e condição especificadas, conforme descrito em <x id="871"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="411" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent=