you notice any damage, do not use the iTero Lumina sleeves and contact Customer Support.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="419"><g id="912">Warning:</g> If you notice any damage, do not use the iTero Lumina sleeves and contact Customer Support.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="419"><g id="912">Aviso:</g> se você perceber algum dano, não use as ponteiras do Tero Lumina e entre em contato com o Suporte ao Cliente.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="419" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="86"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="86"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">aiAEvOmS6uqKd8STPdURJcuu4afM1xsKtTuK0QWysqU=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:44:11</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">aiAEvOmS6uqKd8STPdURJcuu4afM1xsKtTuK0QWysqU=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 16:46:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1605608866</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="108"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="8f40d10a-fa17-46c0-9228-26d28c53634d"><source>iTero Lumina sleeves are supplied as non-sterile and should <g id="919">not</g> be sterilized before usage.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="420">iTero Lumina sleeves are supplied as non-sterile and should <g id="919">not</g> be sterilized before usage.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="420">As ponteiras do iTero Lumina são fornecidas sem esterilização prévia e <g id="919">não</g> devem ser esterilizadas antes do uso.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="420" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="84"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="84"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">A+FKUIgvb497wMt0HcpJ1PPZk5nLAxH+wq/AVYV4hdg=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:44:44</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">A+FKUIgvb497wMt0HcpJ1PPZk5nLAxH+wq/AVYV4hdg=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 16:46:27</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1121956006</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="108"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="29f4c9f9-eb76-483a-adc1-47a6ac292d79"><source>iTero Lumina sleeves comply with the applicable parts of ISO 10993 Biocompatibility international standard.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="421">iTero Lumina sleeves comply with the applicable parts of ISO 10993 Biocompatibility international standard.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="421">As ponteiras do iTero Lumina estão em conformidade com as partes aplicáveis do Padrão internacional de biocompatibilidade ISO 10993.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="421" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="82"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="82"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">kCU1Hxm1cTDqRHcw0XJoYMrnNLvfVhRUkRLcErY6Yi0=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:45:44</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">kCU1Hxm1cTDqRHcw0XJoYMrnNLvfVhRUkRLcErY6Yi0=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_m