quot;&amp;gt;&lt;/bpt&gt;If you have a laptop- or mobile-configuration scanner, the wand should be stored in the supplied carrying case or trolley, with the protective sleeve attached.&lt;/MadCap:placeholderCondition&gt;" word-end="false">&lt;ph id=&quot;1&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;</ph><props><value key="prefix"></value><value key="localName">ph</value><value key="namespaces"></value><value key="isEmptyElement">False</value><value key="nodeType">Element</value><value key="displayText">&lt;MadCap:placeholderCondition xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&gt;&lt;bpt id=&quot;4&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;MadCap:conditionalText MadCap:conditions=&quot;iTero.Combined_Plus_Element ONLY&quot; xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&amp;gt;&lt;/bpt&gt;If you have a laptop- or mobile-configuration scanner, the wand should be stored in the supplied carrying case or trolley, with the protective sleeve attached.&lt;/MadCap:placeholderCondition&gt;</value><value key="hasDisplayText">True</value><value key="attribute:id">1</value><value key="attribute:xmlns">urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2</value></props></tag><tag id="30"><ph name="&lt;MadCap:placeholderCondition xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&gt;&lt;ept id=&quot;4&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;/MadCap:conditionalText&amp;gt;&lt;/ept&gt;&lt;/MadCap:placeholderCondition&gt;" word-end="false">&lt;ph id=&quot;1&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;</ph><props><value key="prefix"></value><value key="localName">ph</value><value key="namespaces"></value><value key="isEmptyElement">False</value><value key="nodeType">Element</value><value key="displayText">&lt;MadCap:placeholderCondition xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&gt;&lt;ept id=&quot;4&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;/MadCap:conditionalText&amp;gt;&lt;/ept&gt;&lt;/MadCap:placeholderCondition&gt;</value><value key="hasDisplayText">True</value><value key="attribute:id">1</value><value key="attribute:xmlns">urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2</value></props></tag><tag id="31"><ph name="&lt;MadCap:placeholderCondition xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&gt;&lt;bpt id=&quot;5&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;MadCap:conditionalText MadCap:conditions=&quot;iTero.Combined Plus ONLY&quot; xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&amp;gt;&lt;/bpt&gt;If you have a mobile-configuration scanner, the wand should be stored in the supplied trolley with the protective sleeve attached.&lt;ept id=&quot;5&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;/MadCap:conditionalText&amp;gt;&lt;/ept&gt;&lt;/MadCap:placeholderCondition&gt;" word-end="false">&lt;ph id=&quot;1&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;</ph><props><value key="prefix"></value><value key="localName">ph</value><value key="namespaces"></value><value key="isEmptyElement">False</value><value key="nodeType">Element</value><value key="displayText">&lt;MadCap:placeholderCondition xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&gt;&lt;bpt id=&quot;5&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;MadCap:conditionalText MadCap:conditions=&quot;iTero.Combined Plus ONLY&quot; xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&amp;gt;&lt;/bpt&gt;If you have a mobile-configuration scanner, the wand should be stored in the supplied trolley with the protective sleeve attached.&lt;ept id=&quot;5&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;/MadCap:conditionalText&amp;gt;&lt;/ept&gt;&lt;/MadCap:placeholderCondition&gt;</value><value key="hasDisplayText">True</value><value key="attribute:id">1</value><value key="attribute:xmlns">urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2</value></props></tag><tag id="37"><ph name="&lt;MadCap:conditionalText MadCap:conditions=&quot;iTero.Not Lumina&quot; xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&gt;" word-end="false">&lt;bpt id=&quot;1&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;</ph><props><value key="prefix"></value><value key="localName">bpt</value><value key="namespaces"></value><value key="isEmptyElement">False</value><value key="nodeType">Element</value><value key="displayText">&lt;MadCap:conditionalText MadCap:conditions=&quot;iTero.Not Lumina&quot; xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&gt;</value><value key="hasDisplayText">True</value><value key="attribute:id">1</value><value key="attribute:xmlns">urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2</value></props></tag><tag id="40"><ph name="&lt;MadCap:placeholderCondition xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&gt;If the cable cap detaches from the wand, gently reattach it.&lt;ept id=&quot;1&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;/MadCap:conditionalText&amp;gt;&lt;/ept&gt;&lt;/MadCap:placeholderCondition&gt;" word-end="false">&lt;ph id=&quot;1&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;</ph><props><value key="prefix"></value><value key="localName">ph</value><value key="namespaces"></value><value key="isEmptyElement">False</value><value key="nodeType">Element</value><value key="displayText">&lt;MadCap:placeholderCondition xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&gt;If the cable cap detaches from the wand, gently reattach it.&lt;ept id=&quot;1&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;/MadCap:conditionalText&amp;gt;&lt;/ept&gt;&lt;/MadCap:placeholderCondition&gt;</value><value key="hasDisplayText">True</value><value key="attribute:id">1</value><value key="attribute:xmlns">urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2</value></props></tag></tag-defs></header><body><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2a2129fd-9c87-438d-9aac-488061e3ca5d"><source>Wand:Handling</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="1">Wand:Handling</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="1"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="1" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">XWR/wnsH0z7XgD4f5vgB4YM/X0cbbF7t3b15+PfcMEI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="6fc6c090-36f7-496b-a54c-a7ddf0ef7b07"><source>Handling the wand and cable<x id="3"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Handling the wand and cable<x id="3"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Manuseando o leitor e o cabo<x id="3"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:16</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:16</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-700638044</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">NcCs0YsAUqvenABI4sXA/Io9a/kwd8lvbZWGkfSERuw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="82fba351-9b5f-47c4-94e2-791927250710"><source>The wand contains delicate components and should be handled with care.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">The wand contains delicate components and should be handled with care.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">O leitor contém componentes delicados, devendo ser manuseado com cuidado.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">07/21/2020 17:52:27</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">07/21/2020 17:52:27</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">156437756</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YI+9vKhGkYiOqHU77dk1mHbMZ+KSVKzkI3AGdt1cCQk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="372b295b-96be-4891-8e98-a61e28e9d7fc"><source>When not in use, the wand should be kept in its cradle, <g id="21">with the optical surface facing the cradle, and </g>with the <x id="22"/><g id="25">dark</g> protective sleeve attached.<x id="27"/><x id="30"/><x id="31"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">When not in use, the wand should be kept in its cradle, <g id="21">with the optical surface facing the cradle, and </g>with the <x id="22"/><g id="25">dark</g> protective sleeve attached.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5"><x id="27"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6"><x id="30"/><x id="31"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Quando não estiver em uso, o leitor deve ser mantido em seu suporte, <g id="21">com a superfície óptica voltada para o suporte, e </g>com a ponteira protetora <x id="22"/><g id="25">escura</g> acoplada.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5"><x id="27"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6"><x id="30"/><x id="31"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 10:48:05</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:11:13</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">763554874</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">/NIehlaP9qumpwnKFYU2e4cysmPffAcjbZtLbob7VTM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="5Zioq4EY/PhydFhV6TLDNyjbw4s2FodbeKnL1+XGxrU="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:53:33</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:54:20</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1217924312</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">5Zioq4EY/PhydFhV6TLDNyjbw4s2FodbeKnL1+XGxrU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="69c9c1f3-51b6-4e95-ad1d-6e8830203b59"><source>Between patients, undo any twists and knots in the wand cable in order to relieve all tension.<x id="37"/><x id="40"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Between patients, undo any twists and knots in the wand cable in order to relieve all tension.<x id="37"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8"><x id="40"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Entre pacientes, desfaça quaisquer torções e nós no cabo do leitor para aliviar toda a tensão.<x id="37"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8"><x id="40"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="7" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:16</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:16</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">542928472</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">fWJHotsjqSF5esPiZXKX6d3dyhxxvEzCQOEnL6OqaJw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="8" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\11. Care and maintenance\A2.0_Wand_Cleaning and disinfecting_1.htm.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-language="pt-br"><header><reference><internal-file form="base