/sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="796380ca-0074-4234-b0eb-f6a4b3b6f6ef"><source>To avoid false activation of the wand during the cleaning and disinfection procedures, make sure to exit a scan completely by sending the scan or by going back to the home screen.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">To avoid false activation of the wand during the cleaning and disinfection procedures, make sure to exit a scan completely by sending the scan or by going back to the home screen.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Para evitar uma ativação indesejada do leitor durante os procedimentos de limpeza e desinfecção, assegure que você tenha saído completamente de uma digitalização, enviando o caso ou retornando à tela inicial.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 11:01:29</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 00:20:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1029682060</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">tqNVdJz5DFzUpwdaM6GIoP5j9SfEaMjn9/RrqjNgG1w=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="18d37a8f-7668-45db-82a7-41a6b3cc2a3f"><source>Remove the sleeve as described in <x id="2"/>, making sure not to touch the optical surface of the wand.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Remove the sleeve as described in <x id="2"/>, making sure not to touch the optical surface of the wand.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Remova a ponteira, conforme descrito em <x id="2"/>, certificando-se de não tocar na superfície óptica do leitor.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="95"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="95"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">TZIrcvpIAU60l6Fbs7iTanzvm7IJZQgDeuFB0uubzPk=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:47:21</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">TZIrcvpIAU60l6Fbs7iTanzvm7IJZQgDeuFB0uubzPk=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 14:49:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1053374694</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="25adde6d-5316-4e5f-ad2e-e57e4972daa6"><source>Wand without a sleeve</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Wand without a sleeve</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Leitor sem uma ponteira</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ocTQ95c6HVMm4JUAOfH8SBiTtxnsCYtw0DGRlHucmhg=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 14:49:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1895196864</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="1459893c-518a-448a-8cc7-5e54c080deb0"><source>Visually inspect the wand for any noticeable damage, for example, deterioration such as corrosion, discoloration, pitting, or cracks.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Visually inspect the wand for any noticeable damage, for example, deterioration such as corrosion, discoloration, pitting, or cracks.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Inspecione visualmente o leitor para checar se há danos perceptíveis como, por exemplo, deterioração, corrosão, descoloração, furos ou rachaduras.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="2mZDveHoJ1hKAZoBRtwLC4cM4QrnT3cxN5zsNqycDEw="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/09/2020 09:56:44</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/19/2020 19:42:02</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1843770648</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">2mZDveHoJ1hKAZoBRtwLC4cM4QrnT3cxN5zsNqycDEw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d5429a62-d6bf-40fb-a1b6-bf91230abb08"><source>If damage is found, see the <g id="10">Scanner warnings</g> section of the<x id="11"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">If damage is found, see the <g id="10">Scanner warnings</g> section of the<x id="11"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:rep id="nhOnpaPhCY1/cSFwcNc18R5ZlHGNTRIXsIDGOZP2yhQ="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">nhOnpaPhCY1/cSFwcNc18R5ZlHGNTRIXsIDGOZP2yhQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2226c8b2-3ba7-407e-bfcc-a65c14635811"><source>If damage is found, see the <g id="18">Scanner warnings</g> section of the<x id="19"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">If damage is found, see the <g id="18">Scanner warnings</g> section of the<x id="19"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Se for encontrado algum dano, consulte a seção <g id="18">Alertas do scanner</g> nas<x id="19"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="7" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="nhOnpaPhCY1/cSFwcNc18R5ZlHGNTRIXsIDGOZP2yhQ="/><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 10:52:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:11:13</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1121994230</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">nhOnpaPhCY1/cSFwcNc18R5ZlHGNTRIXsIDGOZP2yhQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="b8987084-60df-40ac-964f-a8d507e0d0b6"><source><x id="23"/><x id="26"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8"><x id="23"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9"><x id="26"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8"><x id="23"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9"><x id="26"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="8" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="9" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="