te:</g> When you replace the vent cover, please order an additional vent cover to ensure that you have a spare if needed.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11"><g id="41">Note:</g> When you replace the vent cover, please order an additional vent cover to ensure that you have a spare if needed.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="11" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">fazgGhr2Gmx4yy8nmkZFGv5Et6IDRIOno2TXJ7LOK00=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2717a832-7a7e-48f2-af5a-e03eed79c4b7"><source>Place the <x id="48"/><g id="51">dark</g> protective sleeve on the wand tip.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">Place the <x id="48"/><g id="51">dark</g> protective sleeve on the wand tip.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">Coloque a ponteira protetora <x id="48"/><g id="51">escura</g> na ponta do leitor.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="12" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 11:17:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:11:13</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">548963105</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">+lc/i0BwH+LNNqdqMbCepMi3CrSSXzZw3GATrNRbiI8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="9ed2eab9-dcdf-4234-950f-0a95eb16ecc1"><source>Place the wand in the cleaned and disinfected cradle, as described in <x id="53"/>, below.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">Place the wand in the cleaned and disinfected cradle, as described in <x id="53"/>, below.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">Coloque o leitor no suporte limpo e desinfetado conforme descrito na <x id="53"/>, abaixo.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="13" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:16</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:16</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1880456238</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">qzOxADtbAZUT2oad+ebgYOVbHcPWMkiuQ5JL1b4Pj98=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="16"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="b724d726-b7b9-46bf-a687-3f327b04ea7e"><source>If you have a <g id="68">mobile configuration scanner, </g><g id="71">laptop- or mobile-configuration scanner, </g>store the wand in the <g id="74">carrying case or trolley</g><g id="77">trolley</g> when not in use.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">If you have a <g id="68">mobile configuration scanner, </g><g id="71">laptop- or mobile-configuration scanner, </g>store the wand in the <g id="74">carrying case or trolley</g><g id="77">trolley</g> when not in use.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="14" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">9xzCdZa/URpj/1znQGEW0AwysIPLcSU+OSryrbhJ9ko=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="17"/><sdl:cxt id="18"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="32c787e0-1b43-42b0-996b-c5366a30b5d0"><source>Removing and replacing the wand vent cover</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="15">Removing and replacing the wand vent cover</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="15"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="15" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">j/taxPSVaNNPsK8CpqksInLM3prsoBq7CllKHEpXfAk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="19"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2158972a-838a-4755-9c33-cfcfe18d7068"><source>Remove the protective sleeve from the wand.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="16">Remove the protective sleeve from the wand.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="16"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="16" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">v2Odmcp/2BzPIUG21uGarf152F/retdcnomTQWv4e8c=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="19"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3e283475-c1a2-4532-bebb-3232630c003f"><source>Press both dimples on the wand vent cover to release the locking snaps, and then pull the vent cover towards the tip of the wand and gently remove it.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17">Press both dimples on the wand vent cover to release the locking snaps, and then pull the vent cover towards the tip of the wand and gently remove it.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="17" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Er1mPGm0fImhw+w5hp9BJ6JJeOpxPLrewdYWfpt0jYU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="19"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="278b45b9-f426-4e20-93cc-b7e5637508b7"><source>Release and remove the vent cover</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18">Release and remove the vent cover</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="18" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">72mGHKe/9wQbvr0UeaM2GH86pbDw9UkT7hR+N1juLbE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="19"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a6cafa6c-aeff-407d-bb36-6f5579ef91bf"><source>Gently insert the tip of the wand into a new vent cover, making sure that the vent cover dimples are aligned towards the top of the wand.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">Gently insert the tip of the wand into a new vent cover, making sure that the vent cover dimples are aligned towards the top of the wand.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="19" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">fZsfeyjTOLv149uxNucbISsiQcx5swepukGeQWq+hmo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="19"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="4bf3d657-1022-4e12-9487-ca80240a0df5"><source>Insert the tip of the wand into the new vent cover</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">Insert the tip of the wand into the new vent cover</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="20" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">vzSUWjSZ1ocG1LLsuJkNOwMSh/5WHhnQpoWuCbWXolY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="19"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="78a8a5cb-59f4-4d17-a116-a35253dff404"><source>Pull on the vent cover until it locks into place.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">Pull on the vent cover until it locks into place.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="21" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">myp1oD1PlZf/4+ad/yXIMEO2CQpBfNP7k52Wtr7BPxI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="19"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="dc514ef8-6a6a-4466-bc2f-d217934d9c09"><source>Pull on the vent cover until it locks into place</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">Pull on the vent cover until it locks into place</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="22" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Ddv/qaqotd6OROcN74ljn0MyP4jsaIpPstvxMcWCnMU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="19"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0d83fef5-4c66-413f-b899-cb3fd854d2a8"><source>Ensure that the vent cover is placed properly on the wand by checking that the rear end of the vent cover reaches the cable cap, as shown by the red line below.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">Ensure that the vent cover is placed properly on the wand by checking that the rear end of the vent cover reaches the cable cap, as shown by the red line below.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="23" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ruSp4FH+VL9uoE1l/MhYCbh2RH9guQxUV4l7NQWiZ7k=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="19"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="fb39b38e-2842-45f7-afa6-6d3a000a57b1"><source>Check that the rear end of the vent cover reaches the cable cap</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">Check that the rear end of the vent cover reaches the cable cap</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="24" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YHwcsVXnUpJ663AWBVwP3zUOqEINBWIdvmBUWbQxI7w=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="19"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a8475fc7-1aef-4646-b441-f8358ac0e243"><source>Return the protective sleeve and place the wand in the cradle.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Return the protective sleeve and place the wand in the cradle.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="25" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">K4CYVNwO3jml3RJY+IZGFFQLJEgG4J9JtamPzOQA8eY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\11. Care and maintenance\A3.0_Cradle_Cleaning and disinfecting_2.htm.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-language="pt-br"><header><reference><internal-file form="base64">UEsDBBQAAAAIACU0GVkRM+SoYAUAAOcfAAAQAAAAdGtndG5lZ2UubmRrLnhsZuVZzY7bNhC+B+g7
