<trans-unit id="227150e4-4298-482c-9dba-018d86ef0f66"><source>Using <g id="63">CaviWipes1</g><x id="64"/>, remove any remaining contaminants on the cradle.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Using <g id="63">CaviWipes1</g><x id="64"/>, remove any remaining contaminants on the cradle.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Usando o <g id="63">CaviWipes1</g><x id="64"/>, remova do suporte qualquer agente contaminante.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="25" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/28/2020 10:05:39</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:11:13</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1210143587</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">XgzE5keG5kQZ5zTbhc9PjE2AZld19Wdnms3Oabbq+wo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="eec88f5b-08f4-4503-b870-03cca60d8a5d"><source>Visually inspect the cradle in a well-lit area to ensure all surfaces are visibly clean.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26">Visually inspect the cradle in a well-lit area to ensure all surfaces are visibly clean.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26">Inspecione visualmente o suporte em uma área bem iluminada, para garantir que todas as superfícies estejam visivelmente limpas.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="26" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/28/2020 10:05:39</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/22/2020 04:28:38</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">680334090</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">QeHP7+oryt1FRTF/iD4tCEQcBatEAnU1PxFv5m5Z6XQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="18"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5c736f94-cb4b-45e7-93fd-1924f5466835"><source>If required, repeat step 3 until no visual contamination is observed.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27">If required, repeat step 3 until no visual contamination is observed.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27">Se necessário, repita a etapa 3 até que nenhuma contaminação visual seja observada.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="27" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="MfFJaOe78I3wb0O/Gwp8rhgW4Oom7L8yVVsW36BZQ24="/><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 11:01:59</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:11:13</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1529516116</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">MfFJaOe78I3wb0O/Gwp8rhgW4Oom7L8yVVsW36BZQ24=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="8951bf8b-f09a-445a-9f02-82008dfa79d6"><source><g id="73">Disinfection</g> <g id="76"> (intermediate-level disinfection)</g></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28"><g id="73">Disinfection</g> <g id="76"> (intermediate-level disinfection)</g></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28"><g id="73">Desinfecção</g> <g id="76"> (desinfecção de nível intermediário)</g></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="28" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="lq0Xh9ndpfyDxaftdgjm3NRQK2aS54ifRrEtPRGB+CI="/><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 11:02:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:11:13</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1847701668</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">lq0Xh9ndpfyDxaftdgjm3NRQK2aS54ifRrEtPRGB+CI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="39343377-ead0-4cca-9625-b183399e1a7a"><source>Using <g id="91">CaviWipes1</g><x id="92"/>, thoroughly dampen all external surfaces of the cradle and ensure they remain wet for <g id="95">a minimum of one (1) minute</g><x id="96"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">Using <g id="91">CaviWipes1</g><x id="92"/>, thoroughly dampen all external surfaces of the cradle and ensure they remain wet for <g id="95">a minimum of one (1) minute</g><x id="96"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">Usando o <g id="91">CaviWipes1</g><x id="92"/>, umedeça completamente todas as superfícies externas do suporte e certifique-se de que permaneçam úmidas por, <g id="95">no mínimo, um (1) minute</g><x id="96"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="29" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/28/2020 10:05:55</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:11:13</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2120986582</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ciHOiV1d6fAOIJeHBCyiCoOSlKRCbyRmWXAhD5Dwu6E=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="19"/><sdl:cxt id="20"/><sdl:cxt id="21"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="976e8c88-54b4-4009-9b89-bc9597976b61"><source><g id="111">Note:</g> Use multiple fresh wipes, as necessary, to keep the cradle surfaces wet for the <g id="114">full one (1) minute contact time</g><x id="115"/>.<x id="117"/><x id="118"/><x id="119"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30"><g id="111">Note:</g> Use multiple fresh wipes, as necessary, to keep the cradle surfaces wet for the <g id="114">full one (1) minute contact time</g><x id="115"/>.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31"><x id="117"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32"><x id="118"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33"><x id="119"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30"><g id="111">Nota:</g> use vários lenços novos, conforme necessário, para manter a superfície do suporte umedecida pelo tempo de contato de <g id="114">um (1) minuto</g><x id="115"/>.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31"><x id="117"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32"><x id="118"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33"><x id="119"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="30" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:17</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:11:13</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">197462482</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YPAOCtvo3IeCDHSmwnKQBpIZQg3gxJELw8NqO2oukks=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="31" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="c