g-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="1">Materiais aprovados para limpeza e desinfecção</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="1" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/02/2020 14:31:13</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/21/2020 20:44:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">666542739</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">LrEIyUz5zfxe+bj45CNkUWseCYjTgaEBn+P8fBXKR30=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d3c8a829-e810-4cc1-96cf-a1fe1c73ef17"><source>Approved cleaning and disinfection materials (not relevant for Australia)</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Approved cleaning and disinfection materials (not relevant for Australia)</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Materiais aprovados para limpeza e desinfecção (não é relevante na Austrália)</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/20/2024 16:40:05</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:11:13</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1780585061</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ghDSxA8T1wVBKK0Q198eNO7p/jeAphGHpc3jxq4lZQ4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="19273b2e-f5b3-40a1-8d19-22e9eac6dac5"><source>The following table lists the Align-recommended cleaning and disinfecting materials, as well as the minimum contact time required.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">The following table lists the Align-recommended cleaning and disinfecting materials, as well as the minimum contact time required.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">A tabela a seguir lista os materiais de limpeza e desinfecção recomendados pela Align, bem como o mínimo tempo de contato necessário.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/02/2020 14:31:42</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/21/2020 20:44:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">245476434</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">yXn1135H6fII5PftHg67HaOOpGLnJ1JR8B9/AariKH4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="978a5068-4269-4e50-b88e-9b0c6445a255"><source>If you are using a liquid disinfectant, soak a clean, sterile, lint-free wipe in the liquid and squeeze until moist, and then follow the cleaning and disinfection instructions described in this document.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">If you are using a liquid disinfectant, soak a clean, sterile, lint-free wipe in the liquid and squeeze until moist, and then follow the cleaning and disinfection instructions described in this document.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Se você estiver usando um desinfetante líquido, embeba um pano limpo, esterilizado e sem fiapos no produto e torça até ficar úmido, em seguida, siga as instruções de limpeza e de desinfecção descritas neste documento.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="1B/AhzTOygtdZwDTo/2SN1KpFyfcxUiIopRCfdRuAJg="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 09:18:59</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:32:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">692717694</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">1B/AhzTOygtdZwDTo/2SN1KpFyfcxUiIopRCfdRuAJg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0429c82b-14bb-4661-9582-932e5322cc89"><source><x id="6"/><x id="9"/><x id="12"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5"><x id="6"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6"><x id="9"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7"><x id="12"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5"><x id="6"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6"><x id="9"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7"><x id="12"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl: