><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="14"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a62a3df4-fd72-4bd9-9388-9a2952dc1101"><source>≤50% Peracetic Acid</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="36">≤50% Peracetic Acid</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="36">Ácido Peracético ≤50%</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="36" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="SpgIxCZT++6nMZVUxgj23JfLIC0PZpLDVw0srIcri8M="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">07/20/2020 14:27:47</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">07/21/2020 00:26:41</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1936150565</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">SpgIxCZT++6nMZVUxgj23JfLIC0PZpLDVw0srIcri8M=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="15"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="4e0260e7-06b1-4f47-86d1-77620d9dcdc2"><source>Consult your local supplier of disinfecting materials for approved cleaning and disinfecting materials in your region.Cleaning and disinfecting products must meet local regulatory requirements, have the above-mentioned active ingredients and concentration levels, and in addition, must be capable of intermediate-level disinfection, including being able to disinfect against at least Hepatitis and Tuberculosis.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="37">Consult your local supplier of disinfecting materials for approved cleaning and disinfecting materials in your region.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38">Cleaning and disinfecting products must meet local regulatory requirements, have the above-mentioned active ingredients and concentration levels, and in addition, must be capable of intermediate-level disinfection, including being able to disinfect against at least Hepatitis and Tuberculosis.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="37">Consulte seu fornecedor local de materiais de desinfecção para obter materiais de limpeza e de desinfecção aprovados em sua região.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38">Os produtos de limpeza e desinfecção devem atender às exigências regulatórias locais, conter os ingredientes ativos e os níveis de concentração mencionados acima e, além disso, ter a capacidade de desinfecção de nível intermediário, incluindo a capacidade de desinfetar, ao menos, contra o vírus da Hepatite e da Tuberculose.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="37" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/20/2024 16:44:10</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:11:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">181836167</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">f1dso7AwjqVXB8kTJ/bcACDHS/ihDQBkih1iYusMSb0=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="38" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/20/2024 16:48:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:11:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">267815777</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Y52emYaic3n/iaPbwZ+78OPlEQPsZPXcLeSZjIyrWPE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="acc6e2e9-13be-451d-a2cf-5fd6718d7364"><source>Refer to the disinfecting agent manufacturer&apos;s user manuals and data sheets for additional information and instructions for use, including recommended contact times.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39">Refer to the disinfecting agent manufacturer&apos;s user manuals and data sheets for additional information and instructions for use, including recommended contact times.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39">Consulte os manuais do usuário e as fichas técnicas do fabricante do agente desinfetante para obter informações adicionais e instruções de uso, incluindo os tempos de contato recomendados.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="39" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="81"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="81"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">vOqFOJdFbOqsSbrfPXK8t+Dxh4aVwjvuEiA9KNYaNQw=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:48:38</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">vOqFOJdFbOqsSbrfPXK8t+Dxh4aVwjvuEiA9KNYaNQw=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:29:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1931433880</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="12e41439-dca8-4e80-8450-9ad855e7e7ed"><source>If you are using a liquid disinfectant, soak a clean, sterile, lint-free wipe in the liquid and squeeze until moist, and then follow the cleaning and disinfection instructions described in this document.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40">If you are using a liquid disinfectant, soak a clean, sterile, lint-free wipe in the liquid and squeeze until moist, and then follow the cleaning and disinfection instructions described in this document.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40">Se você estiver usando um desinfetante líquido, embeba um pano limpo, esterilizado e sem fiapos no produto e torça até ficar úmido, em seguida, siga as instruções de limpeza e de desinfecção descritas neste documento.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="40" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="1B/AhzTOygtdZwDTo/2SN1KpFyfcxUiIopRCfdRuAJg="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 09:18:59</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:32:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">692717694</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">1B/AhzTOygtdZwDTo/2SN1KpFyfcxUiIopRCfdRuAJg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="16"/><sdl:cxt id="17"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0c879832-50cc-4cd4-a8e9-25ed7225cfd4"><source><x id="47"/><x id="50"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="41"><x id="47"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="42"><x id="50"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="41"><x id="47"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="42"><x id="50"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="41" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdenti