<sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="85cdf97c-6c87-460b-aaec-519f68dfee31"><source>Contact your local Customer Support to securely decommission the system by sanitizing the product of sensitive, confidential, and proprietary data and software, and to arrange scanner collection.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Contact your local Customer Support to securely decommission the system by sanitizing the product of sensitive, confidential, and proprietary data and software, and to arrange scanner collection.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Entre em contato com o suporte ao cliente local para desativar o sistema com segurança, limpando o produto de software e dados sensíveis, confidenciais e proprietários, e para organizar a coleta do scanner.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="8" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:11:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">127555643</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">2gYXb+Xzy4Mfzh7X9FuZSDcd7vDUghD6VmJ4jKCZl8s=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="64e4dbb8-cd62-4b84-bd79-5c951cca3fba"><source>Dispose of batteries in accordance with local environmental laws and guidelines.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">Dispose of batteries in accordance with local environmental laws and guidelines.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">Descarte as baterias de acordo com as leis e diretrizes ambientais locais.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="9" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:11:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">889020864</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">GjQyfze+xljlcjtAiuO0UR0l7XGDItdQtQLQrEcu/+w=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="88c3773a-772c-4608-816a-b059c6f36e60"><source>Dispose of sleeves according to standard operating procedures or local regulations for the disposal of contaminated medical waste.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Dispose of sleeves according to standard operating procedures or local regulations for the disposal of contaminated medical waste.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Descartar as <mrk mtype="x-sdl-location" mid="a30c9548-385d-4f7b-8507-788499134ed9"/>ponteiras de acordo com os procedimentos operacionais padrão ou com as regulamentações locais para remoção de lixo hospitalar contaminado.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="10" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="96"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="96"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">IkmjbMhMzIjrf4NrRjVvi9Dio0LnlbF/8CDMzGTVzAM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 15:48:48</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">IkmjbMhMzIjrf4NrRjVvi9Dio0LnlbF/8CDMzGTVzAM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/0