Health Suite</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="1">Align Oral Health Suite</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="1"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="1" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:rep id="Rr1i5TdduyM0/7KPYiOyv2iPk2QEhi1jdxe29Aq6Zho="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Rr1i5TdduyM0/7KPYiOyv2iPk2QEhi1jdxe29Aq6Zho=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="426d6829-dd3b-448d-945b-78779a7f4f65"><source>Align Oral Health Suite</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Align Oral Health Suite</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Align Oral Health Suite</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="Rr1i5TdduyM0/7KPYiOyv2iPk2QEhi1jdxe29Aq6Zho="/><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/16/2024 19:06:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 13:56:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">523724126</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Rr1i5TdduyM0/7KPYiOyv2iPk2QEhi1jdxe29Aq6Zho=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="b237ec05-0011-491b-90d9-8c25d6e7dca9"><source>Align Oral Health Suite is a comprehensive digital suite integrating multiple proprietary iTero visualization and diagnostic-aid tools into one easily accessible, patient-centric interface.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Align Oral Health Suite is a comprehensive digital suite integrating multiple proprietary iTero visualization and diagnostic-aid tools into one easily accessible, patient-centric interface.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">A Align Oral Health Suite é um conjunto digital completo que integra diversas ferramentas proprietárias de visualização e de auxílio diagnóstico do iTero em uma interface facilmente acessível e centrada no paciente.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 12:53:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:15:07</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1584959466</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ekD3VrGRHpPaGfWE82EvbPgtLpSfCvlnQoVvdJvrtpo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="f4fe04ec-8677-4d2f-95d8-a45dcee898f7"><source><g id="5">Note:</g> Align Oral Health Suite is available on iTero Element 2 Plus intraoral scanners only.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4"><g id="5">Note:</g> Align Oral Health Suite is available on iTero Element 2 Plus intraoral scanners only.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">MVkiEHX5ttw5EmDIJ5Vti/E9oR77RiJ/js/zvmGHQP4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="be3f6771-2fd5-4999-bf49-d4fddf542bdf"><source><g id="11">Note:</g> Align Oral Health Suite is available on iTero Element 5D Plus and 5D Plus Lite imaging systems only, including iTero Element 5D imaging systems with a Plus package.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5"><g id="11">Note:</g> Align Oral Health Suite is available on iTero Element 5D Plus and 5D Plus Lite imaging systems only, including iTero Element 5D imaging systems with a Plus package.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">w//aO9BTBwbSnH7hds7PX5S0X9eEOVg3Xntjwh1HD30=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="67edc9f6-551f-4c46-8c8e-7f7ffc3d40ed"><source>You can access Align Oral Health Suite when sending the scan by tapping <g id="20">Send &amp; View</g>, or after sending the scan from the patient&apos;s profile page or the <g id="23">Orders</g> page.In addition, you can access Align Oral Health Suite from MyiTero.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">You can access Align Oral Health Suite when sending the scan by tapping <g id="20">Send &amp; View</g>, or after sending the scan from the patient&apos;s profile page or the <g id="23">Orders</g> page.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">In addition, you can access Align Oral Health Suite from MyiTero.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Você pode acessar a Align Oral Health Suite ao enviar a digitalização, tocando em <g id="20">Enviar e Visualizar</g> ou após enviar a digitalização desde a página de perfil do paciente ou da página <g id="23">Pedidos</g>.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Além disso, você pode acessar a Align Oral Health Suite no MyiTero</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:00:02</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:15:07</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1128422098</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">7gRHKPMQsNlPeeOMSS2AsMzpf2+CrF1wbnGpQVcEVZ8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="7" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:08:47</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:15:07</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2075108606</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">+OIXlTBTBBfh/Yq2HGdyMDFhMQyWGEu7YRGbdAXp9kI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="9659364f-5daf-4251-8e72-18489e7b48a9"><source>Align Oral Health Suite home screen</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Align Oral Health Suite home screen</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Tela inicial da Align Oral Health Suite</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="8" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:09:06</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:15:07</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">50961773</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Ro0WfwLFx7Lpsdf1XwlkKAs4jNjQ+gHHSp2MUtponVg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d938cfff-7cd8-442e-8f59-6b639570f897"><source>Align Oral Health Suite enables you to view the scan in the context of select dental conditions and comprehensively explore potential areas of interest.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">Align Oral Health Suite enables you to view the scan in the context of select dental conditions and comprehensively explore potential areas of interest.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">A Align Oral Health Suite permite visualizar a digitalização no contexto das condições dentárias selecionadas e explorar, de forma abrangente, possíveis áreas de interesse.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="9" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 17:55:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:15:07</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2086552816</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">X215VRTGXjwH6RMTZW5roRGJ6jCjMwEUpWQhiUeTZAA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="74192575-bdbf-4863-8d51-eb1a996f15c2"><source>When you select a condition, the default view and tools for that condition are automatically selected so that you may start viewing the scan.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">When you select a condition, the default view and tools for that condition are automatically selected so that you may start viewing the scan.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Quando você seleciona uma condição a visualização padrão e as ferramentas para tal condição são automaticamente selecionadas para que você possa começar a visualizar a digitalização.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="10" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 17:57:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:15:07</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">104542742</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">EOpAda54AgLX9Oe2WLYbyJ0XzEODsk6cu7YdrXSce6g=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="4759ce6d-655e-4af6-97f1-015d5e86b01d"><source>When not in Demo mode, a <g id="31">How to get started</g> button is displayed on the home screen for more information regarding using Align Oral Health Suite.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">When not in Demo mode, a <g id="31">How to get started</g> button is displayed on the home screen for more information regarding using Align Oral Health Suite.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">Quando não estiver no modo de Demonstração, o botão <g id="31">Como começar</g> é exibido na tela inicial para mais informações sobre o uso da Align Oral Health Suite.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="11" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 17:57:58</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:15:07</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2029435751</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">6vIUvm2rsuuRwCbqgmofcnmgVlmgSAEOnuxX3wE0pis=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\5. Starting a new scan\Applying a wand barrier sleeve.htm.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilt