If any damage to the system or accessories is found, do not assemble or use the scanner and contact iTero Support.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21"><g id="19">Note:</g> If any damage to the system or accessories is found, do not assemble or use the scanner and contact iTero Support.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21"><g id="19">Nota:</g> se for encontrado algum dano ao sistema ou acessórios, não monte ou use o scanner e entre em contato com o Suporte iTero.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="21" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">609796745</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">SSD6DXEJzfNWor2zWHcj4cMY/mHr0Yn6Dl3ZqabUIos=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="75c1f996-ec24-42d7-b758-830ac636139d"><source>Remove all Styrofoam coverings from the box.<x id="25"/><g id="28">Note:</g> The two Allen keys (A) are on top of the Styrofoam covering the post (B).</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">Remove all Styrofoam coverings from the box.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23"><x id="25"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24"><g id="28">Note:</g> The two Allen keys (A) are on top of the Styrofoam covering the post (B).</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">Remova todas as proteções de Isopor da caixa.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23"><x id="25"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24"><g id="28">Nota:</g> as duas chaves Allen (A) estão em cima do isopor que está cobrindo o extensor (B).</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="22" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 11:40:52</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:32:39</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2118620667</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">kKFByTXuBPGms+4lw6bnLSgQh6KGaOxiVYXc0RsE5/g=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="23" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="24" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/20/2024 11:29:41</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:12:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-255447830</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ztf6FgQJt+HOTdU+bfFCb0E9i9LXzn2uP51Ytn6gGuA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="59e5a95b-b057-47c1-8745-6b3081ee2161"><source>Lift the post (B), pull it out slightly, and rest it on the side of the box.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Lift the post (B), pull it out slightly, and rest it on the side of the box.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Levante o extensor (B), puxe-o levemente para fora e coloque-o na lateral da caixa.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="25" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 11:46:32</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:32:41</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1099815912</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">a9agUPbV0c1UguxTlHnaCEYtg82YkXYk5clKRtspUkU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="84a2c108-02ed-4984-9418-7da9ce41be1c"><source>Attach the wheel base (C) to the end of the post (B) and tighten using first the longer side of the large Allen key and then the shorter side.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26">Attach the wheel base (C) to the end of the post (B) and tighten using first the longer side of the large Allen key and then the shorter side.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26">Prenda o suporte com rodas (C) ao final do extensor (B) e aperte usando, primeiro, a extremidade mais longa da chave Allen grande e, depois, a extremidade mais curta.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="26" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 11:51:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:32:45</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1159747846</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">TC40sOyTk33M6lwfSdnmXErTFybScz+m/+UjiY4rHyk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ea7d0e75-bbd9-42e0-9b52-4a313329a732"><source>Move the wheel stand to an upright position and lock at least two wheels.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27">Move the wheel stand to an upright position and lock at least two wheels.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27">Mova o suporte com rodas para a posição vertical e trave pelo menos duas rodas.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="27" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/20/2020 14:55:03</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/20/2020 14:55:03</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">807141482</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">wxgMJ+kQdmsXFwpEDNTTcRzUHgzEgXqxLqIrSmiigHQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="df916742-8678-4cae-ae5e-6a7b451941b3"><source>Remove the main handle (D) and the two screws from the accessory box.<x id="32"/>Attach the main handle and tighten using first the longer side of the small Allen key and then the shorter side.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28">Remove the main handle (D) and the two screws from the accessory box.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29"><x id="32"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">Attach the main handle and tighten using first the longer side of the small Allen key and then the shorter side.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28">Remova a alça central (D) e os dois parafusos da caixa de acessórios.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29"><x id="32"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">Prenda a alça principal e aperte usando, primeiro, a extremidade mais longa da chave Allen pequena e, depois, a extremidade mais curta.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="28" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 11:51:33</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:32:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">402149519</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">5ZWSzHN8A3RDA8HHY/VH1JKomhSWq1Sc81r3/Ee4XDQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="29" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="30" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 11:52:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:32:50</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1769870494</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">JU8eHbesm9sNuNE0VdjOHuX5hXITSAsBlkMX8XDE+Tg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d3caf11a-d6bc-4c25-a8e2-27640ed7700a"><source>Remove the sleeve basket (E) from the accessory box and place it on the back of the main handle (D).</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31">Remove the sleeve basket (E) from the accessory box and place it on the back of the main handle (D).</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31">Remova a cesta de ponteiras (E) da caixa de acessórios e coloque-a atrás da alça central (D).</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="31" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 11:56:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:32:52</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">171839637</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">D6WI/0l5s952qtzVyebIZjE6bNsvTq693OPYPiyDy8w=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="41306a76-17e3-4d49-9427-48362e0facbe"><source>Do not delete this space &quot;BreakAfter&quot; style is not working</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32">Do not delete this space &quot;BreakAfter&quot; style is not working</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="32" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">QokJAXFJtxduEX7ENhOfXUNdtS1amp1bowtCjz9DJmM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="959a1486-4c40-40f1-b48c-389509d11e27"><source>Remove the upper handle (F) from the accessory box and remove the pull tab to access the screw.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33">Remove the upper handle (F) from the accessory box and remove the pull tab to access the screw.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33">Remova a alça superior (F) da caixa de acessórios e retire a aba de puxar para acessar o parafuso.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="33" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 11:58:58</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:32:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1703757182</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">hiTbKASFGEgNUmXMe17Qh2ZCjd9Y/w21uTViHgJeMAI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="e9f6a9dd-575c-4cef-9bbd-9758d15ec385"><source>Attach the upper handle (F) to the post (B) and tighten using first the longer side of the small Allen key and then the shorter side.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="34">Attach the upper handle (F) to the post (B) and tighten using first the longer side of the small Allen key and then the shorter side.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="34">Prenda a alça superior (F) ao extensor (B) e aperte usando, primeiro, a extremidade mais longa da chave Allen pequena e, depois, a extremidade mais curta.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="34" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 12:04:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:32:57</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1791317303</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">tODGVf9spbA19gCKDzwQvAl+boCX5mdvMOyeljtQU/c=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2d027aa8-032f-4d93-8f6e-214145dc77f9"><source>Carefully remove the computing unit (G) from its protective wrapping.<x id="39"/><g id="42">Note:</g> The computing unit is heavy and must be lifted carefully.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="35">Carefully remove the computing unit (G) from its protective wrapping.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="36"><x id="39"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="37"><g id="42">Note:</g> The computing unit is heavy and must be lifted carefully.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="35">Remova cuidadosamente a unidade de computação (G) de sua embalagem protetora.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="36"><x id="39"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="37"><g id="42">Nota:</g> a unidade de computação é pesada e deve ser levantada com cuidado.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="35" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 12:05:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:32:58</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-347986694</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">M7iIo8QX3d8G51fk1Wg/MalVlLSvMo5+AwUnp7ZeGzk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="36" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="37" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 21:46:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:12:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1400115824</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">W0JiVGC9hr/pGk+F+IfVOvLRDdkOncS0a0dzwZfcoTs=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="16c4372e-6d14-4f8a-8694-ac1bd3e7fbdf"><source>Standing behind the wheel stand, mount the computing unit (G) on the metal hinge and push down.<x id="49"/><g id="52">Note:</g> Make sure the computing unit does not press on the screen cable.If it does, move the cable to the side.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38">Standing behind the wheel stand, mount the computing unit (G) on the metal hinge and push down.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39"><x id="49"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40"><g id="52">Note:</g> Make sure the computing unit does not press on the screen cable.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="41">If it does, move the cable to the side.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38">Fique atrás do suporte com rodas, encaixe a unidade de computação (G) na dobradiça metálica e empurre para baixo.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39"><x id="49"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40"><g id="52">Nota:</g> certifique-se de que a unidade de computação não pressione o cabo da tela.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="41">Se estiver pressionando, mova o cabo para o lado.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="38" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 12:05:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:12:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-968393278</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">VfpxxtAntVot4k0GYWBFh9x2Kaxak2BRcbBTeFQfF90=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="39" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="40" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/22/2024 07:30:37</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/22/2024 07:30:37</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1204914915</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">+oTDpLUtDlqYtcKPtWA8hespVIUlx7XsJ3A3BE0qzEQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="41" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 12:11:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:33:05</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1922453814</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">J69GVHN9OfrkjEPMbN+Q7uH0iDaK5Qbtbl4WsgPcEYA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5ca1691e-c23e-4ae7-b82b-6997c34ff769"><source>Attach the computing unit (G) by pushing in and tightening the screw.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="42">Attach the computing unit (G) by pushing in and tightening the screw.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="42">Prenda a unidade de computação (G), empurrando e apertando o parafuso.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="42" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 12:11:43</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:33:07</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1079969533</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">8B7UtdCVfWSitV7ZvQmZbtZTeCNGNNhrons5/kVDW7k=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d7f2f866-eb0b-4406-bf4d-f947331c1467"><source>If the cable connector is covered, remove the cover.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="43">If the cable connector is covered, remove the cover.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="43">Se o conector do cabo estiver tampado, remova a tampa.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="43" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 12:12:43</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:33:10</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1348204364</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">RL3LHslwjKA0wRpxZxRnrWpNFKFNbk9tvYUFhZcpQS0=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="b61c62ff-e224-42d4-82b5-ad135ea6859b"><source>Tilt the screen upwards and connect the screen cable.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="44">Tilt the screen upwards and connect the screen cable.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="44">Incline a tela para cima e conecte o cabo da tela.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="44" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/29/2020 11:02:28</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 18:27:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-701860670</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">N3GZysEUCKnm7UMVlui49LI7TFj0jA7PuH2Oh7Apc4o=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="80eeaa5e-e7a3-4160-b64c-1456f02be9d0"><source>Attach the cradle (H) to the post (B) and tighten using first the longer side of the small Allen key and then the shorter side.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="45">Attach the cradle (H) to the post (B) and tighten using first the longer side of the small Allen key and then the shorter side.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="45">Prenda o suporte (H) ao extensor (B) e aperte usando, primeiro, a extremidade mais longa da chave Allen pequena e, depois, a extremidade mais curta.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="45" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">MyMemory_3e52754379915cd607f4</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/16/2023 07:40:06</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/16/2023 07:40:06</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">MyMemory_3e52754379915cd607f4</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1752459658</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">/L7j/ku0ca27HVjQZIv8QJDzpeMMWWx63ZfhB21QwyA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="be631f85-d699-41de-9e0c-2a4a4dd25cd5"><source>Insert the base of the wand (I) in the cradle (H) and then apply gentle pressure to make sure the wand is fully inserted and secure in the cradle.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="46">Insert the base of the wand (I) in the cradle (H) and then apply gentle pressure to make sure the wand is fully inserted and secure in the cradle.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="46">Insira a base do leitor (I) no suporte (H) e aplique uma leve pressão para garantir que o leitor fique totalmente inserido e seguro no suporte.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="46" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 12:15:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:33:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1546881553</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">aaLKfqgVuSDtfz9WbzQbPAunAosT6EPh9API1RU/f0M=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="57595d48-34f1-4e94-ba86-35c6140c8360"><source>Connect the wand cable to the back of the screen (G).</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="47">Connect the wand cable to the back of the screen (G).</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="47">Conecte o cabo do leitor na parte traseira da tela (G).</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="47" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 12:15:37</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:33:20</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1405063379</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Le/8VCSgU18kycZvTPnweGTWURmhuXdM7HJ791K1uYc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="30a0e50b-5829-4e81-8376-dc9b59f911da"><source>Connect the power cable (J) to the bottom of the wheel stand.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="48">Connect the power cable (J) to the bottom of the wheel stand.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="48">Conecte o cabo de energia (J) à parte inferior do suporte com rodas.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="48" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/29/2020 11:03:41</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 18:29:27</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2066925094</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">xLYlzUv0kl3JMOi8a736Krz+UVHnVAsqJLl+3nGX4rY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3de6ded5-0b82-44a9-b731-480704a22924"><source><g id="62">Warning:</g> <x id="63"/> Use only the supplied power cable, which has a protective earth lead.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="49"><g id="62">Warning:</g> <x id="63"/> Use only the supplied power cable, which has a protective earth lead.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="49"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="49" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:rep id="1JTrh0HIBwg5sGAAVn4Ch1WQAfiBhpxfXQvcnRhfiKA="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">1JTrh0HIBwg5sGAAVn4Ch1WQAfiBhpxfXQvcnRhfiKA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3b2b1e7c-7108-4d03-952d-ddabd585bebc"><source><x id="64"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="50"><x id="64"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="50"><x id="64"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="50" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c56aa76f-9b41-440d-96c8-69b334468e29"><source>Secure the power cable (J) in the two cable clips, making sure it is fully inserted.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="51">Secure the power cable (J) in the two cable clips, making sure it is fully inserted.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="51">Prenda o cabo de energia (J) nos dois clipes para cabo, certificando-se de que seja totalmente encaixado.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="51" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/13/2020 14:23:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:12:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">240930549</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Zzkf2HKI/octvaRjAseMUEuUTIgnNQ+d3WPYqMfv+Ig=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="950d1045-f18c-4b9f-b557-a9f528fd77a5"><source>For remote training or support sessions, position the webcam (K) on the screen and then connect it to the USB port at the back of the screen.<x id="73"/><g id="76">Note:</g> The webcam must be disconnected after each training or support session.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="52">For remote training or support sessions, position the webcam (K) on the screen and then connect it to the USB port at the back of the screen.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="53"><x id="73"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="54"><g id="76">Note:</g> The webcam must be disconnected after each training or support session.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="52">Para treinamento remoto ou sessões de suporte, posicione a webcam (K) na tela e conecte à porta USB na parte de trás da tela.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="53"><x id="73"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="54"><g id="76">Nota:</g> a webcam deve ser desconectada após cada sessão de suporte ou treinamento.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="52" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/13/2020 14:23:33</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/19/2020 20:40:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1621443220</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">bRxqXdR6FnW1HShpy8Ry/z72EhpPduxIYtVwCehLv6s=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="53" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="54" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 21:47:03</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:12:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-160593319</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">6ihOI19kVzKrgK7wu0w5R+3xgK/rdPfypvxdLOfOaps=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="bf53e32b-0e08-43d9-bb1a-eb0d31a43a02"><source>Plug the power cable (J) into a power outlet and then press the Power button (L) to switch on the scanner.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="55">Plug the power cable (J) into a power outlet and then press the Power button (L) to switch on the scanner.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="55">Conecte o cabo de energia (J) na tomada elétrica e pressione o botão Ligar/Desligar (L) para ligar o scanner.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="55" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/11/2022 19:51:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:12:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-221694830</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">yOe2Nfvs0wnNpoyFT+FfvDFfR57uXHlo6cUMrllG17k=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ca28fae2-6184-4dfa-9d41-bb46b68af298"><source>Notes:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="56">Notes:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="56">Notas:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="56" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="MV5Vg0NrwdcmWKQ9naRB8KXHXb6LE+trTaKS4OubnEc="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/07/2019 00:22:06</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/19/2020 22:28:16</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-381729265</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">MV5Vg0NrwdcmWKQ9naRB8KXHXb6LE+trTaKS4OubnEc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="4741a305-a0c5-4bcf-b792-6e7acbbe1b56"><source>Always return the wand to the cradle after each use.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="57">Always return the wand to the cradle after each use.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="57">Sempre retorne o leitor para o suporte após cada uso.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="57" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="HIMdwnCf3MResmn/8QjmorM9ZZFmdWtpJmmyZKCpfW4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">01/04/2021 18:00:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">01/04/2021 18:00:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1748484030</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">HIMdwnCf3MResmn/8QjmorM9ZZFmdWtpJmmyZKCpfW4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="14"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="32ba6dba-17ed-4fca-9b87-e011cc3dcaa3"><source>When the system is not in use, the wand should be placed in the cradle with the optical window facing the cradle.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="58">When the system is not in use, the wand should be placed in the cradle with the optical window facing the cradle.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="58">Quando o sistema não estiver em uso, o leitor deverá ser colocado no suporte com a janela óptica voltada para o suporte.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="58" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="jD/4uBeQxi37ewdSg8APdi5E0EfYYeeO3OckhN8AnRo="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:12:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2040307606</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">jD/4uBeQxi37ewdSg8APdi5E0EfYYeeO3OckhN8AnRo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d4c4a7e0-3faf-458b-b8f4-9f40821d588d"><source>The wand, cradle, and other system components should be cleaned and disinfected <x id="85"/><g id="88">immediately after each patient</g>, as described in <x id="89"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="59">The wand, cradle, and other system components should be cleaned and disinfected <x id="85"/><g id="88">immediately after each patient</g>, as described in <x id="89"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="59">O leitor, o suporte e outros componentes do sistema devem ser limpos e desinfetados <x id="85"/><g id="88">imediatamente após cada paciente</g>, conforme descrito em <x id="89"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="59" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="CeCWebQ3rrXV3TW8Qcc8QfJffveMj3DiTKTKQMLjFAM="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:12:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1281125494</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">CeCWebQ3rrXV3TW8Qcc8QfJffveMj3DiTKTKQMLjFAM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="aa22134e-dca3-4905-a148-cf1e667699e5"><source>Ensure that the scanner is positioned in a location where it can easily be disconnected from the power outlet.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="60">Ensure that the scanner is positioned in a location where it can easily be disconnected from the power outlet.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="60">Certifique-se de que o scanner esteja posicionado em um local onde possa ser facilmente desconectado da tomada elétrica.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="60" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="JnhfsGCp5cXb+vH2IE3gbzBUlsKkY04vIvz6K7FJCDA="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 12:30:50</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/11/2022 20:15:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1147912737</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">JnhfsGCp5cXb+vH2IE3gbzBUlsKkY04vIvz6K7FJCDA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0c240548-cc89-4b00-bb1c-a25f6985a3ab"><source>To remove the wand from the cradle, first pull the upper part of the wand towards you and then gently remove it from the cradle.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="61">To remove the wand from the cradle, first pull the upper part of the wand towards you and then gently remove it from the cradle.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="61">Para remover o leitor do suporte, primeiro puxe a parte superior do leitor em sua direção. Em seguida, remova-o cuidadosamente do suporte.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="61" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/13/2020 14:25:01</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/19/2020 20:41:34</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1157810805</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">hmVPM8i/nf2O3qCSVRLepF407rLH8ZkD2xKZImLtEkU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="b3e3e3b0-7fc5-4f71-941d-add83092c977"><source>Removing the wand from the cradle</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="62">Removing the wand from the cradle</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="62">Removendo a leitor do suporte</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="62" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/13/2020 14:25:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/19/2020 20:41:43</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1551275170</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">0CfTFjK1Id4z1bcSRNN3BjvzuoxVOHVk6bu1RNvLNK8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="69b17d36-955b-4358-9b27-e0d8ddca4e1a"><source>When moving the scanner, carefully wrap the power cable around the upper handle and then use the upper handle to push the scanner.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="63">When moving the scanner, carefully wrap the power cable around the upper handle and then use the upper handle to push the scanner.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="63">Ao mover o scanner, enrole cuidadosamente o cabo de energia ao redor da alça superior e use-a para empurrar o scanner.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="63" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/13/2020 14:25:45</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/02/2020 10:59:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-487196160</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">9yDCBRu3tBDD9N3q6Sq+nVHxp0q0VUXQuvYW8qcNLTE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="fe7590b0-0c1f-45f5-8c38-8faf571cbbdc"><source>If the scanner needs to be lifted, use the upper handle and the post.<x id="95"/><g id="98">Do not</g> use the main handle to lift the scanner.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="64">If the scanner needs to be lifted, use the upper handle and the post.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="65"><x id="95"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="66"><g id="98">Do not</g> use the main handle to lift the scanner.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="64">Se o scanner tiver de ser levantado, use a alça superior e o extensor.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="65"><x id="95"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="66"><g id="98">Não</g> use a alça central para levantar o scanner.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="64" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/29/2020 12:24:39</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 18:32:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1703955834</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">jln4EcdNOHDYZdYMaIz/ZGrkobfDeNHct3Nq+JJFpiw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="65" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="66" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 21:47:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:12:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1461414042</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">8xrZPhSKdGKuCBP41nxZ+AI2eEhMmRhKeS1mHdRVa+I=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d44604b0-8934-4c71-b219-17602c08a88a"><source>Moving the scanner</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="67">Moving the scanner</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="67">Transportando o scanner</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="67" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="02eTOxoVWAOZQHn65FkmcoEURMeTQEo+xB78FSpBzSA="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/06/2019 18:45:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/19/2020 22:33:17</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">218638774</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">02eTOxoVWAOZQHn65FkmcoEURMeTQEo+xB78FSpBzSA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="b8f9d44f-3231-48b7-a355-a814a38102a9"><source>Do not lift the scanner using the main handle</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="68">Do not lift the scanner using the main handle</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="68">Não levante o scanner usando a alça central</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="68" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/13/2020 14:26:38</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/19/2020 20:42:35</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1763682186</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">7FELwKpowGFEesDheILvktvjn0RokoZm6NBa6pgRvbU=</sdl:value></sdl:se