ype="seg" mid="96">If the scanner has already been assembled, you must remove the power cable and the cradle, as described in <x id="151"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="96">Se o scanner já tiver sido montado, você deve remover o cabo de alimentação e o suporte, conforme descrito na <x id="151"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="96" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1470678362</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Q8pGo8iSiH55RJyIZEVVuo7U60jvhRkGJjBj3sJZ69M=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="16"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="834d0a2a-6ba3-4c7b-8f30-f5f76bdd5846"><source>We recommend that connecting the computing unit to the VESA mount, step 3 below, be performed by two people.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="97">We recommend that connecting the computing unit to the VESA mount, step 3 below, be performed by two people.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="97">Recomendamos que a conexão da unidade de computação ao suporte VESA, a etapa 3 abaixo, seja realizada por duas pessoas.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="97" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/27/2021 17:14:06</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/27/2021 17:14:06</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-132075839</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">RvT3wIjNSNZy3mlol8T4xc58vm9Eg0fMn68Pw7CoQ8c=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="fb08fe77-7a7a-405f-bd06-1941314171a1"><source>Lay the computing unit (A) face down on a smooth, flat surface.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="98">Lay the computing unit (A) face down on a smooth, flat surface.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="98">Deite a unidade de computação (A) voltada para baixo, em uma superfície lisa e plana.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="98" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/10/2022 09:17:43</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:27:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1684071140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YfWWfO2nnOZAfG4RGkHbnBh3Gmxz00hn5hJmqYsPiWw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="657bdfcd-03ca-476d-8f58-9ee64d56f77e"><source>Remove the 4 screws with a Phillips screwdriver, while holding and moving the handle (B), as required.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="99">Remove the 4 screws with a Phillips screwdriver, while holding and moving the handle (B), as required.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="99">Remova os 4 parafusos com uma chave de fenda Phillips enquanto segura e move a alça (B), conforme necessário.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="99" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/10/2022 09:17:55</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:27:55</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">116217465</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">sPAvHgHnhoNBkt3eDJQPPQUr/uAkGXxAPWrMNXcwgXQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="fe1ca604-9646-4ae2-984f-721ce85048f6"><source>Remove the iTero back cover plate to expose the VESA screw holes.(It is recommended to store the cover plate and screws in the trolley.)</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="100">Remove the iTero back cover plate to expose the VESA screw holes.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="101">(It is recommended to store the cover plate and screws in the trolley.)</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="100">Remova a tampa traseira do iTero para expor os furos dos parafusos VESA.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="101">(Recomenda-se armazenar a placa de cobertura e os parafusos no carrinho.)</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="100" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">01/04/2021 18:51:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">01/04/2021 18:51:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1408780587</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">OcUPfxyii7i8TUiuhBh7CPd7Amp/gjJ1nCmF7E1pqww=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="101" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">01/04/2021 18:51:16</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">01/04/2021 18:51:16</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1390478591</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">oRQQLnalC5OiVb5pBxz0fxkklSTcBzcO3fY4WmcNOqU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="14"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="30d37175-94ed-442e-a17d-301e45d0cd9a"><source>Connect the computing unit (A) to the external VESA mount (VESA 100) using the screws supplied with the mounting solution.<x id="156"/>Optional: You can purchase a 3m power cable from Align, if required.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="102">Connect the computing unit (A) to the external VESA mount (VESA 100) using the screws supplied with the mounting solution.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="103"><x id="156"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="104">Optional: You can purchase a 3m power cable from Align, if required.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="102">Conecte a unidade de computação (A) à montagem VESA externa (VESA 100), usando os parafusos fornecidos com a solução de montagem.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="103"><x id="156"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="104">Opcional: você pode adquirir um cabo de alimentação de 3m, se necessário.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="102" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/10/2022 09:18:10</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:28:00</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1427871322</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">QzLgWX/cLAOrMC2/hiOAvU+9f3Z5J9HFw33Sxs0Nw0o=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="103" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="104" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/22/2021 16:35:20</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/22/2021 16:35:20</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">11203194</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">+1kXUWzC9w+ZK/TGPZHJ3PAs19XDvwfvQ6UFSWmn+HU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="8946db17-6dfc-4a74-b9d3-af3c440c79d8"><source>While supporting the computing unit (A) with one hand, slide the cradle (C) on the slider on the side of the computing unit until it clicks into place.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="105">While supporting the computing unit (A) with one hand, slide the cradle (C) on the slider on the side of the computing unit until it clicks into place.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="105">Enquanto segura a unidade de computação (A) com uma mão, deslize o suporte (C) pelo encaixe lateral da unidade de computação até ouvir um clique.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="105" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/10/2022 09:22:27</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:28:01</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-216643223</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">NFN5pq1GwLeuq8ipnJnPCnFgQpdAUII0EeX2zk/ZmNc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="f64e9f44-8ffd-4a67-a464-18a61a8aaa94"><source>Make sure the cradle is secure and cannot be pulled off.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="106">Make sure the cradle is secure and cannot be pulled off.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="106">Certifique-se de que o suporte esteja seguro e não possa ser arrancado.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="106" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">01/08/2021 03:21:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">01/08/2021 03:21:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">251528117</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">BXBEF3eGXGj9E9e4eNgtiG4XVhUlc0Ycz427CXlcrSY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="1616fe22-99a5-4077-beb7-1252c9a9f502"><source>Place the wand (D) in the cradle (C) and connect the wand cable to the port marked <x id="159"/> at the back of the computing unit (A).</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="107">Place the wand (D) in the cradle (C) and connect the wand cable to the port marked <x id="159"/> at the back of the computing unit (A).</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="107">Coloque o leitor (D) no suporte (C) e conecte o cabo do leitor à porta marcada <x id="159"/> na parte de trás da unidade de computação (A).</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="107" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="V7rlg9fJtva6pOGbG6U8rE17p9GNHiCOVkG96MmD0dg="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1283349033</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">V7rlg9fJtva6pOGbG6U8rE17p9GNHiCOVkG96MmD0dg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c29c20ca-01c3-40ad-b0f8-f89ead3d1cff"><source>Connect the power cable (E) to the back of the computing unit (A) and then to the mains.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="108">Connect the power cable (E) to the back of the computing unit (A) and then to the mains.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="108">Conecte o cabo de alimentação (E) à parte traseira da unidade de computação (A) e, em seguida, à rede elétrica.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="108" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/10/2022 09:23:02</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/10/2022 09:23:02</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1141270494</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Kr1qY0dy5Yt5U3bGRWcQ6bvaNzMBEg371v/cqy7UJJM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0e5930b8-0ee3-4718-9e2c-d989ac633398"><source>Notes:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="109">Notes:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="109">Notas:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="109" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="MV5Vg0NrwdcmWKQ9naRB8KXHXb6LE+trTaKS4OubnEc="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/07/2019 00:22:06</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/19/2020 22:28:16</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-381729265</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">MV5Vg0NrwdcmWKQ9naRB8KXHXb6LE+trTaKS4OubnEc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2a5bd8ad-9b32-45db-8665-5493f810f70e"><source>Ensure that the power pack rests on the floor or on a table and does not dangle in the air.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="110">Ensure that the power pack rests on the floor or on a table and does not dangle in the air.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="110">Certifique-se de que a fonte de alimentação esteja apoiada no chão ou sobre uma mesa, sem ficar suspensa no ar.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="110" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">01/08/2021 03:24:20</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">01/08/2021 03:24:20</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1186387298</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Jd1b4+T4b8gYyicMdHm+a2GMO/RwdoE4xE+VsWYlWDQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="aa3971b8-85a5-4d93-b72e-31ab9ee12eff"><source>Do not allow the power pack to dangle in the air</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="111">Do not allow the power pack to dangle in the air</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="111">Não deixe a fonde de alimentação balançar no ar</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="111" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">01/04/2021 18:57:58</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">01/04/2021 18:57:58</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-885078823</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">/BBnUlV2vz5Xcn+nov0gT/P9SqTS9uVcdj6hV842ucM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5a4a25d0-5e9f-458f-a145-7ff723f6c363"><source>Never tilt the screen more than 45 degrees to make sure that the wand does not slip out of the cradle.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="112">Never tilt the screen more than 45 degrees to make sure that the wand does not slip out of the cradle.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="112">Nunca incline a tela mais de 45 graus, para garantir que o leitor não escorregue para fora do suporte.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="112" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">01/08/2021 03:25:39</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">01/08/2021 03:25:39</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1876239544</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">njVZssze8hyR7QytVLcX/zATsIgSeeA6Lf2Zf37epbM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="82ab5447-d536-4c96-afdd-dba96fc7fc54"><source>Never tilt the screen more than 45 degrees</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="113">Never tilt the screen more than 45 degrees</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="113">Nunca incline a tela mais de 45 graus</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="113" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">01/04/2021 19:02:41</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">01/04/2021 19:02:41</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2076291565</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">SKS0VNW/Cu0hv09qUbpnsyiRHlpT2zKxSyenKbpmgAU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\Resources\PageLayouts\Back_Cover.flpgl.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-language="pt-br"><header><reference><internal-file form="base64">UEsDBBQAAAAIACU0GVllUVQAgwQAABoXAAAQAAAAMnZhbmZtNXUubTBwLnhsZu1