/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="700628bb-7684-422b-bd88-b7cb452eb178"><source>Clear confirmation message</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Clear confirmation message</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Remover mensagem de confirmação</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="10" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/07/2022 17:27:38</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 01:29:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1357931710</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">pnzpO4gHJj+Ftd/MsZCkN7NfprGuNEvvBo1xeyMCyEc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a4bda50e-5fcb-44a9-8034-d986ac14835c"><source>Tap <g id="19">OK</g> to clear the patient&apos;s details.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">Tap <g id="19">OK</g> to clear the patient&apos;s details.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">Toque em <g id="19">OK</g> para remover os dados do paciente.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="11" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1689207852</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">u/XkQXGx7N7dWU5QHmnortINsw9qMy73As5W8i9KSLI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="10465e51-6534-461f-ab94-1c393544f352"><source>If required, you can select the <g id="31">Don&apos;t show me this again</g> check box.In the future, the patient details will be cleared from the <g id="35">New Scan</g> window as soon as you tap the <g id="38">Clear</g> button.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">If required, you can select the <g id="31">Don&apos;t show me this again</g> check box.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">In the future, the patient details will be cleared from the <g id="35">New Scan</g> window as soon as you tap the <g id="38">Clear</g> button.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">Se necessário, você pode marcar a caixa de seleção <g id="31">Não exibir novamente</g>.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">No futuro, os dados do paciente serão removidos da janela <g id="35">Nova Digitalização</g> assim que você tocar no botão <g id="38">Remover</g>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="12" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1131610454</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ikalsUdBA/aeV/MTT7yiQIk2OU8MLnep/ZKoZ5phd6c=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="13" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1607542882</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">CnB+HNGTCcC3FoNiOADjM5x5GWo0o7o/Jj5/kWjIBb8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="be90e43d-cca0-486f-952c-1f0f29b74a55"><source>All data is cleared from the <g id="45">New Scan</g> window, and you can now add a new patient or search for an existing patient, if required.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">All data is cleared from the <g id="45">New Scan</g> window, and you can now add a new patient or search for an existing patient, if required.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">Todos os dados são removidos da janela <g id="45">Nova Digitalização</g> e, agora, se necessário, é possível adicionar um novo paciente ou procurar por um usuário existente.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="14" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">849640590</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ECHNoweaKHIEhd6d9xhwbha94tiDrPrWoKHIWMLYXLI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\A. Clinic LAN network guidelines\Clinic LAN network guidelines.htm.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-language="pt-br"><header><reference><internal-file form="base64">UEsDBBQAAAAIACU0GVnXnGlf5QYAANY6AAAQAAAAeTBtZWJlbzUuYXYwLnhsZu1bXW7bOBB+L9A7
