dl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="4ec88953-4ae0-4644-b99e-19b4b09e1190"><source>Comparing scans</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Comparing scans</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:rep id="d7sqWGqv2wYbKV2rsPWgNF9kj0TjqA9OLeexkesG0kA="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">d7sqWGqv2wYbKV2rsPWgNF9kj0TjqA9OLeexkesG0kA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c805f0bf-9ec9-4ed3-a1ae-44482bedd418"><source>Patients:Comparing scans</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Patients:Comparing scans</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ufUOaB7hQGSPJW1KfuW+uE5iriDQ0LgMBTvEhbRwh7E=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ba6a53be-8208-463e-8ead-750d0bb99286"><source>Comparing previous scans using iTero TimeLapse technology</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Comparing previous scans using iTero TimeLapse technology</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Comparando digitalizações anteriores, com uso da tecnologia iTero TimeLapse</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/28/2020 08:56:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 15:58:38</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-821434711</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">hNz7+0BeMR9ezBq+DLbO/99HuzLHPWbJOMYEW47tljE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="572dacbb-5dd4-4c95-ac6e-a321d190d513"><source>Patients who are scanned regularly can have their scans analyzed using iTero TimeLapse technology.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Patients who are scanned regularly can have their scans analyzed using iTero TimeLapse technology.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Os pacientes digitalizados regularmente podem ter as suas digitalizações analisadas com uso da tecnologia iTero TimeLapse.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/07/2022 17:06:44</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 01:28:29</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-70818529</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">vHC7zrZr+3ElZXYhyackDzhPK1PafUhujUu7tVY+zCQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="bc256b6e-1bc8-423e-8176-b1c921a8f139"><source>iTero TimeLapse technology compares 2 of the patient’s previously captured 3D scans to allow visualization of the changes in the patient’s teeth, tooth structure, and oral soft tissues over the period between the scans.For example, iTero TimeLapse technology can display tooth wear, gingival recession, and tooth movement over the relevant period.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">iTero TimeLapse technology compares 2 of the patient’s previously captured 3D scans to allow visualization of the changes in the patient’s teeth, tooth structure, and oral soft tissues over the period between the scans.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">For example, iTero TimeLapse technology can display tooth wear, gingival recession, and tooth movement over the relevant period.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">A tecnologia TimeLapse do iTero compara duas das digitalizações 3D do paciente capturadas anteriormente para permitir a visualização das alterações nos dentes do paciente, na estrutura dentária e nos tecidos moles orais durante o período entre digitalizações.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Por exemplo, a tecnologia  iTero TimeLapse pode exibir desgaste dentário, recessão gengival e movimento dentário durante o período relevante.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="7" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/07/2022 17:09:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 01:28:32</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">253541443</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">qWr+CWT90q8lU5l3CgMUJebmlGHoKUwwgbkzqQwXOJU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="8" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/28/2020 08:56:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 15:59:01</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-702379011</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">TKH1ZavkfEOc2Qx0XGKPz6mLcRt9eE+0rwuIaMRd3Vw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="f78362ef-aa67-495c-ba51-5f6000c79a62"><source><g id="7">Note:</g> iTero TimeLapse technology is available for Orthodontic procedures only.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9"><g id="7">Note:</g> iTero TimeLapse technology is available for Orthodontic procedures only.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="9" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">L4BK0pglyFyyiv/FWScITeKB+JelU2g6+mlHtlVGRUY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="f4dec0c7-618e-4c5f-9b16-897749bf870b"><source>To use iTero TimeLapse technology:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">To use iTero TimeLapse technology:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Para usar a tecnologia TimeLapse do iTero:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="10" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="Source"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/25/2020 14:11:35</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 19:33:40</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">330767235</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">QVbdjlwNVqY00uO6DMcVVzO6i1TlArX2SekXdD2+0/o=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="92685990-6655-476d-ad88-ee12720ed8b1"><source>In the <g id="13">Patients</g> page, select the patient for whom to create an iTero TimeLapse visualization.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">In the <g id="13">Patients</g> page, select the patient for whom to create an iTero TimeLapse visualization.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">Na página <g id="13">Pacientes</g>, selecione o paciente para o qual criar uma visualização no iTero TimeLapse.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="11" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1285084440</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">qYbxCHRjFgZN3nQ8EXMVPLMu1MYL+TleepB6p55D3Ds=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="8c2999f5-62ec-4d64-ba52-2d6b426f90e4"><source>In the patient’s profile page, select two scans to compare.You can select the scans by selecting the check boxes next to the relevant orders, or by selecting the check boxes in the <g id="20">Timeline</g> area at the bottom of the page.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">In the patient’s profile page, select two scans to compare.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">You can select the scans by selecting the check boxes next to the relevant orders, or by selecting the check boxes in the <g id="20">Timeline</g> area at the bottom of the page.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">Na página de perfil do paciente, selecione duas digitalizações para comparar.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">Você pode selecionar as digitalizações, marcando as caixas de seleção próximas aos pedidos relevantes ou marcando as caixas de seleção na área <g id="20">Linha do Tempo</g>, na parte inferior da página.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="12" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/10/2019 01:05:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/22/2019 19:57:07</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-859211336</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">WZjNKpORzeanNd5b2qgrGLhdSod+77m8OJS6Cv8XccI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="13" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2120460768</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">HUzAgoLUuGilcMsLZ86lNBSYU9N8Rd+ZNLg00cBrD8w=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="9cea133f-02cd-42b4-acc1-dba820c3f9f3"><source>iTero TimeLapse – selecting the scans to compare</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">iTero TimeLapse – selecting the scans to compare</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">TimeLapse do iTero - selecionando as digitalizações para comparar</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="14" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/28/2020 08:56:47</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 16:00:40</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-794106432</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">xqB4Iy46IRiovAZGnaWvicuzVDmtaQTBDoAjaCgcvzs=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="63e90fc9-7531-4fc1-ab04-620322875272"><source><x id="31"/><x id="34"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="15"><x id="31"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="16"><x id="34"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="15"><x id="31"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="16"><x id="34"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="15" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="16" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="aae6c6d6-db37-4d56-8c65-d2d41a792371"><source>Tap the <g id="41">Compare Selected</g> button to compare and analyze the scans.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17">Tap the <g id="41">Compare Selected</g> button to compare and analyze the scans.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17">Toque no botão <g id="41">Comparar Selecionadas</g> para comparar e analisar as digitalizações.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="17" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-942549926</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">LiFWbqUtYsYIH6yfW066mdigc9DUy5frL9UlbSHZb/c=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="87f2c678-cc4d-47c0-9055-0c158dcf77ab"><source>The <g id="50">iTero TimeLapse</g> window is displayed, highlighting the areas with changes between the scans.The darker the color, the bigger the change between the scans, as displayed in the legend.<x id="52"/><x id="55"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18">The <g id="50">iTero TimeLapse</g> window is displayed, highlighting the areas with changes between the scans.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">The darker the color, the bigger the change between the scans, as displayed in the legend.<x id="52"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20"><x id="55"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18">A janela <g id="50">iTero TimeLapse</g> é exibida, destacando as áreas com alterações entre as digitalizações.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">Quanto mais escura a cor, maior a alteração entre as digitalizações, conforme exibido na legenda.<x id="52"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20"><x id="55"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="18" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/20/2024 11:29:40</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1789762875</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">kwC4o9pNtD2TqTTuPGWu4fLg/gTta46lcJvaHIQb81k=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="19" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/23/2021 13:26:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-874114450</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">6NtPscNHuNZGdSDXKIOTbF12WbeSBOF1cRRnVKVCqaM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="20" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="38bad8d3-b81d-445c-92fe-360add5c2515"><source>iTero TimeLapse window showing the highlighted changes between the scans</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">iTero TimeLapse window showing the highlighted changes between the scans</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">Janela iTero TimeLapse mostrando as alterações destacadas entre as digitalizações</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="21" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/28/2020 09:02:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 16:01:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1575947080</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">rXm4eA1o5EK5pLJleWhzkhoERuTHkvVBEFgQWqAhkiU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3a4f3c31-ed65-4367-b763-405a1a0d6db4"><source><g id="63">Note:</g> Changes are highlighted only when the scans are displayed in monochrome mode.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22"><g id="63">Note:</g> Changes are highlighted only when the scans are displayed in monochrome mode.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22"><g id="63">Nota:</g> as alterações são destacadas apenas quando as digitalizações são exibidas no modo monocromático.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="22" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">683793543</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">WB137SiY4PCzdaWtOIqtaYwTfv5XQxFnVANbvijicVE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5d5cbed9-1471-4883-916d-2df029a01ba6"><source>If required, tap <x id="65"/> to move the scan to the default occlusal view – lower arch with anterior teeth at the bottom and upper arch with anterior teeth at the top and both arches in a frontal view like the iRecord default view.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">If required, tap <x id="65"/> to move the scan to the default occlusal view – lower arch with anterior teeth at the bottom and upper arch with anterior teeth at the top and both arches in a frontal view like the iRecord default view.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">Se necessário, clique em <x id="65"/> para mover a digitalização para a visualização oclusal padrão - arco inferior com dentes dianteiros na parte de baixo, arco superior com dentes dianteiros na parte de cima e ambos os arcos em visualização frontal, como a visualização padrão do iRecord.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="23" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-980405651</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">rFIzIR0GPoJu3MuPrUuC5Js7q3WuY9OSTTUU+1OxR+k=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="307a3265-2507-453c-b551-9a7d0a4f2deb"><source>Drag the loupe onto the model to view areas of interest and potential treatment areas in the animation window.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">Drag the loupe onto the model to view areas of interest and potential treatment areas in the animation window.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">Arraste a lupa no modelo para visualizar, na janela de animação, as áreas de interesse e as áreas de tratamento em potencial.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="24" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/30/2020 20:40:34</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/30/2020 20:40:34</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1512379465</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">IyYpqnCvhMgxyl6aJbHPwwzVitZmWmYvZeNBTMUXuA0=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c54cb65a-c641-4b98-9837-03440c24f37d"><source>An animation is displayed, comparing the state of the teeth in the current area of interest on the selected scan dates.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">An animation is displayed, comparing the state of the teeth in the current area of interest on the selected scan dates.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Uma animação é exibida, comparando o estado dos dentes na atual área de interesse nas datas de digitalização selecionadas.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="25" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/28/2020 09:04:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modifie