mid="20">Center <x id="31"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">Além dos sons do sistema, as configurações de volume definem o volume do conteúdo do Centro de <x id="30"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">Aprendizagem <x id="31"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="19" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1712296280</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">vy4hSundADN54N+MJDrXyzaFmX5eEZsFXay7nH2mdGg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="20" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1105109282</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">H43YuP0Wlk5qB0eqixm6459kJQ3AiYTt1TCef+BQCIE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="83d7a485-d588-4566-9bfe-7cc7c03266c9"><source>Defining the Wi-Fi settings</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">Defining the Wi-Fi settings</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">Definindo a configuração do Wi-Fi</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="21" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/15/2020 14:54:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/31/2020 19:25:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-324858857</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">yN9RQOLRB4lCPN2nSxcfii+4RQnphuh52+J2y5r5DKQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="bedd5cc9-6b53-45db-b8f3-05c657b6e995"><source>The first time you connect the scanner to the clinic’s Wi-Fi network, you will need to add the password.After that, by default, the scanner will connect automatically.If you want to connect to a different Wi-Fi network, select the new network and enter the relevant password.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">The first time you connect the scanner to the clinic’s Wi-Fi network, you will need to add the password.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">After that, by default, the scanner will connect automatically.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">If you want to connect to a different Wi-Fi network, select the new network and enter the relevant password.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">Na primeira vez que você conectar o scanner à rede Wi-Fi da clínica, será necessário adicionar a senha.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">Depois disso, por padrão, o scanner se conectará automaticamente.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">Caso deseja se conectar a uma rede Wi-Fi diferente, selecione a nova rede e insira uma senha relevante.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="22" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/02/2020 14:44:44</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/21/2020 20:54:05</sdl:value><sdl:va