>Note:</g> The time zone settings can be accessed only when you are logged in to the scanner.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="42"><g id="101">Note:</g> The time zone settings can be accessed only when you are logged in to the scanner.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="42"><g id="101">Nota:</g> A configuração de fuso horário só pode ser acessada quando você estiver conectado ao scanner.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="42" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-672931800</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">2Tgj12yoQTgPvFddbTFJoWh7zgiOf43JK2eTgTVPGPg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\4. Working with the scanner\Defining the scanner settings.htm.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-language="pt-br"><header><reference><internal-file form="base64">UEsDBBQAAAAIACU0GVl6P2z38gUAABc6AAAQAAAAaGh1dnZsZ3YuMXJxLnhsZu0b227bNvS9QP+B
