 id="585f8c4d-49f1-4cb1-a2a3-f2eaadff52c4"><source>The System settings enable you to set the login settings, run diagnostics, view the licenses, view the system information, synchronize new updates from the server, and define the export settings.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="16">The System settings enable you to set the login settings, run diagnostics, view the licenses, view the system information, synchronize new updates from the server, and define the export settings.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="16"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="16" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">4uwj3ZYSeNZIdVLN5J7dSHOgMcPICDZok5Rq2paIc7w=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="340dc309-8d83-4089-b215-b07139ba8e71"><source>The System settings enable you to set the login settings, run diagnostics, view the licenses, view the system information, and synchronize new updates from the server.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17">The System settings enable you to set the login settings, run diagnostics, view the licenses, view the system information, and synchronize new updates from the server.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17">As configurações de Sistema permitem que você configure o login, execute diagnósticos, visualize as licenças e informações do sistema e sincronize novas atualizações do servidor.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="17" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="88"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="88"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ZTRBGmu7cZNsPLayLH41bAqIpiI2ook/iDuZjZKPkzI=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 16:56:47</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ZTRBGmu7cZNsPLayLH41bAqIpiI2ook/iDuZjZKPkzI=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 17:02:37</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">2024653847</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ad1b91fc-a521-4238-94ce-c16c076c9721"><source>Defining the login settings</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18">Defining the login settings</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18">Definindo as configurações de login</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="18" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/09/2019 11:53:33</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/22/2019 12:08:06</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1101415417</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">9yCi1enVoBfZhCz3kxTOOw+AHRQj6C8Vq4DmhIBVfcc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="553b985e-e8f3-42e2-9aee-f4578d6c138c"><source>In order to comply with privacy and security regulations, you will be logged out of the scanner after a predefined period of inactivity.By default, this time is set to 1 hour, but you can change it if required.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">In order to comply with privacy and security regulations, you will be logged out of the scanner after a predefined period of inactivity.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">By default, this time is set to 1 hour, but you can change it if required.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">Para estar em conformidade com os regulamentos de privacidade e segurança, você será desconectado do scanner após um período predefinido de inatividade.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">Esse período é definido em 1 hora, mas você pode alterar esse padrão se desejar.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="19" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/09/2019 11:54:40</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/22/2019 12:08:20</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-415309659</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">uutbdX90glv/7hSkvr6MD9Dp3XmcxVo1aXtx19lnEaI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="20" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/13/2020 10:46:50</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/22/2020 04:00:38</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1482578483</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">T6LGqh1IB4gcLJBGsXPXtoQEbdVHcLmm4aZaQNhXspE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="50932406-eff6-4994-b208-c45eae4a9041"><source>Notes:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">Notes:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">Notas:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="21" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="MV5Vg0NrwdcmWKQ9naRB8KXHXb6LE+trTaKS4OubnEc="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DE