ayed notifying that saliva moisture control is still required and that areas in which saliva is detected may need to be removed and rescanned.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="59">If you clear the check box, a confirmation message is displayed notifying that saliva moisture control is still required and that areas in which saliva is detected may need to be removed and rescanned.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="59">Se você desmarcar a caixa de seleção, será exibida uma mensagem de confirmação, notificando que ainda é necessário o controle de umidade da saliva e que as áreas nas quais a saliva é detectada podem precisar ser removidas e digitalizadas novamente.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="59" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1560229156</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FzlaHL6G2azmQJoxSc3h64ZOMPDVzwaAoIga3Ptjims=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ef7983e3-6adc-4158-b7c0-5536a87ae08e"><source><g id="45">Highlight recommended scanning range</g> check box</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="60"><g id="45">Highlight recommended scanning range</g> check box</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="60">Caixa de seleção <g id="45">Realçar intervalo recomendado de digitalização</g></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="60" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:val