on distance calculated from the equation applicable to the frequency of the transmitter.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">Portable and mobile RF communications equipment should be used no closer to any part of the <x id="33"/> system, Including cables, than the recommended separation distance calculated from the equation applicable to the frequency of the transmitter.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">Os equipamentos de comunicação de RF portáteis e móveis não devem ser usados ​​mais próximos de qualquer parte do sistema <x id="33"/> (incluindo os cabos) do que a distância de separação recomendada, calculada a partir da equação aplicável à frequência do transmissor.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="22" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1770345820</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">gzJIkm9T9zAZ+m0LBDkp7usqb0g0Wgijsl+4Prc/LpY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="172c7fc2-7129-477e-9dcd-1ab9bde5ea09"><source>Recommended separation distance:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">Recommended separation distance:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">Distância de separação recomendada:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="23" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1774536015</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">yjVhwRPajWA/OID04m0gWkybOlLfcggNzPKDkulumWs=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="8c759f71-3cdd-446d-8066-501e2169d09f"><source>where P is the maximum output power rating of the transmitter in watts (W) according to the transmitter manufacturer and d is the recommended separation distance in meters (m).</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">where P is the maximum output power rating of the transmitter in watts (W) according to the transmitter manufacturer and d is the recommended separation distance in meters (m).</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">onde P é a potência máxima de saída do transmissor em watts (W) de acordo com o fabricante do transmissor e d é a distância de separação recomendada em metros (m).</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="24" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1613628307</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">J8c56+2TOMiibLqz05ieJoIvKvUs8XcZV7k13W8rSrs=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="8682ee6c-bdd6-4132-8b70-f118d7a48952"><source>Field strengths from fixed RF transmitters, as determined by an electromagnetic site survey, should be less than the compliance level in each frequency range.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Field strengths from fixed RF transmitters, as determined by an electromagnetic site survey, should be less than the compliance level in each frequency range.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Conforme determinado por uma pesquisa eletromagnética no local, as intensidades do campo provenientes de transmissores de RF fixos devem ser inferiores ao nível de conformidade em cada faixa de frequência.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="25" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-96414054</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">19dR9hJwug/SCvRPQeaiK98SD4SRQh9eKSjN+P9TcLI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="8fed357c-6dca-4415-babe-2a2b5fae9ad8"><source>Interference may occur in the vicinity of equipment marked with the following symbol: <x id="35"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26">Interference may occur in the vicinity of equipment marked with the following symbol: <x id="35"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26">Podem ocorrer interferências nas proximidades de equipamentos marcados com o seguinte símbolo: <x id="35"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="26" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2128767302</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">IhufQ2RlD2I0mwck81yTsTg5vI6auLVc/a0SxBL9HW0=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="f0afb546-acbb-4089-aa51-58a26d6cea18"><source><g id="41">NOTE 1:</g> At 80 MHz and 800 MHz, the higher frequency range applies.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27"><g id="41">NOTE 1:</g> At 80 MHz and 800 MHz, the higher frequency range applies.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27"><g id="41">NOTA 1:</g> em 80 MHz e 800 MHz aplica-se a faixa de frequência mais alta.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="27" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/06/2024 13:12:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-253465009</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">UZsGZFOWF81HDnj9R+N9OfrJInpOoXDmRCbxTGsQKPE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="27833716-a252-40f3-bb0e-3f71d6e52d58"><source><g id="47">NOTE 2:</g> These guidelines may not apply in all situations.Electromagnetic propagation is affected by absorption and reflection from structures, objects and people.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28"><g id="47">NOTE 2:</g> These guidelines may not apply in all situations.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">Electromagnetic propagation is affected by absorption and reflection from structures, objects and people.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28"><g id="47">NOTA 2:</g> essas diretrizes podem não ser aplicáveis a todas as situações.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">A propagação eletromagnética é afetada pela absorção e pela reflexão de estruturas, objetos e pessoas.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="28" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/06/2024 13:14:44</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">388599568</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">i11hZdeNx6Eo+tnL4L5Hluq+Ui+7lriVcrLYbzuAqjg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="29" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="wyP3QR3KCQbqp5mOKc5pS3euZ4gpNUjxWYyYw4XrX08="/><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1581615104</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">wyP3QR3KCQbqp5mOKc5pS3euZ4gpNUjxWYyYw4XrX08=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="e85d9973-7342-410d-8ad4-fff2bac00b6c"><source>Field strengths from fixed transmitters, such as base stations for radio (cellular/cordless) telephones and land mobile radios, amateur radio, AM and FM radio broadcast and TV broadcast cannot be predicted theoretically with accuracy.To assess the electromagnetic environment due to fixed RF transmitters, an electromagnetic site survey should be considered.If the measured field strength in the location in which the <x id="55"/> system is used exceeds the applicable RF compliance level above, the <x id="56"/> system should be observed to verify normal operation.If abnormal performance is observed, additional measures may be necessary, such as re-orienting or relocating the <x id="58"/> system.Over the frequency range 150 kHz to 80 MHz, field strengths should be less than 3 V/m.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">Field strengths from fixed transmitters, such as base stations for radio (cellular/cordless) telephones and land mobile radios, amateur radio, AM and FM radio broadcast and TV broadcast cannot be predicted theoretically with accuracy.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31">To assess the electromagnetic environment due to fixed RF transmitters, an electromagnetic site survey should be considered.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32">If the measured field strength in the location in which the <x id="55"/> system is used exceeds the applicable RF compliance level above, the <x id="56"/> system should be observed to verify normal operation.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33">If abnormal performance is observed, additional measures may be necessary, such as re-orienting or relocating the <x id="58"/> system.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="34">Over the frequency range 150 kHz to 80 MHz, field strengths should be less than 3 V/m.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">As intensidades de campo provenientes de transmissores fixos, como, por exemplo, as estações base para telefones via rádio (celulares/sem fio) e rádios móveis terrestres, rádio amador, transmissões de rádio AM e FM e TV não podem ser previstas teoricamente com precisão</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31">Para avaliar o ambiente eletromagnético causado por transmissores de RF fixos, deve-se considerar uma pesquisa eletromagnética no local.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32">Se a intensidade do campo medida no local onde o sistema <x id="55"/> é usado ultrapassar o nível de conformidade de RF aplicável citado acima, o sistema <x id="56"/> deverá ser observado para verificar se o desempenho da operação está dentro da normalidade.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33">Se for observado um desempenho anormal, poderá ser necessário tomar medidas adicionais, como redirecionar ou alterar a posição do sistema <x id="58"/>.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="34">Na faixa de frequência de 150 kHz a 80 MHz, as intensidades de campo devem ser inferiores a 3 V/m.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="30" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2144800186</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">OjJkoIL8HkqySEBbDAj9P+QvOQmv/Y9W2fi5nY2XbZU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="31" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1315782466</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">CDTKyYhZJR+JRuIJ92PDa/IKe/OuPP9JWM9YebZ24h8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="32" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31: