l de acordo com a definição IEC 60601-1.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="26" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2028263068</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Ug4imdw9Gat8pP1hWcXTB2dPWtprGlDah2UBncataq0=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="27"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="29b6962e-055d-4f2e-8393-90ccf5f1b154"><source>This device complies with Part 15 of FCC Rules and its operation is subject to the following two conditions:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27">This device complies with Part 15 of FCC Rules and its operation is subject to the following two conditions:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27">Este equipamento está em conformidade com a Parte 15 das Regras da FCC e sua operação está sujeita às duas condições a seguir:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="27" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="AvZr7n3C9O22bfD4z2ESi+tZPuxrTVYzWiLtVOnM7Sw="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/31/2020 17:42:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/22/2020 04:13:27</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2056939631</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">AvZr7n3C9O22bfD4z2ESi+tZPuxrTVYzWiLtVOnM7Sw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="28"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="e84f76ea-1f43-42d2-8954-1b8aec78b6e3"><source>This device may not cause harmful Electromagnetic (EM) interference.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28">This device may not cause harmful Electromagnetic (EM) interference.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28">Este equipamento não causa interferência Eletromagnético (EM) prejudicial.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="28" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:55</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-384771091</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">dtKSGvqhdaIuJ2D/Bv/8u3TL70ag68NQ33iCuxd1eXM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="28"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="432f545b-4b61-4469-b7b6-f4a567e49ca5"><source>This device must accept any EM interference received, including any that may cause undesired operation.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">This device must accept any EM interference received, including any that may cause undesired operation.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">Este dispositivo deve aceitar qualquer interferência EM recebida, incluindo qualquer uma que possa causar operação indesejável.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="29" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:55</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1546590626</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">kWFXUC7mXgJbeYoQGOUBrkvU5CZKkbQj5zWDNKubPJM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="27"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="df21f679-114c-4d54-bc3a-570f4998fc1d"><source>Modifications to the device that are not expressly approved by the manufacturer may void your authority to operate the device under FCC Rules.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">Modifications to the device that are not expressly approved by the manufacturer may void your authority to operate the device under FCC Rules.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">Modificações no equipamento, caso não sejam expressamente aprovadas pelo fabricante, podem anular sua autoridade para operar o equipamento sob as regras da FCC.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="30" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="RlNhG5gk3LIcx+tByheq/iIfq+xs/N0BvDAW5qHXIqk="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/30/2020 23:43:30</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/30/2020 23:43:30</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1487614061</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">RlNhG5gk3LIcx+tByheq/iIfq+xs/N0BvDAW5qHXIqk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3a390496-80ca-4382-8f3b-82a177c268aa"><source>The <g id="43">iTero Lumina Pro</g><x id="44"/> Dental Imaging system main performance according to IEC TR 60601-4-2 are:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31">The <g id="43">iTero Lumina Pro</g><x id="44"/> Dental Imaging system main performance according to IEC TR 60601-4-2 are:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31">O desempenho principal do sistema de Imagem Dentário do <g id="43">iTero Lumina Pro</g><x id="44"/> de acordo com a norma IEC TR 60601-4-2 são:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="31" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">q0EzX/PUFaAXKf59KoL57p2WOJGXVseIPB5heDw7fdg=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 17:26:02</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">q0EzX/PUFaAXKf59KoL57p2WOJGXVseIPB5heDw7fdg=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/28/2024 17:26:17</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1140189469</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="29"/><sdl:cxt id="30"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="1dede2cf-f465-48ba-b167-a22b085a1682"><source>Continuously display scanned images, without interference, on the <g id="53">iTero Lumina Pro</g><x id="54"/> monitor.In case of image disappearance and appearance with non-communication message on the screen, the scanner can be returned to operating mode by user intervention or by auto recovery.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32">Continuously display scanned images, without interference, on the <g id="53">iTero Lumina Pro</g><x id="54"/> monitor.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33">In case of image disappearance and appearance with non-communication message on the screen, the scanner can be returned to operating mode by user intervention or by auto recovery.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32">Exibir continuamente as imagens digitalizadas, sem interferência, no monitor do <g id="53">iTero Lumina Pro</g><x id="54"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33">Em caso de desaparecimento e aparecimento da imagem com uma mensagem de não-comunicação na tela, o scanner pode ser retornado ao seu modo operacional após ou por recuperação automática.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="32" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">lmpqV9al+7tn66KVTnb4bQVVNaoPh5G4/zJJUfkN288=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 17:00:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">232787132</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="33" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FqhWbS3i+XamytPSY331HBGnsNPdOW/WM47YfbEM/N0=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 17:18:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">2053465590</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="29"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ebf1c5ba-6450-45cd-9e8e-afd879e9da36"><source>Stored scan data is accessible and can be displayed without any damage to the scan information.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="34">Stored scan data is accessible and can be displayed without any damage to the scan information.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="34">Os dados de digitalização armazenados podem ser exibidos sem qualquer dano a informação da digitalização.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="34" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">nPlSc5PDuRjlQKxwKggn2ubyhaq9DQ8MWvNIzs0KF+4=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 17:00:59</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1462814228</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="27"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="7c3789d7-4b54-4926-9419-0df48543a1d1"><source>Notes:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="35">Notes:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="35">Notas:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="35" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="MV5Vg0NrwdcmWKQ9naRB8KXHXb6LE+trTaKS4OubnEc="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/07/2019 00:22:06</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/19/2020 22:28:16</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-381729265</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">MV5Vg0NrwdcmWKQ9naRB8KXHXb6LE+trTaKS4OubnEc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="31"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3675f1cd-25aa-4584-beeb-89c9c2357311"><source>“Harmful interference” is defined in 47 CFR §2.122 by the FCC as follows: Interference which endangers the functioning of a radionavigation service or of other safety services or seriously degrades, obstructs, or repeatedly interrupts a radio communication service operating in accordance with the [ITU] Radio Regulations.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="36">“Harmful interference” is defined in 47 CFR §2.122 by the FCC as follows: Interference which endangers the functioning of a radionavigation service or of other safety services or seriously degrades, obstructs, or repeatedly interrupts a radio communication service operating in accordance with the [ITU] Radio Regulations.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="36">“Interferência prejudicial” é definida em 47 CFR §2.122 pela FCC da seguinte forma: Interferência que põe em perigo o funcionamento de um serviço de radionavegação ou de outros serviços de segurança ou que degrada gravemente, obstrui ou interrompe repetidamente um serviço de comunicação de rádio operando de acordo com os Regulamentos de Radiocomunicações [UIT].</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="36" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1659595474</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">pZUWbmdP9CRGIFvOdhmlEWyzeDf+P8JNfB+m9wj/5K4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="31"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="cdd4fd6e-2efe-42f0-94d6-19787985918d"><source>Interference may occur in the vicinity of the device.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="37">Interference may occur in the vicinity of the device.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="37">Podem ocorrer interferências nas proximidades do dispositivo.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="37" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">107315244</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">uHP+h9qbDUrERTw944M6wlRjUE5M3qqeIYUg0Kgx9/A=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="31"/><sdl:cxt id="32"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0aeceac2-1dfb-43d5-9902-78fce5bb93a3"><source>Due to electromagnetic disturbance, in some cases, the image may disappear and a non-communication message will appear on the touch screen.The scanner will return to operation mode after user intervention or auto-recovery.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38">Due to electromagnetic disturbance, in some cases, the image may disappear and a non-communication message will appear on the touch screen.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39">The scanner will return to operation mode after user intervention or auto-recovery.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38">Devido a distúrbios eletromagnéticos, em alguns casos, a imagem poderá desaparecer e uma mensagem de não-comunicação surgirá na tela tátil.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39">O scanner retornará ao modo de operação após a intervenção do usuário ou por recuperação automática.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="38" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/11/2019 10:36:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:59:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1793261613</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">IAITDahp+W+2MH8LEYvfI/pYRzxMaZ14LGQFD8KODcE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="39" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/11/2019 10:36:33</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/24/2019 02:29:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1714701052</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">+7J+PrS+uoeKuyYmXsowDrKordu3hHgKCDXtIELoXxo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="7ba2d5fc-323a-40d5-9666-2d9543a04204"><source>The following is a summary of the EMC test results for <x id="60"/> scanners:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40">The following is a summary of the EMC test results for <x id="60"/> scanners:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40">A seguir, é apresentado um resumo dos resultados do teste EMC para os scanners do <x id="60"/>:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="40" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:27</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:27</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2012485950</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">sdrRfGF23rhOo/C6egTsneGGOWlZwa+oEftiJ9X7m54=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5a06b3b1-b78d-49fd-8056-6699de73c4e5"><source>Test</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="41">Test</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="41">Teste</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="41" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/11/2019 10:37:02</sdl:value