 you regarding saliva detection.&lt;/MadCap:placeholderCondition&gt;" word-end="false">&lt;ph id=&quot;1&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;</ph><props><value key="prefix"></value><value key="localName">ph</value><value key="namespaces"></value><value key="isEmptyElement">False</value><value key="nodeType">Element</value><value key="displayText">&lt;MadCap:placeholderCondition xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&gt;From this point on during the scan, the drop icon will not be displayed to notify you regarding saliva detection.&lt;/MadCap:placeholderCondition&gt;</value><value key="hasDisplayText">True</value><value key="attribute:id">1</value><value key="attribute:xmlns">urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2</value></props></tag><tag id="21"><ph name="&lt;MadCap:placeholderCondition xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&gt;However, areas with excess saliva may still need to be removed and rescanned.&lt;/MadCap:placeholderCondition&gt;" word-end="false">&lt;ph id=&quot;1&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;</ph><props><value key="prefix"></value><value key="localName">ph</value><value key="namespaces"></value><value key="isEmptyElement">False</value><value key="nodeType">Element</value><value key="displayText">&lt;MadCap:placeholderCondition xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&gt;However, areas with excess saliva may still need to be removed and rescanned.&lt;/MadCap:placeholderCondition&gt;</value><value key="hasDisplayText">True</value><value key="attribute:id">1</value><value key="attribute:xmlns">urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2</value></props></tag></tag-defs></header><body><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c1face08-eafc-4f70-a69a-e0640bdc2c38"><source>Tools:Saliva detection</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="1">Tools:Saliva detection</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="1"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="1" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">6DfOJe9+vlZiBMZeTDKD/J+/skZKVaLpsRrEWLX/dPk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="56b731ce-a925-4e55-9021-fb7d424bb0a3"><source>Saliva detection tool</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Saliva detection tool</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:rep id="s/CgcHxsZSfoVnRls5+nj9L04/GD1LuCA8rntJD0RCQ="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">s/CgcHxsZSfoVnRls5+nj9L04/GD1LuCA8rntJD0RCQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="fd072eb6-e16d-464b-8874-b1f2e0d6f637"><source>Enabling saliva detection</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Enabling saliva detection</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Ativando a detecção de saliva</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-528159168</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">1BJtwZ70eqKrpBv7TNwkGalfOOjxkgrz4pLcBz5Dh/E=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="567d921a-12c2-42f2-a76a-61a507d894fa"><source>You can enable saliva detection while scanning, applicable only from the point at which this feature is enabled and only for the current scan session.You will not be notified regarding saliva detection in the next scan.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">You can enable saliva detection while scanning, applicable only from the point at which this feature is enabled and only for the current scan session.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">You will not be notified regarding saliva detection in the next scan.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Você pode ativar a detecção de saliva durante a digitalização, aplicável apenas a partir do momento em que esse recurso esteja ativado e apenas para a sessão de digitalização atual.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Na próxima digitalização, você não será notificado sobre a detecção de saliva.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1569503986</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ZAB9tjJfYm/w8KpMEal7bgtltEVcu5wWfqCXgFLYic0=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-279416737</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">eWJ19dAPnzPjOp2USCIPubbKihdw4Dwxd1rGGzobdko=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="56a8d312-a681-4ae3-901f-866f69347b43"><source>If required, you can enable saliva detection for all scans by default, as described in <x id="3"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">If required, you can enable saliva detection for all scans by default, as described in <x id="3"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Se necessário, você pode ativar a detecção de saliva para todas as digitalizações por padrão, conforme descrito em <x id="3"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1705809602</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">XBgKMSCI9tJFKa45g/7tft4acsOaTHeVhz0NrRTQ1Xs=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="9acbf39e-e5c7-4d7f-aa5b-add82ed2dd81"><source>To enable saliva detection while scanning:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">To enable saliva detection while scanning:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Para ativar a detecção de saliva durante a digitalização:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="7" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1273956464</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">njGqDO++eVLByTH0MYFGkLhmDcCvJmRXZh6olUFinEg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="07e77657-75ae-4c66-b0bd-1c38c6930b64"><source>In the <g id="9">Scan</g> window, pause the scan, and then press the screen to display the editing tools.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">In the <g id="9">Scan</g> window, pause the scan, and then press the screen to display the editing tools.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Na janela <g id="9">Digitalização</g>, pause a digitalização e pressione a tela para exibir as ferramentas de edição.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="8" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-488720426</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">1JhJEwJXBqO4W5OrSJVXq4X1JyNfMq8RAoiimLt0hJA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a67a3133-f715-4fce-9800-b90d393056c3"><source>Tap the <g id="16">Enable Saliva Detection</g> tool <x id="17"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">Tap the <g id="16">Enable Saliva Detection</g> tool <x id="17"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">Toque na ferramenta de <g id="16">Ativar a Detecção de Saliva</g><x id="17"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="9" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 21:18:10</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1820270026</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">gwoD6LNQTlH4neYLq6kHgxpc8RufNGPWv+Fr4CCnR/U=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="281e1c60-cfa4-4355-9050-6a4419fe62f1"><source>Enable Saliva Detection tool</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Enable Saliva Detection tool</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Ativar a ferramenta de Detecção de Saliva</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="10" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1263427071</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">WlTs5KVeFfyHZE6PrRElufBTpVDz2zpBbtV9P2pnKJ8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="4eb69f49-1503-43ef-90f8-70e72f5e2730"><source>From this point on during the scan, whenever saliva is detected, a drop icon is displayed on the screen and holes are displayed on the 3D model in the areas where the saliva was detected.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">From this point on during the scan, whenever saliva is detected, a drop icon is displayed on the screen and holes are displayed on the 3D model in the areas where the saliva was detected.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">A partir deste ponto durante a digitalização, sempre que for detectada saliva, um ícone de gota será exibido na tela e furos serão exibidos no modelo 3D nas áreas onde a saliva foi detectada.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="11" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1098036407</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">9yY18oIyPWo+2VSd479r3ByD5X7i0e5IYhId/H6SCV8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="1f07d40d-73f0-4a90-80ed-b99679ca8fef"><source><x id="18"/><x id="21"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12"><x id="18"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13"><x id="21"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12"><x id="18"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13"><x id="21"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="12" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl: