eg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="30" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">nTPpcU2R1frM8JZuqXZrG9WoKyvLsE5zEL3SFyf8EOE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="42fa436f-33b2-4db2-a5cd-7f38bf9ce0a6"><source>Declaration of Conformity as issued by Advantech Co., Ltd. for panel PC models POC-ALG-W156 and POC-ALG-W216, which declares compliance with FCC requirements</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31">Declaration of Conformity as issued by Advantech Co., Ltd. for panel PC models POC-ALG-W156 and POC-ALG-W216, which declares compliance with FCC requirements</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31">Declaração de Conformidade emitida pela Advantech Co., Ltd. para o painel PC modelos POC-ALG-W156 POC-ALG-W216, que declara conformidade com os requisitos da FCC</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="31" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="90"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="90"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">LU16dgFnF9i0jZXPLsmbBnCnq/NbnbwiLhMrGvfzNT0=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 17:50:45</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">LU16dgFnF9i0jZXPLsmbBnCnq/NbnbwiLhMrGvfzNT0=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 17:27:32</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1993658465</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ddf681a2-71b7-403a-84f5-627563615d6e"><source>As manufacturer we declare under our sole of responsibility that the equipment follows the provisions of FCC Equipment Authorization Procedures under CERTIFICATION (47 CFR Section 2.907) and/or SUPPLIER’S DECLARATION OF CONFORMITY (47 CFR Section 2.906) as stated above.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32">As manufacturer we declare under our sole of responsibility that the equipment follows the provisions of FCC Equipment Authorization Procedures under CERTIFICATION (47 CFR Section 2.907) and/or SUPPLIER’S DECLARATION OF CONFORMITY (47 CFR Section 2.906) as stated above.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32">Como fabricante, declaramos, sob nossa exclusiva responsabilidade, que o equipamento segue as disposições dos Procedimentos de Autorização de Equipamento da FCC sob a CERTIFICAÇÃO (47 CFR Seção 2.907) e/ou da DECLARAÇÃO DE CONFORMIDADE DO FORNECEDOR (47 CFR Seção 2.906), conforme declarado acima.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="32" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/28/2020 11:02:58</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 15:13:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">886677820</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">C9pyA4DyHjCIQDEtIdLzsgMjXi6RhSsI+O3cwvX1tHc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5a37a706-182b-46d1-8488-fa007c79d18b"><source>Thus, is placed on the product <x id="99"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33">Thus, is placed on the product <x id="99"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33">Assim, é colocado no produto <x id="99"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="33" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:55</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 18:01:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1091631534</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">d51jD254hxnZ6atGiT7xgtqBqQ8xYSd2HDK7p2vKSD4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\A. Clinic LAN network guidelines\Firewall.htm.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-language="pt-br"><header><reference><internal-file form="base64">UEsDBBQAAAAIACU0GVlTOMGtSwMAAKkOAAAQAAAAdW9iZGh6b3guZ25iLnhsZu1XwW7cNhC9B8g/
