urce><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27"><x id="79"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28"><x id="82"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="27" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="28" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="25"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="eebc7988-ec98-48da-8d24-397fa556db9c"><source>iTero Lumina Pro is a dental imaging system intended to record and display the topographical images of teeth, oral tissue and bite relationship and to obtain optical impressions for use in CAD/CAM of dental devices.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">iTero Lumina Pro is a dental imaging system intended to record and display the topographical images of teeth, oral tissue and bite relationship and to obtain optical impressions for use in CAD/CAM of dental devices.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">O iTero Lumina é um sistema de imagem dentário destinado a registrar e exibir imagens topográficas de dentes, tecidos orais e registros oclusais e a obter digitalizações ópticas para uso em CAD/CAM de aparelhos odontológicos.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="29" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="92"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="92"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">hXlV0w/lK0TktV29FJpLqnz+dk9gMw45yr3GVFtD3r8=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 17:52:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">hXlV0w/lK0TktV29FJpLqnz+dk9gMw45yr3GVFtD3r8=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">847701632</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="25"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="25f1ddf3-2769-4f09-9b40-3d60b639f5a7"><source>The system is also intended to record and display near infrared images of the teeth to aid in detecting interproximal caries above the gingiva and monitoring the progress of such lesions.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">The system is also intended to record and display near infrared images of the teeth to aid in detecting interproximal caries above the gingiva and monitoring the progress of such lesions.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">O sistema também é destinado a registrar e exibir imagens infravermelhas próximas dos dentes para facilitar a detecção de cáries interproximais acima da gengiva e monitorar o progresso de tais lesões.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="30" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">tRirq3LG79DOiE34Q8UETy+2ZeJ3nM1+62dHtoYFCLk=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 17:21:02</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-511673292</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="26"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="4f82fdb9-fdf5-4e72-99bc-bac9b3b6eb42"><source>Indications for use</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31">Indications for use</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31">Indicações de uso</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="31" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/06/2022 11:19:35</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/06/2022 11:19:35</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1757594258</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Wi3hD5kKjeitqjJxSNNPtaWPb1UPc4dslfpVL8SUlNU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="27"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="88508ed2-5b21-419f-b455-48ea0965cc03"><source>iTero Element scanners are indicated for use for orthodontic treatment planning and follow-up, restorative treatment planning and/or routine dental assessment.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32">iTero Element scanners are indicated for use for orthodontic treatment planning and follow-up, restorative treatment planning and/or routine dental assessment.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="32" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">4CQ/zBGckM6owUjYopgHDhagyKPgjdI9EA330RdnJpY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="21"/><sdl:cxt id="22"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="af503c24-f2db-4f56-aa4f-5b86a7844bd4"><source><x id="88"/><x id="91"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33"><x id="88"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="34"><x id="91"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33"><x id="88"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="34"><x id="91"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="33" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="34" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="28"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="8ab30c44-782b-44a8-a21d-5dcbd6831cc2"><source><x id="94"/> is indicated for routine oral health assessment and dental treatment planning and follow-up.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="35"><x id="94"/> is indicated for routine oral health assessment and dental treatment planning and follow-up.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="35"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="35" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">wKJ8oMvEwVlxMbofcaHX3sNaJ5xdN1VVxsZb+Cvidvg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="29"/><sdl:cxt id="30"/><sdl:cxt id="31"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0c8ea4dc-701f-43c1-a7a0-9ae5126c682b"><source><x id="96"/><x id="99"/><x id="102"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="36"><x id="96"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="37"><x id="99"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38"><x id="102"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="36"><x id="96"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="37"><x id="99"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38"><x id="102"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="36" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="37" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="38" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="32"/><sdl:cxt id="33"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="edec0ae6-42bb-43c3-8cb7-9dd03b245f0b"><source><x id="111"/><x id="112"/> scans can be used for computer aided design and manufacturing of restorative dental devices, orthodontic devices and other dental devices such as night guards and bite splints.Data generated from <x id="114"/> may be used by dental healthcare professionals for assessing intraoral topographical images in hard and soft tissue, visual assessments and aid in the detection and monitoring of interproximal tooth decay.<x id="116"/> does not treat or diagnose any disease.<x id="117"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39"><x id="111"/><x id="112"/> scans can be used for computer aided design and manufacturing of restorative dental devices, orthodontic devices and other dental devices such as night guards and bite splints.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40">Data generated from <x id="114"/> may be used by dental healthcare professionals for assessing intraoral topographical images in hard and soft tissue, visual assessments and aid in the detection and monitoring of interproximal tooth decay.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="41"><x id="116"/> does not treat or diagnose any disease.<x id="117"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39">As digitalizações do<x id="111"/><x id="112"/> podem ser usadas ​​para projeto e fabricação auxiliados por computador de aparelhos dentários, aparelhos ortodônticos e de outros aparelhos odontológicos, como os protetores noturnos e as talas para mordidas.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40">Os dados gerados do <x id="114"/> podem ser utilizados por profissionais da saúde dentária para avaliar imagens topográficas intraorais de tecidos duros e moles, avaliações visuais e auxiliar na detecção e monitoramento do desgaste interproximal do dente.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="41">O <x id="116"/> não trata nem diagnostica nenhuma doença.<x id="117"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="39" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="94"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="94"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">9m9rd/bvAqnffx9Alq/IRIGgl6nbUI0p0j6vUETs5rg=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 17:52:41</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">9m9rd/bvAqnffx9Alq/IRIGgl6nbUI0p0j6vUETs5rg=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-2076949635</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="40" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:prev-origin/>