IfCr+5m9FOfnOfhfoPF3VVpo9g="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/06/2019 13:09:05</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/22/2019 17:04:47</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">725137610</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">pdsRAx/fywwtqOAoEIfCr+5m9FOfnOfhfoPF3VVpo9g=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0e7600a5-3351-47d4-bb61-ead117eee241"><source>For persons who have been diagnosed with Epilepsy, there is a risk of epileptic seizure from the flashing light of the iTero scanner.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="43">For persons who have been diagnosed with Epilepsy, there is a risk of epileptic seizure from the flashing light of the iTero scanner.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="43">Para pessoas que foram diagnosticadas com Epilepsia, existe o risco de choque epilético devido à luz intermitente do scanner iTero.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="43" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="He+dBY4EzcfWoNS43nxvnp2Q2kh/LpI2HK85diPMxvA="/><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/20/2024 11:29:33</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 14:19:03</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">537781302</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">He+dBY4EzcfWoNS43nxvnp2Q2kh/LpI2HK85diPMxvA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0c590286-16ec-4a86-a358-9d48c2bd347c"><source>Intended patient population</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="44">Intended patient population</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="44">População de pacientes pretendida</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="44" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/06/2022 11:19:37</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/06/2022 11:19:37</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1480475239</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">dr9Elod/rOWLRChJXxXRi92yIvwgVbxyPwUmd8BmSHk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="34"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="f997b50e-eaa5-4e51-8fd8-14dc9f57f8a5"><source>The system may be used on patients classified as Children, Adolescents, and Adults.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="45">The system may be used on patients classified as Children, Adolescents, and Adults.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="45">O sistema pode ser usado em pacientes classificados como Crianças, Adolescentes e Adultos.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="45" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">423402065</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">EmmTynjfnFhsA0BGPxDpGRKBPk+fSdnVBT963wUby5Q=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="35"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="fc077c3c-6072-431c-8742-849ae1112b72"><source>The system may be used on patients classified as Preadolescents, Adolescents, and Adults.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="46">The system may be used on patients classified as Preadolescents, Adolescents, and Adults.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="46"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="46" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">rMLLah4UdM3IYE7nNTW/mPphe9gsEzgooRBq8BZemVg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="36"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="e616bdfe-ec82-4566-a445-028db4182ab0"><source>The system may be used on patients classified as Children<x id="121"/>, Preadolescents, Adolescents, and Adults.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="47">The system may be used on patients classified as Children<x id="121"/>, Preadolescents, Adolescents, and Adults.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="47"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="47" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">lOR7x15ejhVGOEvHReouBWQeZj+G8ePkF+Adtv1scIQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="e4452b4f-a849-4e42-9740-00a43ce4e738"><source>Intended users</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="48">Intended users</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="48">Usuários pretendidos</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="48" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/06/2022 11:19:38</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/06/2022 11:19:38</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-41512101</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">+zLASn61u6qnCXGmj1tTFAfUqR6X8gIov71oBhGkhjw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="765185e8-d7f6-407f-aca5-3facfbe95d43"><source>The system serves as a prescription medical device and should be operated by trained <x id="128"/><g id="131">dental health-care</g> providers only.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="49">The system serves as a prescription medical device and should be operated by trained <x id="128"/><g id="131">dental health-care</g> providers only.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="49">O sistema funciona como um dispositivo para a prescrição médica e deve ser operado apenas por profissionais da <x id="128"/><g id="131">saúde dentária</g> treinados.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="49" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/04/2024 20:17:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-536383014</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">NMMLF/k++WZpZ2L+LRYj93aUoP9KirmkRxHelTsVjrE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="8ac29317-d8eb-4e86-875e-a17d6d92d8b1"><source>Use environment</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="50">Use environment</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="50">Ambiente de uso</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="50" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/06/2022 11:19:40</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/06/2022 11:19:40</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1589311854</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Gm/7HrGKJ6JgOx4CXRdHfAZJr4OJs+wyjEJv6TWSltc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="27"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="09e70ba0-1e82-4047-8385-25e51eefc5d3"><source>Professional Healthcare and Home Healthcare Facility environment.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="51">Professional Healthcare and Home Healthcare Facility environment.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="51"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="51" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">xX1Vi3SDCLaEtVz/G4ACJPnRNeTZytnZuBbNx5cW7s0=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="34"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="46404655-41eb-412f-a86a-62411ecc2665"><source>The system may be used in a Professional Healthcare environment.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="52">The system may be used in a Professional Healthcare environment.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="52">O sistema pode ser usado em um ambiente de Assistência Odontológica Profissional.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="52" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1338793021</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">A8apksUAIWdqWap/zLdguu1uKqfsV1JT1/4djpbmAgs=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="37"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="8f040937-6b12-4cfc-88eb-0effd727c0e8"><source>Clinical benefits</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="53">Clinical benefits</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="53">Benefícios clínicos</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="53" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/06/2022 11:19:41</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/06/2022 11:19:41</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-680885030</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">GjTLg5AjoUoWyNk4bQXvOldq5sxZTEp9i/JwNsPrwcc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="38"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="37700732-f512-4034-a8e7-50e5eaf7141b"><source>Digital impressions improve patient comfort, accuracy, and speed of process as compared to conventional impressions.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="54">Digital impressions improve patient comfort, accuracy, and speed of process as compared to conventional impressions.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="54">Em comparação com as impressões convencionais, as impressões digitais melhoram o conforto do paciente, a velocidade e a precisão do processo.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="54" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="95"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="95"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">TZOlP3sAP5KxbDOX8OD/pKWgGRPTzYPUTCEBFatODYw=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 18:08:10</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">TZOlP3sAP5KxbDOX8OD/pKWgGRPTzYPUTCEBFatODYw=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 17:22:59</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1159923414</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="38"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="be5a7fda-932e-4624-976a-b5aa139024f3"><source>The <x id="138"/><g id="141">iTero Lumina Pro</g> imaging systems aid in the detection and monitoring of interproximal carious lesions above the gingiva without using harmful radiation.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="55">The <x id="138"/><g id="141">iTero Lumina Pro</g> imaging systems aid in the detection and monitoring of interproximal carious lesions above the gingiva without using harmful radiation.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="55">O sistema de imagem do <x id="138"/><g id="141">iTero Lumina Pro</g> auxilia na detecção e monitoramento das lesões cariosas interproximais acima da gengiva, sem utilizar uma radiação prejudicial.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="55" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">WaKbcCgDs+M1cqWe+p0R6znXoIY+4AF3lRnMG5LSVjA=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 18:09:12</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">WaKbcCgDs+M1cqWe+p0R6znXoIY+4AF3lRnMG5LSVjA=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 17:23:13</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/28/2024 18:09:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1638927067</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="38"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="bf91087d-7af7-4c57-a63f-3bd860042799"><source>Non-ionizing radiation imaging provides clinical-assessment flexibility with frequent monitoring of interproximal carious lesions.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="56">Non-ionizing radiation imaging provides clinical-assessment flexibility with frequent monitoring of interproximal carious lesions.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="56">O sistema de imagem de radiação não ionizante fornece flexibilidade na avaliação clínica com frequente monitoramento das lesões cariosas interproximais.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="56" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">T423bGLUEYzoj6yQb6YrsKPxQiBu2PcleBN09n8W9+w=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:31:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-433776514</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="39"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="4e5b8cc4-c268-4467-abb4-d78ba3a608a6"><source>Digital impressions improve patient comfort and speed of process as compared to conventional impressions.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="57">Digital impressions improve patient comfort and speed of process as compared to conventional impressions.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="57"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="57" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">7HApheO41ahMYw7SidrRTqhGGrzE5G+i8rLgOU1n