mtype="seg" mid="2">Internet connection guidelines</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:rep id="KF6J8csZDSTsYc6IbRn1IHScfqwRnI6ytxZd+FmQL1Y="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">KF6J8csZDSTsYc6IbRn1IHScfqwRnI6ytxZd+FmQL1Y=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="86aeda5b-3535-4148-aa2c-a93d7550e630"><source>Internet connection guidelines</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Internet connection guidelines</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Regras de conexão à internet</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="KF6J8csZDSTsYc6IbRn1IHScfqwRnI6ytxZd+FmQL1Y="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/06/2019 18:24:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/31/2020 06:44:34</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2054364789</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">KF6J8csZDSTsYc6IbRn1IHScfqwRnI6ytxZd+FmQL1Y=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="425d2c1d-b100-4406-9ca7-13c68ef6adc9"><source>In order to achieve the best performance of your iTero scanner, ensure that the internet connection upload speed is at least 1Mbps per scanner.Also, note that any additional devices connected to the internet in parallel to the scanner may affect the scanner’s performance.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">In order to achieve the best performance of your iTero scanner, ensure that the internet connection upload speed is at least 1Mbps per scanner.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Also, note that any additional devices connected to the internet in parallel to the scanner may affect the scanner’s performance.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Para obter o melhor desempenho do seu scanner iTero, certifique-se de que a velocidade de upload da sua conexão à internet seja de pelo menos 1 Mbps por scanner.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Além disso, note que, se houver algum dispositivo adicional conectado à internet em paralelo com o scanner, isso pode afetar o desempenho do scanner.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/13/2020 07:21:57</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/22/2020 02:31:07</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-688422525</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">e1ToJeXfHBC3Jk6PzBLYMz5HWczGoj98Bjc8/WZxIn0=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/26/2020 08:22:29</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/31/2020 18:39:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">571783272</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">zy7XRvTC0o99D/JvmKDE5xM/mUzy47p5HhaBS0WP5V8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\1. Introduction\Introduction Combined.htm.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-l