, giving you the ultimate in mobility and the freedom to provide dedicated care wherever you choose to see patients.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="16"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="16" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">hsfyO5e/c2Wbfsb4kv1mVgw0RgUvE7jSFcJzI6asE3U=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ec878f49-cdc9-4a52-8b4e-4df43c13642b"><source>The <x id="85"/><x id="86"/><x id="87"/><x id="88"/> family of <g id="91">dental </g>imaging systems is Align Technology’s latest generation of intraoral scanners, which comes in two configurations – cart and mobile.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17">The <x id="85"/><x id="86"/><x id="87"/><x id="88"/> family of <g id="91">dental </g>imaging systems is Align Technology’s latest generation of intraoral scanners, which comes in two configurations – cart and mobile.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17">A<x id="85"/><x id="86"/><x id="87"/><x id="88"/> família de sistemas de imagens <g id="91">dentáros </g>é a última geração de scanners intraorais da Align Technology, que vêm em duas configurações – carrinho e móvel.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="17" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="95"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">LINRNmLdDJifbzOHMc7gGHlZkH3DGcIa7pzv/CI+ycM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 18:16:21</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">LINRNmLdDJifbzOHMc7gGHlZkH3DGcIa7pzv/CI+ycM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 18:17:05</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">LINRNmLdDJifbzOHMc7gGHlZkH3DGcIa7pzv/CI+ycM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:29:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/28/2024 18:17:07</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">794324450</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="17"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="98b8c8b9-ca47-4e70-b39b-201def3897d3"><source>The bright full HD touch-screen display has wide visualization angles for an immersive and engaging experience and the powerful computing power enables a smoother and intuitive scanning experience.The ergonomics and elegance of the cart configuration will enhance your experience and elevate your practice brand image.The mobile configuration, with its dedicated trolley, enables professional and convenient inter-office portability.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18">The bright full HD touch-screen display has wide visualization angles for an immersive and engaging experience and the powerful computing power enables a smoother and intuitive scanning experience.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">The ergonomics and elegance of the cart configuration will enhance your experience and elevate your practice brand image.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">The mobile configuration, with its dedicated trolley, enables professional and convenient inter-office portability.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18">A brilhante tela tátil full HD oferece amplos ângulos de visualização para uma experiência imersiva e envolvente, além do alto poder de computação que permite realizar digitalizações mais tranquilas e intuitivas.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">A ergonomia e a elegância da configuração do carrinho vão tornar a sua experiência mais agradável e promover a reputação do seu consultório.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">A configuração móvel dedicada permite uma portabilidade profissional e conveniente entre escritórios.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="18" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-477885591</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">qj2OZ8XPT7VM8RtZpFIx2h8b1J9IEB7bdZEywk62/wY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="19" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1603973889</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">RUouzydvtQb82xfBC1ywcdhDcr+CbLlsaAtEWtQoTYo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="20" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1925432020</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">7zH5M+NmWL7uJmEX3o+KRd0IqJoVBIsDHmSifanJTbs=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="18"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d6b1b248-a4fe-4d0f-90e1-c65f7d2342da"><source>The iTero Element 5D laptop configuration is also available with a Plus package, allowing a compact and portable scanner, with a single-source for the laptop purchase.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">The iTero Element 5D laptop configuration is also available with a Plus package, allowing a compact and portable scanner, with a single-source for the laptop purchase.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="21" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">IfQ43qelGqi5YPHS2VprzHLdK0YAII85HgCx+MejBmg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="556870e8-9680-483b-849b-b34c625231d6"><source>This all-in-one system is designed to take patient experience and your productivity to the next level, ultimately helping you to grow your practice while making things easier.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">This all-in-one system is designed to take patient experience and your productivity to the next level, ultimately helping you to grow your practice while making things easier.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">Esse sistema tudo-em-um é projetado para elevar ao próximo nível a experiência do paciente e a sua produtividade, ajudando você no crescimento do consultório, enquanto torna as coisas mais fáceis.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="22" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/13/2020 08:37:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/19/2020 00:22:41</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-259918834</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">u0YzntvBrvNYEn8u4YNZ9pQ4+7GcAAZwqRripA8Y3zg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2652d00f-3958-45ff-932b-fbc9f64fa078"><source>Refer to our website <g id="101">http://www.itero.com</g> to learn how the iTero Service can enhance your business by increasing patient satisfaction and enhancing office efficiency.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">Refer to our website <g id="101">http://www.itero.com</g> to learn how the iTero Service can enhance your business by increasing patient satisfaction and enhancing office efficiency.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">Consulte o nosso site <g id="101">http://www.itero.com</g> para saber como o iTero Service pode beneficiar seu negócio ao aumentar a satisfação dos pacientes e enaltecer a eficiência do consultório.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="23" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-462012705</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">EeMhbIiqDAhVG0qzEUi5iiAG8q0lVvDpokykAKY4g/o=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\10. iTero scanner features and tools\Invisalign Go system.htm.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-language="pt-br"><header><reference><internal-file form="base64">UEsDBBQAAAAIACQ0GVnKOjqiSQQAAHEWAAAQAAAAdGthZGpzaGsuYWg0LnhsZu1YzW7jNh