;" word-end="false">&lt;ph id=&quot;1&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;</ph><props><value key="prefix"></value><value key="localName">ph</value><value key="namespaces"></value><value key="isEmptyElement">False</value><value key="nodeType">Element</value><value key="displayText">&lt;MadCap:xref href=&quot;../7. Working with orders/Working with orders.htm&quot; xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&gt;section 1, on page 1&lt;/MadCap:xref&gt;</value><value key="hasDisplayText">True</value><value key="attribute:id">1</value><value key="attribute:xmlns">urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2</value></props></tag><tag id="17"><ph name="&lt;MadCap:xref href=&quot;../6. Working with patients/Viewing the patient details.htm&quot; xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&gt;section 1.1, on page 1&lt;/MadCap:xref&gt;" word-end="false">&lt;ph id=&quot;2&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;</ph><props><value key="prefix"></value><value key="localName">ph</value><value key="namespaces"></value><value key="isEmptyElement">False</value><value key="nodeType">Element</value><value key="displayText">&lt;MadCap:xref href=&quot;../6. Working with patients/Viewing the patient details.htm&quot; xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&gt;section 1.1, on page 1&lt;/MadCap:xref&gt;</value><value key="hasDisplayText">True</value><value key="attribute:id">2</value><value key="attribute:xmlns">urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2</value></props></tag></tag-defs></header><body><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="8a3e771d-dc8b-464e-8b10-8cac0ae0a966"><source>Invisalign Outcome Simulator</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="1">Invisalign Outcome Simulator</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="1">Simulador de Resultado Invisalign</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="1" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="cqNOoSiDNNtyLYo7owfZlfwO1cRe2wsIiZStd1FprNg="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/06/2019 18:25:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/31/2020 06:44:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-500027718</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">cqNOoSiDNNtyLYo7owfZlfwO1cRe2wsIiZStd1FprNg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="909fbfd3-1be3-4275-9057-4fe999819306"><source>Invisalign Outcome Simulator is a software tool that enables you to show the patients the simulated outcome of their Invisalign treatment.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Invisalign Outcome Simulator is a software tool that enables you to show the patients the simulated outcome of their Invisalign treatment.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">O Simulador de Resultado Invisalign é uma ferramenta de software que permite mostrar aos pacientes o resultado simulado do seu tratamento Invisalign.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/07/2022 13:16:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 01:23:52</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1758037098</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">pL0x9MszpkFv9PH76WX6JRJTuF4cmCVcj/fwMhcj5Ns=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="051bc2db-714a-4ad8-92cc-d755e4e1d554"><source>You can make real-time adjustments to the simulated outcome while showing the patient.This tool provides additional information for the patient in their decision to accept treatment.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">You can make real-time adjustments to the simulated outcome while showing the patient.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">This tool provides additional information for the patient in their decision to accept treatment.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Você pode fazer ajustes em tempo real no resultado simulado, enquanto o mostra ao paciente.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Essa ferramenta fornece informações adicionais ao paciente em sua decisão de aceitar o tratamento.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/30/2020 21:07:30</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/30/2020 21:07:30</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-546393387</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">3lf/bkY+nY2UMnp59bRLNBMf9etR8JoFvi+yGv5I0A8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/09/2020 14:40:57</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/22/2020 00:59:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2052984448</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">tdjclb578398InYZzkiYnV9l6FK5FNbO32ZyFUSJcdo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a49633d7-82b3-4a2c-9c73-c58a18e0b283"><source>To open the Invisalign Outcome Simulator tool, after sending the scan, tap <g id="12">Invisalign Outcome Simulator</g> in the <g id="15">Orders</g> page, as described in <x id="16"/>, or in the patient&apos;s profile page, as described in <x id="17"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">To open the Invisalign Outcome Simulator tool, after sending the scan, tap <g id="12">Invisalign Outcome Simulator</g> in the <g id="15">Orders</g> page, as described in <x id="16"/>, or in the patient&apos;s profile page, as described in <x id="17"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Para abrir a ferramenta Invisalign Outcome Simulator, depois de enviar a digitalização, toque em <g id="12">Invisalign Outcome Simulator</g> na página <g id="15">Pedidos</g>, conforme descrito em <x id="16"/>, ou na página de perfil do paciente, conforme descrito em <x id="17"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1059781906</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">TD8GYZe8e4OfqvJica9TSzXriVD26TW+vnJ9bHEPuW4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="fc3ccc5c-da37-4fab-be5c-1a1ebd08dbea"><source>For more information on the Invisalign Outcome Simulator tool, refer to the <g id="26">Invisalign Outcome Simulator User Guide</g> <g id="29">https://guides.itero.com</g>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">For more information on the Invisalign Outcome Simulator tool, refer to the <g id="26">Invisalign Outcome Simulator User Guide</g> <g id="29">https://guides.itero.com</g>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Para obter mais informações sobre a ferramenta Invisalign Outcome Simulator, consulte o <g id="26">Guia do Usuário do Invisalign Outcome Simulator</g> <g id="29">https://guides.itero.com</g>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">618012834</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">KVsUpX/z4V60N5m7msgcLlHmUJh0vRaiK7pSJp0E0Zs=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\10. iTero scanner features and tools\Invisalign Progress Assessment.htm.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-language="pt-br"><header><reference><internal-file form="base64">UEsDBBQAAAAIACQ0GVkujiG18AQAABYeAAAQAAAAd2QzaWFsZjQuemZsLnhsZu1Z3W7bNhS+L9B3
