l:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c573ab30-30b7-4201-b755-aa3245c734b2"><source>iTero NIRI technology limitations</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">iTero NIRI technology limitations</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Limitações da tecnologia iTero NIRI</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">1lAa43UV3WfF1mGti5qm/tbXRa8YUBzRHJRD3GG54Dk=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 12:45:39</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-964581783</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="159da08d-6ff5-4d63-a5e6-6d0cc61a336c"><source>iTero NIRI technology has the following limitations:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">iTero NIRI technology has the following limitations:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">A tecnologia iTero NIRI tem as seguintes limitações:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">LEClm6AGF+cE++zv/AAHyc9NjPyhwriEEjIkvOGzVKY=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 12:54:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1209696522</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="331b0856-8a9c-4e1d-a9b4-16458383a1d8"><source>NIRI cannot detect caries below the gingiva, for example, to view caries in the roots of the teeth.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">NIRI cannot detect caries below the gingiva, for example, to view caries in the roots of the teeth.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">NIRI não pode detectar cáries abaixo da gengiva, por exemplo, para visualizar cáries nas raízes dos dentes.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">BHZMdjEJH0i25iNsPmqGpcNtVITfu++XuVyBBYzU8u0=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1482985608</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="de9ec479-0594-4150-8dbb-06e0468caf72"><source>NIRI cannot detect the progression of caries beyond the dentin-enamel junction (DEJ), which is the boundary between the enamel and the underlying dentin that forms the solid architecture of a tooth.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">NIRI cannot detect the progression of caries beyond the dentin-enamel junction (DEJ), which is the boundary between the enamel and the underlying dentin that forms the solid architecture of a tooth.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">NIRI não pode detectar a progressão das cáries além da junção amelodentinária (JAD), que é o limite entre o esmalte e a dentina subjacente que forma a estrutura sólida de um dente.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">DgWIQE8ygLMY51C1SbnHVT9aS9xr8uWI1Y84jkkm7Gc=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 12:57:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1714941487</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3b972ae3-42e0-4c11-9e68-502924cf06ae"><source>Some restorations, e.g. crowns and amalgam fillings, are not translucent and may mask carious lesions below them.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Some restorations, e.g. crowns and amalgam fillings, are not translucent and may mask carious lesions below them.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Algumas restaurações (ex.: coroas e restaurações de amálgama) não são transparentes e podem mascarar lesões cariosas abaixo delas.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">B7hIb/Db9MABb7TUdPx9IW4+w6ABLlZc44SGkHqWzRU=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:29:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1574214101</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3120d1c0-713f-48ce-9cd6-094b08c4a6db"><source>Highly opaque teeth have low translucency of the enamel making them appear brighter.This may cause difficulty in understanding the internal tooth structure, and differentiating between enamel and dentin, thereby affecting the ability to detect proximal caries.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Highly opaque teeth have low translucency of the enamel making them appear brighter.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">This may cause difficulty in understanding the internal tooth structure, and differentiating between enamel and dentin, thereby affecting the ability to detect proximal caries.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Dentes altamente opacos têm baixa translucidez do esmalte, fazendo com que pareçam mais brilhantes.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Isso pode causar dificuldade na compreensão da estrutura interna do dente e na diferenciação entre esmalte e dentina, afetando, assim,  a capacidade de detectar cáries proximais.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="7" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">N6Uz9haIZyk5VQz8PZou7NEOr+PL2ijvZsKay0VvMJ8=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:29:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-2061669236</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="8" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">5S9X13pN1TkjSR10Twi5A5hPasbsl6aLYxYBAEgFzPI=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:29:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-793953623</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5fe0dc87-c83e-470b-9050-d0ab289ccbca"><source>For more information on using iTero NIRI technology, please refer to the <g id="7">iTero™ Near Infrared Imaging (NIRI) Technology in Dentistry guide</g>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">For more information on using iTero NIRI technology, please refer to the <g id="7">iTero™ Near Infrared Imaging (NIRI) Technology in Dentistry guide</g>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">Para mais informações sobre como utilizar a tecnologia iTero NIRI, consulte o <g id="7" sdl:end="false">guia de Odontologia sobre Tecnologia em Imagem Infravermelha Próxima (NIRI) do iTero™</g>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="9" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">mpe/jeaHM3QjKAvIfg/5WpvogQtYSi50TG7IWTFzwXk=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1688926802</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\3. Getting Started\Logging in to the iTero Element.htm.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-language="pt-br"><header><reference><internal-file form="base64">UEsDBBQAAAAIACQ0GVnCEhR2wAUAAPYsAAAQAAAAdXBpYXc1anUud3NpLnhsZu1a3W7bNhS+L9B3
