g" mid="2">Saindo do scanner</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/01/2020 08:59:16</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 20:33:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">607131644</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">guvbtxbxqbYGo/y8ULrO3ZqqLTIRIi+WXfXAPkcLBcw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a4c9024c-0711-4aa7-8306-e12b8cd6e2d7"><source>In order to protect the patient information, you should log out of the scanner when it is not in use.Your password will <g id="6">not</g> be remembered by the system.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">In order to protect the patient information, you should log out of the scanner when it is not in use.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Your password will <g id="6">not</g> be remembered by the system.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Para proteger as informações do paciente, você deve efetuar logout do scanner quando ele não estiver em uso.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Sua senha <g id="6">não</g> será lembrada pelo sistema.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/01/2020 09:00:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 20:33:35</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2042694136</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">n+YEZTgoGwQf0XGyMH1aKxrd3bHsZEPjpYezmtKiPtk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:20</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:20</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1353481022</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">AOJZY+CiwDWABfMPXgH5ZBTD+lE95YWM54cGnvTB3SE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="fd876f22-e6ed-48aa-8680-b01d754eaaa2"><source>By default, you will be logged out after a predefined period of inactivity, which can be defined in the <g id="14">Login</g> settings, described in <x id="15"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">By default, you will be logged out after a predefined period of inactivity, which can be defined in the <g id="14">Login</g> settings, described in <x id="15"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Por padrão, você será desconectado após um período predefinido de inatividade, que pode ser definido nas configurações de <g id="14">Login</g>, descritas na <x id="15"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:20</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:20</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1754512482</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ih1yRlCDu72JwvW2elNDMq+2j2X01J0bkZJmh04JAdM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></grou