23b-c676566d41fb"><source>Disconnect the power cable from the mains and then from the back of the computing unit.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="49">Disconnect the power cable from the mains and then from the back of the computing unit.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="49">Desconecte o cabo de alimentação da rede elétrica e, em seguida, da parte traseira da unidade de computação.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="49" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="HsQLSiuii+iqQ5YYz60XZj+sDonC3OR7DpuwslHvYiQ="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/04/2022 17:56:47</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 00:07:41</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">748488697</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">HsQLSiuii+iqQ5YYz60XZj+sDonC3OR7DpuwslHvYiQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c82507fa-f83c-4434-b29d-a70c0eab1b7f"><source>Disconnect the scanner components and pack them in their designated compartments in the trolley.For more information, see <x id="96"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="50">Disconnect the scanner components and pack them in their designated compartments in the trolley.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="51">For more information, see <x id="96"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="50">Desconecte os componentes do scanner e embale-os nos respectivos compartimentos do carrinho.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="51">Para mais informações, consulte <x id="96"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="50" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/17/2022 00:08:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 00:08:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1056849851</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">BfXACQvjRNHCBxcrMWElQFzFdhhknPHY30vQEMZiOtc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="51" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="7Ohy1cOz5eX+waPmq2AF23DPmdMlIbw4Gf/7YOWfIqI="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1809051878</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">7Ohy1cOz5eX+waPmq2AF23DPmdMlIbw4Gf/7YOWfIqI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="e931b18b-e55d-4beb-8740-e0bb795cd02b"><source>Close and secure the trolley flap and then close the trolley by lifting the side with the fastened flap and zipping it closed.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="52">Close and secure the trolley flap and then close the trolley by lifting the side with the fastened flap and zipping it closed.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="52">Feche e prenda a aba do carrinho e, em seguida, feche o carrinho levantando a lateral com a aba presa e fechando-a com zíper.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="52" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/04/2022 17:59:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 00:08:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1426018862</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">1UvRAYb+oEuFKS8aQRAtflZyVXwpa83LDxnABDBEh/s=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c6b54683-8c87-44bb-bbde-318283cdfbea"><source>Transporting the scanner between clinics</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="53">Transporting the scanner between clinics</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="53">Transportando o scanner entre clínicas</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="53" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">01/04/2021 19:05:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">01/04/2021 19:05:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">533686851</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">qkPl8gta2VBonlcm4l73wflB1COa6fCkWJKx1WeUZTk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="eecc521d-2582-486d-9f0d-d306a9dd59ce"><source>If required, use the optional protective cover to protect the trolley against wear and tear and adverse weather conditions.For more information, see <x id="100"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="54">If required, use the optional protective cover to protect the trolley against wear and tear and adverse weather conditions.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="55">For more information, see <x id="100"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="54">Se necessário, use a capa protetora opcional para proteger o carrinho contra o desgaste e as condições climáticas adversas.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="55">Para mais informações, consulte <x id="100"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="54" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/04/2022 17:59:41</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 00:08:57</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1019166363</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">URJOTf57zzkStiiHPgUAITKc4a/heDG4c3fW4Z7CcY8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="55" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="7Ohy1cOz5eX+waPmq2AF23DPmdMlIbw4Gf/7YOWfIqI="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1809051878</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">7Ohy1cOz5eX+waPmq2AF23DPmdMlIbw4Gf/7YOWfIqI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\Resources\Snippets\MultiBite.flsnp.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-language="pt-br"><header><reference><internal-file form="base64">UEsDBBQAAAAIACQ0GVmcWMueqgMAAMYNAAAQAAAAZ2lyd3NiemwuYWpwLnhsZs1XwW7cNhC9B8g/
