5">Captura NIRI:</g> por padrão, todas as imagens são capturadas com dados NIRI ativados.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Se necessário, você pode desativar a captura de dados NIRI no botão de alternância.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="1" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">9PJMkIlxvnxDEL+iJZqYOHK4ljzXLnZj4DCSgGHwOAg=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 18:50:51</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">9PJMkIlxvnxDEL+iJZqYOHK4ljzXLnZj4DCSgGHwOAg=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 12:32:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/28/2024 18:50:58</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">223984839</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="2" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ErQRQfRny+dhFdo8fTk0vtHkPyfPwv5LC/Igx4WCcf0=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 12:32:29</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1199891241</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="6032ee2d-7a99-4761-be71-08d38087537b"><source>If required, you can disable NIRI data for all scans by default, as described in <x id="9"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">If required, you can disable NIRI data for all scans by default, as described in <x id="9"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Se necessário, você pode desativar os dados NIRI para todas as digitalizações por padrão, conforme descrito em <x id="9"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:se