tag></tag-defs></header><body><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="207543b2-f9b2-4366-844b-91f484ff5b1c"><source>Preparations</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="1">Preparations</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="1">Preparações</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="1" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/10/2019 02:09:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/23/2019 03:01:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">387601431</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">1IeSQGzd8bk2Bnvbsek69GY6l25ScwXISXaihheKmxw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3d83e8e0-b9b7-4365-920f-cf8078c7c5e7"><source>The required modem/router should be configured with the WPA2 security standard, including a password.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">The required modem/router should be configured with the WPA2 security standard, including a password.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">O modem/roteador solicitado deve ser configurado com padrão de segurança WPA2, incluindo uma senha.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/26/2020 08:18:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 21:25:55</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-298422191</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">SdaGDkR/XVElLWo4eaxKMHulMv21lYZhUQss6XaU9Ec=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3772dd74-be37-479d-92db-7d7f331515ac"><source>Ensure that your IT professional staff will be available when the scanner installation is planned to take place.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Ensure that your IT professional staff will be available when the scanner installation is planned to take place.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Certifique-se de que o profissional de TI sua equipe esteja disponível quando for planejada a instalação do scanner.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/01/2020 11:12:13</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 21:26:44</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">251386657</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">hl5GslE3veWfKFFTaxz5O6TMQjGnHI6EeoOAJLcqvTw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2b4691dd-afcb-4040-b205-17d2567a10f0"><source>Make sure that the Wi-Fi SSID credentials are available: Login &amp; password.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Make sure that the Wi-Fi SSID credentials are available: Login &amp; password.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Certifique-se de que as credenciais de SSID de Wi-Fi estejam disponíveis: Login e senha.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:27</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:27</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1938650187</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">SxsW3am8WdUPPw+CAFk4TOHBh7C9irAMWpk4Y9LaAe8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="414cbfe1-c22f-434f-ae9d-b8cc58038b9f"><source>The minimum Wi-Fi strength signal for the system should display at least three lines, as shown above.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">The minimum Wi-Fi strength signal for the system should display at least three lines, as shown above.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">O sinal de intensidade mínima do Wi-Fi para o sistema deve exibir pelo menos três barras, conforme mostrado acima.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/06/2022 11:10:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/06/2022 11:10:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1655607776</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">wgWcdCmgDcEJrCyeONdySAVGB4IMykS52GrBkZhjJto=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2019fb02-83ad-41e1-9a3d-d0aed23f9ed3"><source>Following are some suggestions for the office IT personnel, regarding what should be considered in order to prevent issues such as access or connectivity to/with the iTero scanner:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Following are some suggestions for the office IT personnel, regarding what should be considered in order to prevent issues such as access or connectivity to/with the iTero scanner:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Confira, a seguir, algumas sugestões para o pessoal de TI do consultório, com relação ao que deve ser considerado para evitar problemas como acesso ou conectividade ao/com o scanner iTero:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/01/2020 11:12:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 21:28:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">143597596</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">s2eUOczkjcD1JQFdJhtW0NEJr5LEqnvpM92GoP6iGV0=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c7edbf78-e5ec-4104-8c17-848be40c1779"><source>Hostname recommendations related to Align services listening to port 443, as described in <x id="1"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Hostname recommendations related to Align services listening to port 443, as described in <x id="1"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Recomendações de nome de host, relacionadas ao serviço da Align, obedecendo a portaria 443, conforme descrito na <x id="1"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="7" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 19:42:07</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:58:02</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1860230198</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">qFtfSd5nK0JMJUCBl+C8wQ5OEv93jo08VPKsfwkE0Fo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="8" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="OjxwL1Y53pkWrJNuyDxE3rL+utQWF68JUgQmxj6WjWc="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">377048646</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">OjxwL1Y53pkWrJNuyDxE3rL+utQWF68JUgQmxj6WjWc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="360fa954-850d-4498-badf-e2b13ec70469"><source>Do not prevent FTP communication since the scanner sends specific file types (.3ds and.3dc/.3dm).</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">Do not prevent FTP communication since the scanner sends specific file types (.3ds and.3dc/.3dm).</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">Não impeça a comunicação FTP, pois o scanner envia arquivos de tipos específicos (.3ds e .3dc/.3dm).</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="9" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/01/2020 11:15:55</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/21/2020 19:15:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1066051332</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">mUIARoA90ZDq0Ta4zYka3Me9TmPmLEFY4ZB/vVwedNo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c546710e-8fab-4312-a6b3-23eccd6e10ed"><source>Disable any proxy clients for data communication through TCP/IP.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Disable any proxy clients for data communication through TCP/IP.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Desabilite qualquer cliente proxy para a comunicação de dados por meio de TCP /IP.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="10" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/26/2020 08:21:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/31/2020 18:38:47</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-569489388</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">6DuRSwehgivg0JsUcpL6kFAi/bfuunMi5Yyc1sugxcQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="105bad72-5861-4565-b6e7-e1abf1adfb02"><source>Do not add the scanner to any domain group.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">Do not add the scanner to any domain group.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">Não adicione o scanner a nenhum grupo de domínio.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="11" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/26/2020 08:21:37</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/21/2020 19:16:05</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1492572595</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Tjl2qrL8m16xX3Qf2jzBSJuC5NXHKD85B262LuXf9vs=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="e265a05d-fcaa-4d5d-a1f2-b9f942aad307"><source>Do not run any group policy on the scanner as it may disrupt its proper functioning.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">Do not run any group policy on the scanner as it may disrupt its proper functioning.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">Não execute nenhuma política de grupo no scanner, pois isso pode interromper seu correto funcionamento.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="12" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/30/2020 22:02:28</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/31/2020 18:38:52</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1414552598</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">kkUwr2MpKt74jHbB11uXBxtO7WQORXiRwadi8cFCON8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\3. Getting Started\Registering the scanner Make.htm.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-language="pt-br"><header><reference><internal-file form="base64">UEsDBBQAAAAIACQ0GVk/qmj0/QsAAA+oAAAQAAAAeWNvaHhmb3ouZ3kxLnhsZu1d3XLbuBW+35l9
