><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="38639565-564a-4e34-9895-f00b6196e9eb"><source>Before removing and disposing of the sleeve, see the <g id="12">iTero Lumina sleeves</g> section in the<x id="13"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Before removing and disposing of the sleeve, see the <g id="12">iTero Lumina sleeves</g> section in the<x id="13"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Antes de remover e descartar a ponteira, veja a seção <g id="12">Ponteiras do iTero Lumina</g> nas <x id="13"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="76"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">gjV82lv4SVDFGJ3XhVuyao0cy4ilM8uPQZ/xoslKLto=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 18:57:14</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">gjV82lv4SVDFGJ3XhVuyao0cy4ilM8uPQZ/xoslKLto=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 18:58:42</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1167992938</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">gjV82lv4SVDFGJ3XhVuyao0cy4ilM8uPQZ/xoslKLto=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1148225138</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/28/2024 18:58:45</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="14522962-7543-431f-92ff-22a5f276dc88"><source>The wand sleeves are intended for single use and must be disposed of and replaced after each patient in order to avoid cross-contamination.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">The wand sleeves are intended for single use and must be disposed of and replaced after each patient in order to avoid cross-contamination.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">vFx3D4wFx396m6YKgpqFVq9i6n99wPuECNPWdTDcT3E=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="bcdd0698-451a-4ef6-bbc1-1ab927261b8a"><source>To remove the wand sleeve:<x id="17"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">To remove the wand sleeve:<x id="17"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Pare remover a ponteira do leitor:<x id="17"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 19:36:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:36:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2005989554</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">uytsPjkyGhWDw8PijbzKs+IyDcfW5ldquTSrKXit730=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ee5b1412-0912-4327-9250-a22b48c8e9c5"><source>Once the scan is complete, or if the scan has been interrupted,<x id="21"/> slowly pull the sleeve off the wand, and discard it.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Once the scan is complete, or if the scan has been interrupted,<x id="21"/> slowly pull the sleeve off the wand, and discard it.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Assim que a digitalização for concluída ou se a digitalização for interrompida, <x id="21"/>retire lentamente o leitor e descarte-o.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="7" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:52</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:36:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1065514046</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">cVdnfWnIVnNg/YcxqKzpDAfDiTO9leatz63FCh2U/Yo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="14"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ed7d4c83-3a7a-4934-b94d-b463ba92d086"><source>Removing a wand sleeve</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Removing a wand sleeve</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Removendo uma ponteira do leitor</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="8" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/06/2019 23:05:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/22/2019 17:27:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1338345666</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">K4THlZ64TqKsxmKWXLu08VHMFBb0aiLYTQQIyJTxbgk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="15"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="836a5bc1-26c7-4d77-80e1-89d2d1b78862"><source><g id="27">CAUTION:</g> Dispose of used sleeves according to standard operating procedures or local regulations for the disposal of contaminated medical waste.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9"><g id="27">CAUTION:</g> Dispose of used sleeves according to standard operating procedures or local regulations for the disposal of contaminated medical waste.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="9" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ulg2mjM1cntfIOX9a7lyQYSBdZBxtVH7CKqCKhvW5CA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="da6d88aa-70d0-4372-9ce0-6360569e638b"><source><x id="37"/><g id="40">Note:</g> OPTICAL SURFACE!</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10"><x id="37"/><g id="40">Note:</g> OPTICAL SURFACE!</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10"><x id="37"/><g id="40">Nota:</g> SUPERFÍCIE ÓPTICA!</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="10" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:52</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:36:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-831173280</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Joi0cJOEwiaIkQKK9N+y+LHXRtUL7oEHPvIyMqgvHAk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="16"/><sdl:cxt id="17"/><sdl:cxt id="18"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="869f7792-0968-4494-b9b0-6e91e15c4f4b"><source>DO NOT touch the optical surface of the wand.Contact may cause damage.If additional cleaning, besides that listed in <x id="44"/> is necessary, use the anti-static cloth found inside the sleeve box.For more information, refer to the instructions in the box.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">DO NOT touch the optical surface of the wand.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">Contact may cause damage.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">If additional cleaning, besides that listed in <x id="44"/> is necessary, use the anti-static cloth found inside the sleeve box.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">For more information, refer to the instructions in the box.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">NÃO toque na superfície óptica do leitor.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">O contato pode causar danos.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">Se for necessária uma limpeza adicional, além da listada na <x id="44"/>, use os tecidos antiestáticos que se encontram dentro da caixa de ponteiras.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">Para obter mais informações, consulte as instruções na caixa.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="11" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/29/2020 15:15:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 18:58:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">927367051</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">dfFXWOiHtJMiV8dyB9d6HSRAm5nFriUxcqoD0619u8s=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="12" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/06/2019 23:05:38</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/23/2019 21:31:33</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1368590738</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityH