al scanning, to ensure that critical areas that could compromise the whole model are not missed.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">Você pode ativar o modo de comentários adicionais de digitalização <x id="35"/> para alertá-lo sobre as áreas que precisam de digitalização adicional, a fim de garantir que áreas críticas, que possam comprometer todo o modelo, não passem despercebidas.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="24" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1530542283</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">dFvtcBR5weast84gNyL7gxH9USRS1dUYmhLKAVsElxE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="63ba4f2a-ab9f-4e1f-a8e9-f71148afd141"><source>Areas with missing anatomy are highlighted in red when scanning in monochromatic mode, and purple when scanning in color mode.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Areas with missing anatomy are highlighted in red when scanning in monochromatic mode, and purple when scanning in color mode.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Áreas com anatomia ausente ficam destacadas em vermelho ao digitalizar no modo monocromático e em roxo ao digitalizar no modo colorido.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="25" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/09/2019 20:54:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/22/2019 13:26:27</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">664000414</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">aAZpMnhF0SC1JjfB4E1XAc7n+987b4S5fhdwzUg2cgY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2ccf286c-f563-435b-8c24-a7cd405db4a9"><source>Areas with missing anatomy shown with and without additional scan feedback – monochrome</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26">Areas with missing anatomy shown with and without additional scan feedback – monochrome</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26">Áreas com anatomia ausente, mostradas com e sem comentários adicionais de digitalização - monocromático</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="26" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/11/2022 12:03:30</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/11/2022 12:03:30</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1859775336</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">X8NSzR1HYZ3zNtEeSFoHQaena3bbMsds+mDlWd+9OqU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3c41f8e4-cd7f-4226-96f2-35845cedf0d3"><source>Areas with missing anatomy shown with and without additional scan feedback – color mode</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27">Areas with missing anatomy shown with and without additional scan feedback – color mode</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27">Áreas com anatomia ausente mostrada com e sem comentários adicionais de digitalização - modo colorido</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="27" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/09/2019 21:05:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/22/2019 13:27:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-10301542</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">0AmYT4BGTtj7jy60ufdIhpA8GsX3+F+kwXBRB3AS2i4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="bb934a54-5035-4d51-a8bc-5060650e1431"><source>By default, this mode is enabled, but it can be disabled per case by tapping <x id="38"/> or by default in the Scan settings, as described in <x id="39"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28">By default, this mode is enabled, but it can be disabled per case by tapping <x id="38"/> or by default in the Scan settings, as described in <x id="39"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28">Esse modo fica ativado por padrão e pode ser desativado a cada caso, tocando em <x id="38"/> ou ter o padrão alterado nas configurações de Digitalização conforme descrito na <x id="39"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="28" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1408149302</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">J+iiNYbsQYlXYSTnGeaFnP6ir/v3Oe2Vt6NWNhOtT4s=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-un