:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="84b5b114-dfbf-4bf8-9ade-7d8b6a54295a"><source>A lightning bolt indicates that the scanner is connected to the power, and the battery is charging.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17">A lightning bolt indicates that the scanner is connected to the power, and the battery is charging.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17">O ícone de raio indica que o scanner está conectado ao cabo de energia e que a bateria está carregando.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="17" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="MtUhsQFxh+Y3FGLItKJ24FaSJ9S+jy6qE53YyeZB+5w="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/18/2022 00:51:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:51:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-691871444</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">MtUhsQFxh+Y3FGLItKJ24FaSJ9S+jy6qE53YyeZB+5w=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="9dc3d79a-e5dc-4635-b4a4-6739183e02c4"><source>When using battery power, the remaining charge level is displayed on the battery icon.When the remaining charge level falls below 25%, the battery icon is displayed in red <x id="34"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18">When using battery power, the remaining charge level is displayed on the battery icon.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">When the remaining charge level falls below 25%, the battery icon is displayed in red <x id="34"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18">Ao usar a energia da bateria, o nível de carga restante é exibido no ícone da bateria.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">Quando o nível de carga restante estiver abaixo de 25%, o ícone da bateria será exibido em vermelho <x id="34"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="18" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="O4mkF0lwu+PLHJXONOKwtQSNgGclug/U93DBGZcXo9s="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/13/2020 07:39:34</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/22/2020 02:41:03</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">211063797</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">O4mkF0lwu+PLHJXONOKwtQSNgGclug/U93DBGZcXo9s=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="19" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="JQepmVDjYK9P8zWn1yh+No4rVL1ryahBKASC4s74VVg="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1829129478</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">JQepmVDjYK9P8zWn1yh+No4rVL1ryahBKASC4s74VVg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="dd828cc9-2fed-4e7f-aa48-b4a7bf853e09"><source>Tap the battery icon to view the percentage of the remaining charge:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">Tap the battery icon to view the percentage of the remaining charge:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">Toque no ícone da bateria para visualizar a porcentagem da carga restante:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="20" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm