EARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 17:08:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">247200405</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="26" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="5Zioq4EY/PhydFhV6TLDNyjbw4s2FodbeKnL1+XGxrU="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:53:33</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:54:20</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1217924312</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">5Zioq4EY/PhydFhV6TLDNyjbw4s2FodbeKnL1+XGxrU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="32"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5e68100c-f462-4285-af02-ab5bab2d47d6"><source>iTero recommends the following best practices for scanning fixed restorative procedures:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27">iTero recommends the following best practices for scanning fixed restorative procedures:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="27" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">mizN6gPYyiV4G0HNXDjYjmmXVne/egay06/f5azzdp4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="33"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2aee65dd-fca2-46ff-84eb-cf89247a82a5"><source>Ensure that the prepped tooth and the surrounding area are free of debris, saliva, and blood contamination.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28">Ensure that the prepped tooth and the surrounding area are free of debris, saliva, and blood contamination.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="28" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">LToqPxnhaKxt3y8/mQr5J2FUC6SMeeJ72Z4iBVNUt+U=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="33"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="14d8d04e-8201-4ae0-a2c9-d9736a08080d"><source>The prepped tooth should be dry, and the margin line should be clear of tissue.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">The prepped tooth should be dry, and the margin line should be clear of tissue.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="29" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">IF7Urc5xFl8AdvtzA2APeaBB3yH/KlGvFK2ZnZEw1ac=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="33"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c4307c88-b612-42d4-83ec-335ba3c8fbaf"><source>You should be familiar with proper scanning techniques and avoid over scanning.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">You should be familiar with proper scanning techniques and avoid over scanning.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="30" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">80Ks7XGkeI5SlDJqPgYcCyEJXojScbqpwIno9Mq5TA0=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\5. Starting a new scan\Scanning guidance.htm.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-language="pt-br"><header><reference><internal-file form="base64">UEsDBBQAAAAIACQ0GVlcwP1wggsAAKCEAAAQAAAAem9wYWNlYmkuYXFoLnhsZu1d3XLbNha+70zf
