eren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 18:50:33</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:36:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">145243289</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">xYpujTO6i6WmstbTvBeLZIeCqN/FUk/bEBokgrqid+Q=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="6e730f49-f34a-4ac0-967a-2edcb871f5e8"><source>If required, select the <g id="57">Save Signature</g> check box to save your signature for authorizing sending future scans.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">If required, select the <g id="57">Save Signature</g> check box to save your signature for authorizing sending future scans.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">Se necessário, marque a caixa de seleção <g id="57">Salvar Assinatura</g> para salvar a sua assinatura para autorizar o envio de digitalizações futuras.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="23" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1680526239</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FAizb9rArML2LH++JrQnTEaJkxzo5KUPqZvOJhcw2J0=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="17"/><sdl:cxt id="18"/><sdl:cxt id="19"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a0cfc76c-43ab-4d11-bc7b-d249f66d15a6"><source>If you have scanned a Study Model/iRecord procedure or an Invisalign Aligners procedure type, the <g id="64">Initiate Invisalign Simulator Pro</g> check box is displayed and selected.Keeping this option selected will trigger the simulation.For more information regarding Invisalign Outcome Simulator Pro, see <x id="67"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">If you have scanned a Study Model/iRecord procedure or an Invisalign Aligners procedure type, the <g id="64">Initiate Invisalign Simulator Pro</g> check box is displayed and selected.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Keeping this option selected will trigger the simulation.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26">For more information regarding Invisalign Outcome Simulator Pro, see <x id="67"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">Se você digitalizou o procedimento Modelo de Estudo/iRecord ou um tipo de procedimento Alinhadores Invisalign, a caixa de seleção <g id="64">Iniciar Simulador Invisalign Pro</g> será exibida e selecionada.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Manter esta opção selecionada acionará a simulação.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26">Para obter mais informações sobre o Simulador de Resultado Invisalign Pro, consulte <x id="67"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="24" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1618925797</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ijfO9NrzfPuI1tWXzAu9C4oWhcCyXb6D5Nrt3Vswt/g=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="25" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/10/2022 09:25:44</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:30:32</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2009171231</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">GXWMNAaZw8Z9x/4rZk5yZn1GxJVtxuEdw5z8RSrvYSk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="26" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2051811106</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">QqCQEe58q+RFfoctxjsbQMvVkQTWyhqrIrIbQ6XbWbM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="96928c6e-2eb2-40ac-b883-bf83c3146e23"><source><g id="75">Note:</g> In order to enable the simulation, ensure that your iTero account is paired with your Invisalign Doctor Site account.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27"><g id="75">Note:</g> In order to enable the simulation, ensure that your iTero account is paired with your Invisalign Doctor Site account.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27"><g id="75">Nota:</g> para ativar a simulação, certifique-se de que a sua conta iTero esteja emparelhada com a sua conta do site Invisalign Doctor.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="27" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:36:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1809899745</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">emecppCzudpFAtVWa1eF4oNMfNZGdUdrf6mYhRZ3c7c=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="20"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="87fcd67d-bda1-49a2-85f1-109dafaf3af2"><source>Notes:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28">Notes:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="28" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:rep id="MV5Vg0NrwdcmWKQ9naRB8KXHXb6LE+trTaKS4OubnEc="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">MV5Vg0NrwdcmWKQ9naRB8KXHXb6LE+trTaKS4OubnEc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="21"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="1308aa3c-8da7-4866-8a0c-38f684523543"><source>In order to enable the simulation, ensure that your iTero account is paired with your Invisalign Doctor Site account.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">In order to enable the simulation, ensure that your iTero account is paired with your Invisalign Doctor Site account.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="29" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">r2XwgmSy4T3FLAZr/FSRR7Ckxec3BJAQEGSyxdOAFHc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="21"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="e134cf1c-b753-4df5-9bbd-8b66c60c0293"><source>Invisalign Outcome Simulator Pro is supported on iTero Element Plus series scanners only.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">Invisalign Outcome Simulator Pro is supported on iTero Element Plus series scanners only.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="30" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">p7KnHTAOo8iKrftfK8xzAtaaV+lcfhKBc5OfeNMols4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="22"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="929eafea-8329-42cf-9738-fe71c95f4f0a"><source><x id="82"/><x id="85"/> <g id="88">Ensure that the patient consent check box is selected, confirming that you have received the patient&apos;s consent to have their health data collected and processed by Align for the purposes of dental care and for further processing in accordance with your End User License Agreement.</g></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31"><x id="82"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32"><x id="85"/> <g id="88">Ensure that the patient consent check box is selected, confirming that you have received the patient&apos;s consent to have their health data collected and processed by Align for the purposes of dental care and for further processing in accordance with your End User License Agreement.</g></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31"><x id="82"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32"><x id="85"/> <g id="88">Certifique-se de que a caixa de seleção de consentimento do paciente esteja marcada, confirmando que você recebeu o consentimento do paciente para que seus dados de saúde sejam coletados e processados pela Align para fins de atendimento odontológico e para processamentos adicionais de acordo com seu Contrato de Licença de Usuário Final.</g></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="31" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="32" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/16/2023 14:06:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/21/2023 05:28:01</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-756492332</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">jsZa/xA/CdDaASrRfSVQ/Z/FAymmwHuDeSoQENdL0OY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="b7258c50-d195-4e90-8279-672a7511701f"><source>Tap <g id="99">Send</g> to send the scan or <g id="102">Send &amp; View</g> to send the scan and open it in Align Oral Health Suite, as described in <x id="103"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33">Tap <g id="99">Send</g> to send the scan or <g id="102">Send &amp; View</g> to send the scan and open it in Align Oral Health Suite, as described in <x id="103"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33">Toque em <g id="99">Enviar</g> para enviar a digitalização ou <g id="102">Enviar e Visualizar</g> para enviar a digitalização e abri-la na Align Oral Health Suite, conforme descrito na <x id="103"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="33" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 18:51:28</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:36:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">220704150</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">M1FEGkSyr1YW4MK1ofkzJaKlwOXHsBpnBTkb32P/juI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="23"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="240bc917-ebf1-4a92-b0b3-07dea9374234"><source><g id="109">Note:</g> Align Oral Health Suite is supported on iTero Element Plus series scanners only.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="34"><g id="109">Note:</g> Align Oral Health Suite is supported on iTero Element Plus series scanners only.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="34"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="34" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">2fgcAabLWvAD2TCqSPcBNfbwoOqOtBIFlnXPvPEGd+Y=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="fca7b3c6-0cdf-4b8c-b483-d527a39a8ac0"><source>A notification is displayed that the model is being sent, and depending on the send option you tapped, either the patient&apos;s profile page is displayed showing the status of the order or the scan is displayed in Align Oral Health Suite.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="35">A notification is displayed that the model is being sent, and depending on the send option you tapped, either the patient&apos;s profile page is displayed showing the status of the order or the scan is displayed in Align Oral Health Suite.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="35">Uma notificação é exibida, informando que o modelo está sendo enviado e, dependendo da opção de envio que você tocou, a página de perfil do paciente mostra o status do pedido ou a digitalização é exibida na Align Oral Health Suite.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="35" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 19:24:43</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:36:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">642645100</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">pZ05SqfoMsVRNVlkJ1hGi+EwUJQ2H6knnTEh8YjKT4Q=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="17"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="9ca0609d-78c0-4e93-886f-682a67de1942"><source>If you selected to run an Invisalign Outcome Simulator Pro simulation and tapped <g id="115">Send</g>, the Viewer is displayed showing the progress of the simulation.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="36">If you selected to run an Invisalign Outcome Simulator Pro simulation and tapped <g id="115">Send</g>, the Viewer is displayed showing the progress of the simulation.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="36">Se você selecionou executar o Simulador de Resultado Invisalign Pro e tocou em <g id="115">Enviar</g>, o Visualizador é exibido, mostrando o progresso da simulação.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="36" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 19:24:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:36:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-547852685</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">cUsdtrh5pYzss3Rn6L36LL7+NxzbOXsiE/hSjZbrCUs=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="17"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0b26cb28-3e31-4d26-b57c-de96a01e0aca"><source>Invisalign Outcome Simulator Pro progress shown in the Viewer</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="37">Invisalign Outcome Simulator Pro progress shown in the Viewer</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="37">Progresso do Simulador de Resultado Invisalign Pro mostrado no Visualizador</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="37" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 15:53:06</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:30:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1105660866</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">bDWLKVkR+ckjvbMjvYm3N2x7BIC7UmYNlkwo1u4BbtM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="17"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="38fecbce-2c46-4ea5-8406-739a9b41cfc8"><source>You can also view the progress of the simulation in the patient&apos;s profile page.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38">You can also view the progress of the simulation in the patient&apos;s profile page.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38">Você também pode visualizar o progresso da simulação na página de perfil do paciente.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="38" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 15:53:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:30:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2034314182</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">M75LX1bwBL447Ef2kmIko9zzireSJrv6oX7tGAFdoRY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="17"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="13d0b88a-c022-41c8-ab59-14ffdcb6f6a1"><source>Invisalign Outcome Simulator Pro progress shown in the patient&apos;s profile page</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39">Invisalign Outcome Simulator Pro progress shown in the patient&apos;s profile page</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39">Progresso do Simulator de Resultado Invisalign Pro mostrado na página de perfil do paciente.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="39" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 15:54:02</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:30:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">705068930</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">pGv/Vpa2xQD9rdPIACOkekbxIVar1xJSQAsOW1WOHB4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="17"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="716980e0-b389-443a-8d76-553c20381bcb"><source>If you did not select to run Invisalign Outcome Simulator Pro, a notification is displayed that the model is being sent and then the patient’s profile page is displayed showing the status of the order.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40">If you did not select to run Invisalign Outcome Simulator Pro, a notification is displayed that the model is being sent and then the patient’s profile page is displayed showing the status of the order.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40">Se você não selecionou executar o Simulador de Resultado Invisalign Pro, será exibida uma notificação, informando que o modelo está sendo enviado e, em seguida, o status do pedido é exibido na página de perfil do paciente.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="40" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 16:00:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:30:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">461535017</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">hXcKRJHKg77NVeESOAE0HDw03AFiOsfjQSog6MF+oRk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\B. EMC declaration\Separation distances.htm.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-language="pt-br"><header><reference><internal-file form="base64">UEsDBBQAAAAIACQ0GVn9skbBpQYAABguAAAQAAAAbXozdzFwaXguenhrLnhsZu1a224bNxB9D5B/
