LEDs illumination meets Risk Group 1 (Low-Risk) according to EN 62471, Photobiological safety of lamps and lamp systems.Laser illumination is classified as a class 1 laser product per IEC 60825-1, Safety of laser products - Equipment classification and requirements.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="144">Illumination: White LEDs illumination meets Risk Group 1 (Low-Risk) according to EN 62471, Photobiological safety of lamps and lamp systems.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="145">Laser illumination is classified as a class 1 laser product per IEC 60825-1, Safety of laser products - Equipment classification and requirements.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="144">Iluminação: a iluminação por LEDs brancos atende ao Grupo de Risco 1 (Baixo Risco) de acordo com EN 62471, Segurança fotobiológica de lâmpadas e sistemas de lâmpadas.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="145">A iluminação a laser é classificada como um produto a laser de classe 1 de acordo com a norma IEC 60825-1, Segurança de produtos a laser - Classificação e requisitos de equipamentos.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="144" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 18:11:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1944677145</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">SYdFCMGHeMQoUTC/QXkl3hbNEPUoDND73QqCe/A1NLo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="145" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 18:11:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl: