e0f"><source>Software updates:Installing</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Software updates:Installing</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">yx200sihNI/cwSPCuSFfYk1OSoFlnbW15Hxvsr2KOPo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2bc0e17d-a35f-4fbb-9866-1ddbbb63589e"><source>Updating the scanner software</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Updating the scanner software</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Atualizando o software do scanner</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:43:02</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1846149142</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ylrAVtFxsgRL6gkpn7vSFORL2jkWLTFsmCrnlk9LI64=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="11cffd26-aac0-455d-a522-9151607466b4"><source>In order to ensure that the scanner software is up to date and to support the continuous cyber security of the scanner, whenever a new software version is available, it is downloaded to the scanner and must be installed <g id="5">within 7 days</g>.Software updates include new features as applicable, software improvements, and security-related items.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">In order to ensure that the scanner software is up to date and to support the continuous cyber security of the scanner, whenever a new software version is available, it is downloaded to the scanner and must be installed <g id="5">within 7 days</g>.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Software updates include new features as applicable, software improvements, and security-related items.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Para garantir que o software do scanner esteja atualizado e para oferecer suporte à segurança cibernética contínua do scanner, sempre que uma nova versão do software estiver disponível, esta é baixada para o scanner e deve ser instalada <g id="5">em até 7 dias</g>.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">As atualizações de software incluem, conforme o caso, novos recursos, aprimoramentos do software e itens relacionados à segurança.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:43:35</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">468612834</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">+XIgPGVT6pv75VlvMZFIRyUQSgV6cXSP++7LaEhT4eo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:48:32</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">522329160</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YzUWAQk+EdXr3JqZU7V7ZkOIcl40/f2VFv9eVOJTJK8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3615803b-15e3-409a-b1a1-efbe5231bd00"><source>After the software updates have been downloaded, a <g id="13">Software Updates/Security Updates</g> window is displayed when logging in to the scanner, notifying you about these updates and enabling you to schedule a time they should be installed – postponed daily for up to 7 days, immediately, or later the same night.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">After the software updates have been downloaded, a <g id="13">Software Updates/Security Updates</g> window is displayed when logging in to the scanner, notifying you about these updates and enabling you to schedule a time they should be installed – postponed daily for up to 7 days, immediately, or later the same night.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Depois que as atualizações de software forem baixadas, ao fazer login no scanner, será exibida a janela <g id="13">Atualizações de Software/Atualizações de Segurança</g>, notificando-o sobre tais atualizações e permitindo que você agende um horário que as mesmas devem ser instaladas – adiar diariamente por até 7 dias, imediatamente, ou mais tarde no mesmo dia.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 17:32:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">672833549</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">MfkU4nHk4S0huOjCXOFcRcX9StLfHqzcqB8lXoQGwhw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="6a9c446a-88dd-47a3-b969-f4ae3a9277fa"><source>Software Updates/Security Updates window – scheduling options</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Software Updates/Security Updates window – scheduling options</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Janela Atualizações de Software/Atualizações de Segurança – opções de agendamento</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="7" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:53:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1842428362</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">MbP3jFn2GU29Af465n/PW9QRSSIpPUZKX/33kD2OCBE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="30cc630a-3557-4efa-85a5-bf7f9080b4c1"><source>To install the software updates, the scanner needs to be connected to the AC power and switched on, and you need to log out.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">To install the software updates, the scanner needs to be connected to the AC power and switched on, and you need to log out.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Para instalar as atualizações de software, o scanner precisa estar conectado à energia CA e ligado, além de ter a sessão encerrada.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="8" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:54:06</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">960924737</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">T41uqwL8PfUqyViWKy8bs0rBrwK/rl0pnuYGhmhwPVI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="9f822af8-14ff-4d40-ab96-d642df7524cd"><source>Notes:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">Notes:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">Notas:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="9" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="MV5Vg0NrwdcmWKQ9naRB8KXHXb6LE+trTaKS4OubnEc="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/07/2019 00:22:06</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/19/2020 22:28:16</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-381729265</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">MV5Vg0NrwdcmWKQ9naRB8KXHXb6LE+trTaKS4OubnEc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="b73c1ef4-4599-46ce-b6bd-2f101f1d66db"><source>Installing the updates should take about 40 minutes during which time the scanner cannot be used.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Installing the updates should take about 40 minutes during which time the scanner cannot be used.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">A instalação das atualizações deve levar cerca de 40 minutos e, nesse período, o scanner não pode ser usado.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="10" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:54:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">989675619</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">4dT9OGhjQ4x3XKGM+7fXU5CxSLkRAEG0u0hFR5B4zjQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="88e43075-09e6-4a27-a36f-921366fd2b14"><source>Once the installation starts, it cannot be paused or canceled.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">Once the installation starts, it cannot be paused or canceled.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">Uma vez iniciada a instalação, ela não pode ser pausada ou cancelada.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="11" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/17/2022 00:43:20</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:49:58</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">578817571</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">SRiMF0AbVpnrVhj66EIr5TR6uMNBXYFawCbPPFuHe6w=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="7306bcaa-baab-436a-8c4d-8868de3a195c"><source>If you ignore the message and do not install the software updates within 7 days, they will be installed automatically the next time the scanner is restarted.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">If you ignore the message and do not install the software updates within 7 days, they will be installed automatically the next time the scanner is restarted.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">Se você ignorar a mensagem e não instalar as atualizações de software em até 7 dias, elas serão instaladas automaticamente na próxima vez que o scanner for reiniciado.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="12" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:54:40</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">418858747</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">JzbdaPsyEjpMDPN3QyIBHTOSwleqY38hlVitcCtEguc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ee81b50c-4948-4c84-8447-e1c31fbf694a"><source>To schedule the software-update installation:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">To schedule the software-update installation:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">Para agendar a instalação da atualização de software:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="13" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:54:52</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1948284928</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">DIwllrgtNxuYuuEMO5r/0ZDss91KpTdKEGztRODl4lQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="cc7cbe3b-9b35-460d-8b05-8093fef4a931"><source>In the <g id="19">Software Updates/Security Updates</g> window, tap one of the following scheduling options:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">In the <g id="19">Software Updates/Security Updates</g> window, tap one of the following scheduling options:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">Na janela <g id="19">Atualizações de Software/ Atualizações de Segurança</g>, toque em uma das seguintes opções de agendamento:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="14" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:55:37</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1778115740</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">6Hj05El8bYg0qU09tV6Xyh7THbK4c9EppjTLZ5Hf5/4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0be8f24b-8e0f-4269-80a6-eecd11122229"><source><g id="26">Remind Me Later:</g> The software installation is postponed for up to 7 days.For more information, see <x id="28"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="15"><g id="26">Remind Me Later:</g> The software installation is postponed for up to 7 days.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="16">For more information, see <x id="28"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="15"><g id="26">Lembre-me mais tarde:</g> a instalação do software será adiada por até 7 dias.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="16">Para mais informações, consulte <x id="28"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="15" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:55:58</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">232056726</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">iXcyjfaxccyqtT6B9KkamN2s78xbwrv4uQIbP988f8E=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="16" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="7Ohy1cOz5eX+waPmq2AF23DPmdMlIbw4Gf/7YOWfIqI="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1809051878</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">7Ohy1cOz5eX+waPmq2AF23DPmdMlIbw4Gf/7YOWfIqI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="9ac2c469-32c1-49a4-b052-1f480f44da6e"><source><g id="35">Install NOW:</g> The software is installed immediately.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17"><g id="35">Install NOW:</g> The software is installed immediately.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17"><g id="35">Instalar AGORA:</g> o software é instalado imediatamente.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="17" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:56:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1820702840</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">8e3490spWPPZ0kiDxaBdDk7HQvA7dWWLnBF8/T1zD4Q=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5c4753c1-a9ec-418e-a4cc-17650b69e1d0"><source><g id="42">Install Tonight:</g> The software will be installed at 11 PM that night.For more information, see <x id="44"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18"><g id="42">Install Tonight:</g> The software will be installed at 11 PM that night.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">For more information, see <x id="44"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18"><g id="42">Instalar Hoje à Noite:</g> o software será instalado às 23h do mesmo dia.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">Para mais informações, consulte <x id="44"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="18" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:57:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-679209973</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">lzxdszdi642lbMmkA9l9YEKa2MDI6niSGv/NgFgIyAs=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="19" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="7Ohy1cOz5eX+waPmq2AF23DPmdMlIbw4Gf/7YOWfIqI="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1809051878</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">7Ohy1cOz5eX+waPmq2AF23DPmdMlIbw4Gf/7YOWfIqI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="87994b75-9705-4ae1-82b2-3259a690b713"><source>Before the installation is due to take place, make sure that the scanner is connected to the AC power and switched on, and that you have logged out.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">Before the installation is due to take place, make sure that the scanner is connected to the AC power and switched on, and that you have logged out.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">Antes de proceder com a instalação, certifique-se de que o scanner esteja conectado à energia CA e ligado, e que você tenha encerrado a sessão.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="20" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/03/2022 17:26:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:57:45</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1786711217</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ur941heMrGuts2gnkRruj5eu8YjkDZuV0lgBonUkKlo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="05a40d03-4eec-48d4-8a1e-d44151b85e71"><source>If the scanner is not connected to the AC power, you are prompted to connect it.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">If the scanner is not connected to the AC power, you are prompted to connect it.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">Se o scanner não estiver conectado à energia CA, você receberá mensagem para conectá-lo.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="21" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:57:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1586532407</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">q84ToZYoLE3yR2YxbKieg41R0quBglZko7Tvqxbpc0g=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="b402a0ea-1bc2-49d4-ac0c-4b4d0520dcc1"><source>Connect the scanner to the AC power</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">Connect the scanner to the AC power</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">Conecte o scanner à energia CA</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="22" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/03/2022 17:35:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:57:50</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1859738278</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YmlmT6CqpHeCbovxziIZNd3R3ypNyB3uWC/4j+QpHdg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="64567029-3d1d-4725-afa3-4c9931855f80"><source>Plug in the scanner and then tap <g id="51">Continue</g>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">Plug in the scanner and then tap <g id="51">Continue</g>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">Conecte o scanner e, em seguida, toque em <g id="51">Continuar</g>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="23" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1962052766</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">V4OyzcTdSkzxLIc5J/ei/eRFlWxM/zgQrsTUODNbQYo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="e03cd556-471f-408d-8b65-fde50cefd426"><source>The installation starts and a message is displayed showing the installation progress.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">The installation starts and a message is displayed showing the installation progress.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">A instalação é iniciada, sendo exibida uma mensagem mostrando o progresso da instalação.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="24" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/03/2022 17:36:07</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:50:45</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1438347620</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Dsgf4Dupr6kZlApOEaN6W1J1ZmrDIHiBjNVZzgBbjvo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="333fc684-c5b2-4bde-a973-2f7b4a29df47"><source>Installation in progress</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Installation in progress</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">Instalação em andamento</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="25" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/03/2022 17:36:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:50:47</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1700570207</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">WdTjKnvk0eeOpDGiZNkLSYqyLBqCG5tckkzPm11ATNk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3f6208fe-3a49-4580-b548-a2beb635cd04"><source><g id="57">Note:</g> Do not unplug, restart, or turn off the scanner while the software updates are being installed.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26"><g id="57">Note:</g> Do not unplug, restart, or turn off the scanner while the software updates are being installed.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26"><g id="57">Observação:</g> não desconecte, reinicie ou desligue o scanner enquanto as atualizações de software estiverem sendo instaladas.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="26" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:58:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">535945302</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YSaWQ5xp/USiyszoQK4mHngoDiLhIvjW+uBv/p3kK9o=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="75bade4c-66e8-4757-bbd1-0ce454cd89ad"><source>Once the software has been installed, a success notification is displayed and the scanner restarts.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27">Once the software has been installed, a success notification is displayed and the scanner restarts.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27">Assim que o software tiver sido instalado, será exibida uma notificação, indicando que as mesmas foram bem-sucedidas e o scanner será reiniciado.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="27" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:58:52</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-387772551</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">6u5uh/vhiF+FdpY9aNU1Lz37F9cs3ciTwtyZdnALsXw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="b02fd2b6-47af-4930-96a9-49609aaf7023"><source>Installation completed successfully</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28">Installation completed successfully</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28">Instalação concluída com sucesso</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="28" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/03/2022 17:37:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:50:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">281221971</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">mEWyKGIJspAXJ5Nl3XmTIxK2WmS3Xi9QOYBCP/S/tyc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="b0a9441e-1d6f-4ae8-9d4a-31c5ca4ede15"><source>Remind Me Later – Postponing the software update installation</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">Remind Me Later – Postponing the software update installation</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">Lembrar-me mais tarde – Adiar a instalação da atualização do software</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="29" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/03/2022 17:37:58</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:50:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-477384612</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">gDovbyOrKEOhK6o/0TCxbVODPhqyO+LltL9zpS28wLY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="14"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="f2d72653-a19b-4d61-92fd-4bffa5b15336"><source>You can postpone the software-update installation for up to a week.Every day, the notification will display the number of days remaining until the updates have to be installed.You can select to postpone the updates, install them immediately, or schedule them for later that night.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">You can postpone the software-update installation for up to a week.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31">Every day, the notification will display the number of days remaining until the updates have to be installed.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32">You can select to postpone the updates, install them immediately, or schedule them for later that night.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">Você pode adiar a instalação de atualização de software por até uma semana.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31">Todos os dias, a notificação exibirá o número de dias restantes até que as atualizações de software tenham que ser instaladas.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32">Você pode optar por adiar as atualizações, instalá-las imediatamente ou agendá-las para mais tarde à noite.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="30" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:59:29</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1638218291</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Qs5BiBiI4oqGCVjjdZac8TVtJoYpiuBiEJiayRV0j04=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="31" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:59:38</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">471553946</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Qevc/EVfjMZNUmHTF5FXyalPRbdQzFFEhmZAn2pmHds=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="32" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/03/2022 17:41:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:51:00</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1275066787</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">aP+NtHLfybcKA6wjikKkIZM9b/ZLAK6cfhlPLx7FWuE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a2faa579-00e1-440a-931b-394cb2a34990"><source>Software updates – number of days until the updates must be installed</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33">Software updates – number of days until the updates must be installed</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="33">Atualizações de software – número de dias até que as atualizações devam ser instaladas</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="33" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:59:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-679856132</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">EzijKcUMO2Bkq7l5mH2YinL/ZcIiabIQEalz9EQ4UWc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="03a226d5-f64e-44a9-8231-5742c740d982"><source>On the 7th day, the software updates must be installed.You can select whether to install them immediately, or schedule the installation for later that night, as described below.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="34">On the 7th day, the software updates must be installed.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="35">You can select whether to install them immediately, or schedule the installation for later that night, as described below.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="34">No 7º dia, as atualizações de software devem ser instaladas.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="35">Você pode selecionar se deseja instalá-las imediatamente ou agendar a instalação para mais tarde à noite, conforme descrito abaixo.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="34" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 13:59:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1431569910</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">wNziwK0rDf0BxJ8A9zXpFM03XBCFfP5X5gI9fcwltxM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="35" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/03/2022 17:42:44</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/18/2022 00:51:06</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1554915373</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">CcPAQodnoquMDZlLiY3YMdXKNZrcz6Y+wHMsQcljzjk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="33a10c1e-d765-4965-8cf0-d80ace48fcaf"><source><g id="69">Note:</g> If you ignore the message and do not install the updates, they will be installed automatically the next time the scanner is restarted.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="36"><g id="69">Note:</g> If you ignore the message and do not install the updates, they will be installed automatically the next time the scanner is restarted.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="36"><g id="69">Nota:</g> se você ignorar a mensagem e não instalar as atualizações, elas serão instaladas automaticamente na próxima vez que o scanner for reiniciado.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="36" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">613866463</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">+Rl6sJzK4MgTR9bjJxbINONxQ7sUT9ouJ0aH7S9J8gA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="671d12f7-28e3-483a-8500-afc33bc307e0"><source>Software updates – last day</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="37">Software updates – last day</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="37">Atualizações de software – último dia</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="37" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 14:00:03</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-628736564</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">P5qaG1zIF9izO4SLda7DOP4Wb53zT+TOzX92odoOpOw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="67847972-8ee5-4270-848a-19c2e2d3cc11"><source>Install Tonight – Installing the software updates later that night</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38">Install Tonight – Installing the software updates later that night</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38">Instalar hoje à noite – Instalando as atualizações de software mais tarde à noite</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="38" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 14:00:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1178173102</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">qYsU8ussGPaWGq+r/grFQklk+oYq6KYRSB0sAR8weak=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="8b139f65-24e0-413e-bda0-eb61bf6a34e3"><source>If you select to install the software updates later that night, a banner is displayed above the scanner <g id="75">Login</g> window and the home screen reminding you that you need to log out and the scanner needs to be connected to the AC power and switched on.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39">If you select to install the software updates later that night, a banner is displayed above the scanner <g id="75">Login</g> window and the home screen reminding you that you need to log out and the scanner needs to be connected to the AC power and switched on.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39">Se você selecionar a opção para instalar as atualizações de software hoje à noite, será exibido um banner acima da janela <g id="75">Login</g> do scanner e a tela inicial o lembrará que você precisa fazer logout e que o scanner precisa estar conectado à energia CA e ligado.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="39" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 14:03:10</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-406719687</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">bgLwPZ3WIR6MY3vH/Zl9HFUDQhF7P0Wv6WpgEX/JCvQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="fc168cb5-0ad3-4884-a6ea-89ad4cecda00"><source>Software updates notification – Login window</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40">Software updates notification – Login window</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40">Notificação de atualizações de software – Janela de login</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="40" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 15:57:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-90726086</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">XjhawHDnViZX7u7idb1UZOMRbzoIcUhEqs8FpHFRR2I=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="4a22879b-9f30-4ebf-a4f8-9541857eefb8"><source>Software updates notification – home screen</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="41">Software updates notification – home screen</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="41">Notificação de atualizações de software – tela inicial</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="41" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/19/2024 15:59:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 16:29:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">588029666</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">6K212C0DRw+FUsCubdYkbxXmgJrKoDjRr+BgdPbihFI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\4. Working with the scanner\User interface.htm.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-language="pt-br"><header><reference><internal-file form="base64">UEsDBBQAAAAIACQ0GVn5POR4Rg0AAHGlAAAQAAAAcGN5aXUzM2QuZHR2LnhsZu1d3W7juBW+X2Df
