control the software, while the wand buttons are used to start and stop the scan.</g></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">The iTero system provides an intuitive user interface for performing digital scans<x id="9"/>.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4"><x id="11"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5"><x id="12"/><g id="15">The touch screen is used to interact with and control the software, while the wand buttons are used to start and stop the scan.</g></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">O sistema iTero fornece uma interface intuitiva para o usuário realizar digitalizações <x id="9"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4"><x id="11"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5"><x id="12"/><g id="15">A tela tátil é usada para interagir e controlar o software, enquanto os botões do leitor são usados ​​para iniciar e parar a digitalização.</g></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="76"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="76"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Rinz8tUjJEtTxFFpnscADytd3jG4kkjqu0s7JVj7LyY=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/28/2024 19:18:06</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Rinz8tUjJEtTxFFpnscADytd3jG4kkjqu0s7JVj7LyY=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 13:23:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1933844474</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sd