ue><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 13:27:50</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1243634616</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="87ca0305-8cec-4d83-93cf-dae2198b1fc8"><source><g id="11"><g id="9">Note:</g> This section is not relevant for iTero Element 5D Plus Lite systems.</g></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3"><g id="11"><g id="9">Note:</g> This section is not relevant for iTero Element 5D Plus Lite systems.</g></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:rep id="eUrYMIT+hg0OrqdMegS+w1pP9p94sglMvG9Y3i8d2zc="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">eUrYMIT+hg0OrqdMegS+w1pP9p94sglMvG9Y3i8d2zc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="6ffbdafc-0856-433d-82b9-1d0d69982374"><source>NIRI is a method of spectroscopy that uses the near-infrared region of the electromagnetic spectrum (850nm).</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">NIRI is a method of spectroscopy that uses the near-infrared region of the electromagnetic spectrum (850nm).</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">A NIRI é um método de espectroscopia que utiliza a região de imagem infravermelha próxima do espectro eletromagnético (850nm).</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ePeztmhpHenSf4eCX35mqQNr0XvTIkP6f6R6+8AM0XQ=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-373256586</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2fab5a58-ba75-46b3-8fb7-f77f29bb60d6"><source>Visible light spectrum showing NIRI on the 850nm wavelength</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Visible light spectrum showing NIRI on the 850nm wavelength</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Espectro de luz visível, mostrando NIRI em um comprimento de onda de 850nm</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">M2r3NEQjmV4wdTqO+W7XH9nHIyxtvPC9+Rxsj1Wjoa0=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-57337883</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="8f952191-0c01-417e-bc7c-06c692490887"><source>When the wand is positioned above the tooth, NIR images are captured.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">When the wand is positioned above the tooth, NIR images are captured.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Quando o leitor é posicionado acima do dente, as imagens NIRI são capturadas.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">OK7kzetXVxbRsWDCPOR17ryCD757W1k3pZhtmbubCDc=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 13:30:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-2143297656</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3f4dc8da-1834-4731-9994-7088e2062a9e"><source>The translucency of the structure translates to the brightness level in the NIRI image – the higher the translucency, the darker the object, and vice versa.Tooth enamel is translucent to NIRI and will appear dark.Dentin and any interference in the enamel, e.g. caries, are reflective and cause the light to scatter, and therefore will appear brighter and opaque.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">The translucency of the structure translates to the brightness level in the NIRI image – the higher the translucency, the darker the object, and vice versa.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Tooth enamel is translucent to NIRI and will appear dark.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">Dentin and any interference in the enamel, e.g. caries, are reflective and cause the light to scatter, and therefore will appear brighter and opaque.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">A translucidez da estrutura se traduz no nível de brilho na imagem NIRI – quanto maior a translucidez mais escuro é o objeto, e vice-versa.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">O esmalte do dente é translúcido para o NIRI e irá aparecer escuro.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">A dentina e quaisquer interferências no esmalte, ex.: cáries, são refletivas e fazem com que a luz se espalhe, consequentemente, aparecerão mais brilhantes e opacas.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="7" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">XzkIsvV7ozTM/7zBRWcs4mg/zvvz08+zgqm3OehxOtc=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:31:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-38876177</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="8" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">RAfEuuYpwxLwfGfWV2oc/qXdX+Q9LvZUKdfufDBjMv0=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 13:34:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1413803282</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="9" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">fonmLV9Dun7eaQ3hzhUu+DKHqEIyutxVlYrg2k9917k=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-2110658294</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="15c21f80-85b0-4bed-9f22-9105d2fcf1d4"><source>Wand positioned on the tooth surface</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Wand positioned on the tooth surface</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Leitor posicionado na superfície do dente</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="10" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">/GKuuiitlQbwaLr8jLYwrkl33p3Ujx2UvBUn6ZdhXYw=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 13:36:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1012411209</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="449a02a3-97ec-4c97-a6ce-aa1b43138acf"><source>Tooth enamel is translucent</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">Tooth enamel is translucent</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">O esmalte do dente é translúcido</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="11" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">HziYgBOz7odZfaWu2lViFbI80crzm4uV787H9ELiZXI=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 13:36:28</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">2086250865</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="102f1cd8-1d6e-40ac-bf85-1c3a2af862f5"><source>Dentin and caries are reflective</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">Dentin and caries are reflective</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">Dentina e cáries são refletivas</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="12" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YT8GVyQcMHG5TfnHoAfQQCdd4yO4k8TNpIrT5X4k93I=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 13:36:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1101736643</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0c68860a-c16c-4b46-9147-5bc80b7c36b4"><source>Reflective concept – healthy enamel is translucent while dentin and caries are reflective</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">Reflective concept – healthy enamel is translucent while dentin and caries are reflective</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">Conceito de refletivo – um esmalte saudável é translúcido enquanto dentina e cáries são refletivas</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="13" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">RWOGAm6fcFn1WoFp1fHu9y3R1DMwPedYmQePTBttUx4=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 13:37:00</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-740606168</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="509ec33f-f14b-41c1-808c-86e9bd32ac7f"><source>NIR images are captured automatically and seamlessly during the scan, from every angle used for the 3D scanning, and all collected information can then be reviewed using the <x id="17"/> Review tool.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">NIR images are captured automatically and seamlessly during the scan, from every angle used for the 3D scanning, and all collected information can then be reviewed using the <x id="17"/> Review tool.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">As imagens NIRI são capturadas automaticamente e diretamente durante a digitalização, de cada ângulo utilizado para a digitalização 3D, e todas as informações coletadas podem ser revisadas, utilizando a ferramenta<x id="17"/> Revisão.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="14" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">gppEsy9JPysSosgB/Zwd3aMOpuGeoCRPMDm1aSlxYjM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/29/2024 03:06:17</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">gppEsy9JPysSosgB/Zwd3aMOpuGeoCRPMDm1aSlxYjM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:29:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/29/2024 03:06:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-893896409</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3fe93e1d-9d94-4364-997b-53885862fe32"><source><g id="23">Note:</g> NIR images should be used in conjunction with the current standard of care for caries detection, and do not replace it.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="15"><g id="23">Note:</g> NIR images should be used in conjunction with the current standard of care for caries detection, and do not replace it.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="15"><g id="23">Nota:</g> as imagens NIRI devem ser utilizadas em conjunto com a norma atual de cuidados para a detecção de cárie, não podendo ser substituída.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="15" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">C9ERM8qwg9LT5PClRHDw5PM85kEAyrF94oYMgn+okIE=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/29/2024 03:10:42</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-2001306376</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">C9ERM8qwg9LT5PClRHDw5PM85kEAyrF94oYMgn+okIE=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">193309928</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/29/2024 03:10:45</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c838736e-a617-4360-b61a-cf66a4c443ad"><source>The resulting NIRI grayscale image shows structures with varying translucency as different levels of brightness.The lower the translucency, the higher the reflection of the infrared light and the brighter the structure.Using this technology, it is possible to make out the following structures:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="16">The resulting NIRI grayscale image shows structures with varying translucency as different levels of brightness.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17">The lower the translucency, the higher the reflection of the infrared light and the brighter the structure.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18">Using this technology, it is possible to make out the following structures:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="16">A imagem NIRI em escala de cinza exibe estruturas com translucidez variável como diferentes níveis de brilho.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17">Quanto menor a translucidez, maior será o reflexo da luz infravermelha e mais brilhante a estrutura.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18">Utilizando esta tecnologia, é possível criar as seguintes estruturas:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="16" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">TmKHXnmOuHUx3ZRrCQ2z0Or75X9pTZ/AfGkUeyanmHo=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-765836936</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="17" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Q1RK/8O3cMadPCX63DjzKxuSYEcZ5t/W106z5sXtGVo=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-1293905562</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="18" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FENsIm1OO/oBEPnk5umbEM6B6VLAv56+XxQlJX8ylUM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 13:50:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1903974285</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="595b8144-d072-4a01-9f71-36ae54c9080f"><source>Appears</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">Appears</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">Aparência</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="19" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Ii4wfaRQ7EXx46r421BsSM4joi2CQB39gwIlO0+D8wo=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 17:38:53</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1679159716</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="af03a779-94d3-47b4-a40b-dd618ee2a415"><source>Translucency</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">Translucency</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">Translucidez</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="20" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">QyKhwCcnyez52kpEJ/MwCs5cpEFgg60jJgubl6svzmo=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-822263452</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0118f7da-4d74-4fa2-a2b5-f165b5396333"><source>Enamel</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">Enamel</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">Esmalte</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="21" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">hoXI+6dtPjkoEby2v16ardA3eKh05zFPKiVyRLnopGI=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 13:50:58</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1355007369</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="53ddf85e-6f4b-4b0f-bc08-440732b7e0a3"><source>Dark</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">Dark</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">Escuro</mrk></targe