453-4ec7-8fee-1a601be30ccc"><source>Orders</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="1">Orders</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="1"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="1" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:rep id="+Oww4LB0MmlxWAjKnwJdM6tZB6ywPlIkoTrbnmmUdk8="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">+Oww4LB0MmlxWAjKnwJdM6tZB6ywPlIkoTrbnmmUdk8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0a1c6021-dcea-4f39-9cd6-fcd01526bfc9"><source>Working with orders</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Working with orders</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Trabalhando com os pedidos</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/10/2019 01:31:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/22/2019 20:03:06</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-711032366</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">C5C+27hMVay7cAS4pRZj8BjcRELShbBlYNtvUajXDQw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c4824e33-30b1-4019-82aa-fc1457fd31e0"><source>Tap the <g id="5">Orders</g> button to display a list of all your orders.The button may contain a badge that indicates the number of orders that have not been submitted yet.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Tap the <g id="5">Orders</g> button to display a list of all your orders.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">The button may contain a badge that indicates the number of orders that have not been submitted yet.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Toque no botão <g id="5">Pedidos</g> para exibir uma lista de todos os seus pedidos.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">O botão pode conter um símbolo que indica o número de pedidos que ainda não foram enviados.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1214465544</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">rOW64jqAjTsLclP3nV3pBNOcitvQGTUqyjdQ4MHM+Ks=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/10/2019 01:21:44</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/24/2019 01:50:42</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1033588971</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">KZtZt3tmmR+69/c5qkM42MT9kthqzfrMW1uI0n2u0cU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d42138c8-7213-4659-9092-b7d918a51563"><source>If an order has been returned from the lab, the button is displayed in red, with an alarm icon badge, as described in <x id="9"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">If an order has been returned from the lab, the button is displayed in red, with an alarm icon badge, as described in <x id="9"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Se um pedido foi devolvido do laboratório, o botão é exibido em vermelho e junto a um ícone de alarme, conforme descrito em <x id="9"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-746720066</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">wzxc/SuEhm/i5JOY2v1v0uu7lIrHCMML52SC2fGl/B4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="95899d57-8a45-46d4-b73d-b144319b8cc1"><source>The <g id="15">Orders</g> page is made up of two panes listing the orders that are still in progress and the ones that have already been submitted.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">The <g id="15">Orders</g> page is made up of two panes listing the orders that are still in progress and the ones that have already been submitted.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">A página <g id="15">Pedidos</g> é composta por dois painéis, listando os pedidos que ainda estão em andamento e os que já foram enviados.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1783876837</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">c6PUW8ebK6n0sIb2KWzbkTPisj/IvIz6LEkhUPsEfHY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c8a16b59-66ec-4efe-ae7b-780aa237f903"><source>You can view the following details for each order: the order ID, patient’s name, chart number, the scan date, procedure,<x id="19"/> and the status of the order.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">You can view the following details for each order: the order ID, patient’s name, chart number, the scan date, procedure,<x id="19"/> and the status of the order.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Você pode visualizar os seguintes detalhes para cada pedido: o ID do pedido, o nome do paciente, o número do prontuário, a data da digitalização, o procedimento,<x id="19"/> e o status do pedido.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="7" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 22:31:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 17:56:35</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">233829678</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">WUJzDTz6yukumioUXPVrigzzOzhzpT3KOAvYXTZYOPs=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0242fc51-8b47-4a5a-99c1-8e88c7c08394"><source><g id="28">Note:</g> The <g id="31">NIRI</g> column is not displayed for iTero Element 5D Plus Lite systems.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8"><g id="28">Note:</g> The <g id="31">NIRI</g> column is not displayed for iTero Element 5D Plus Lite systems.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="8" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">vWnakViMAyGSwcws2kv9q2Jl6C+V5U7OA