asis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;MadCap:conditionalText MadCap:conditions=&quot;iTero.Restorative only&quot; xmlns:MadCap=&quot;http://www.madcapsoftware.com/Schemas/MadCap.xsd&quot;&amp;gt;&lt;/bpt&gt;missing scans, bite issues, or if the margin line is not clear&lt;ept id=&quot;1&quot; xmlns=&quot;urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;/MadCap:conditionalText&amp;gt;&lt;/ept&gt;&lt;/MadCap:placeholderCondition&gt;</value><value key="hasDisplayText">True</value><value key="attribute:id">1</value><value key="attribute:xmlns">urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2</value></props></tag></tag-defs></header><body><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="739068f4-bf80-4e1b-af19-5e79523eb7be"><source>Working with returned orders</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="1">Working with returned orders</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="1">Trabalhando com pedidos devolvidos</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="1" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/27/2021 18:21:10</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/27/2021 18:21:10</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1700237091</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">uP6qE72Fekd9WROXh2UfieeVzdRv0+N3yzQY/+OxFOM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="dca1fb1d-e35f-4650-b3d3-952757680da5"><source>Labs can return orders within 30 days if the scan is incomplete and needs to be rescanned, for example, if there are <x id="9"/><g id="12">missing scans or bite issues</g>.If the lab returns an order, the <g id="16">Orders</g> button is highlighted in red with an alarm icon badge.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Labs can return orders within 30 days if the scan is incomplete and needs to be rescanned, for example, if there are <x id="9"/><g id="12">missing scans or bite issues</g>.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">If the lab returns an order, the <g id="16">Orders</g> button is highlighted in red with an alarm icon badge.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Os laboratórios podem devolver pedidos dentro de 30 dias se a digitalização estiver incompleta e precisar ser realizada novamente, por exemplo, se houver <x id="9"/><g id="12">digitalização faltando ou problemas de mordida</g>.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Se o laboratório retornar um pedido, o botão <g id="16">Pedidos</g> será destacado em vermelho com um ícone de alarme.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="80"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">knFF9JCRTj6oxCL4QGg6BA9szjp/hQJkDq8dyAbzLds=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/29/2024 03:18:45</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">knFF9JCRTj6oxCL4QGg6BA9szjp/hQJkDq8dyAbzLds=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/29/2024 03:19:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">knFF9JCRTj6oxCL4QGg6BA9szjp/hQJkDq8dyAbzLds=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 13:22:35</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/29/2024 03:19:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">853401006</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">650536531</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">5pVBahPSyd5ytN4F3jwQhkH8xnK5g8YZTUz/sUE5WUw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="dfe92c67-41b2-453b-9b45-b7099acc30d2"><source>Orders button notifying a returned order</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Orders button notifying a returned order</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Botão Pedidos notificando um a devolução de um pedido</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/27/2021 18:30:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/27/2021 18:30:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-319013453</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">bHqwYjr8kDysYaR5d5y4K4600kYdWalqZEPNaAzHZmA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d8a68014-a079-4578-92ab-fd2989855864"><source>The returned order is displayed at the top of the <g id="26">In Progress</g> pane, with the status <g id="29">Returned</g>, in red.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">The returned order is displayed at the top of the <g id="26">In Progress</g> pane, with the status <g id="29">Returned</g>, in red.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">O pedido devolvido é exibido na parte superior do painel <g id="26">Em Andamento</g> , com o status <g id="29">Devolvido</g>, em vermelho.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-292629675</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">P37rK4aRtnnW2yZ+uY73rEWKoy95Q1eXF5MC1AinQrk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="270423b1-c99f-42f4-abf6-5fc352594540"><source>Returned order in the In Progress pane</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Returned order in the In Progress pane</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Pedido devolvido no painel Em Andamento</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/27/2021 18:31:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/27/2021 18:31:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">440732893</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">qe+Vio3kAAXSj69G4I2fIxZeJEERFrYWutA11VAtuIQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:s