</seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Trabalhando com a ferramenta Borracha<x id="3"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2141481042</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">WnSK2v1qOZ6cCwnxzQX46QkJp20AF4oPiaoIZ0NdoZI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5cd29e6a-0ff8-49f9-9755-3e0c450a62d2"><source>The Eraser tool <x id="5"/> enables you to erase a selected area of the scanned model and then rescan only the erased area.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">The Eraser tool <x id="5"/> enables you to erase a selected area of the scanned model and then rescan only the erased area.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">A ferramenta Borracha <x id="5"/> permite que você apague uma área selecionada do modelo digitalizado e, posteriormente, redigitalize apenas a área apagada.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">368785906</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">mhGPyGtMxZZk9N6H4o0dd/3NIjMtNAxE6qPif5leUjU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d4503a6f-3e39-4724-93b4-1890ea298a60"><source>For example:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">For example:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Por exemplo:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/09/2019 21:41:28</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/22/2019 18:32:33</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">676386026</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">k+xZ7tn9S9An45nnaMOBP1wRbspfHO43nUZUfWXwVLo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="f4db95c6-c75c-4210-8f48-f3bf77fde9ca"><source>You can remove moisture and artifacts, such as blood or saliva<x id="9"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">You can remove moisture and artifacts, such as blood or saliva<x id="9"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Você pode remover umidade e artefatos, como sangue ou saliva<x id="9"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="72"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="72"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">HYQv8V0vUBIfKYeXpFf0HHCHirXsp8aN4lHkFu37uAk=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/29/2024 03:20:40</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">HYQv8V0vUBIfKYeXpFf0HHCHirXsp8aN4lHkFu37uAk=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 13:25:47</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1266790758</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="12"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="9824d6c8-692f-4f4a-9a3d-097f8ac912de"><source>If there are areas of red on the Occlusal Clearance legend after post-processing (<g id="24">View</g> mode), you can reduce the relevant tooth, return to <g id="27">Scan</g> mode to erase the area on the model, and then rescan it.<x id="28"/><x id="30"/><x id="31"/><x id="32"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">If there are areas of red on the Occlusal Clearance legend after post-processing (<g id="24">View</g> mode), you can reduce the relevant tooth, return to <g id="27">Scan</g> mode to erase the area on the model, and then rescan it.<x id="28"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8"><x id="30"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9"><x id="31"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10"><x id="32"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Se houver áreas vermelhas na legenda Espaço Livre Oclusal após o pós-processamento (modo <g id="24">Visualizar</g>), você poderá reduzir o dente relevante, retornar ao modo <g id="27">Digitalização</g> para apagar a área do modelo e, em seguida, digitalizá-lo novamente.<x id="28"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8"><x id="30"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9"><x id="31"/></mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10"><x id="32"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="7" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/06/2024 10:54:37</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1335341980</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YbmWCVf+qBGHnFDA4kLR190T/8adWx4r3b6UwSAOOyU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="8" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="9" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="10" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofj