-defs><sdl:seg id="1" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1284506130</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">sAgGoQKT+o6+opjSxMnd23VllTMf5NZPi/oYyFAkiXY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2cec1340-6a5f-4999-a1d7-15f5d6737f7e"><source>After being switched on, the <x id="3"/> system requires approximately 7 minutes to warm up before initial use.The LED light ring at the base of the wand indicates the state of the wand.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">After being switched on, the <x id="3"/> system requires approximately 7 minutes to warm up before initial use.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">The LED light ring at the base of the wand indicates the state of the wand.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Depois de ligado, o sistema <x id="3"/> necessita de aproximadamente 7 minutos para aquecer antes do uso inicial.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">O anel de luz LED na base do leitor indica o estado do leitor.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-367958894</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ND1wRTXDey5o4htiWyOcZNLl270am+ptxKyGA09YktA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">786807333</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">u3ZQ+vqbQHzjkfc4ntyWa2BXs3bYuVMZCHw9Rk+tcsM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="017f0f35-42dc-484e-a9aa-8b0b83a4091d"><source>The wand can be in one of the following states:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">The wand can be in one of the following states:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">O leitor pode estar em um dos seguintes estados:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1076455532</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ovutQgxtq7VC4uRhdCSwq6tp7jUW4/PH+prArDvo4eU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="39ca25af-b088-49ad-9d45-230d27517e9a"><source><g id="11">Off</g> - The wand light ring is turned off.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5"><g id="11">Off</g> - The wand light ring is turned off.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5"><g id="11">Desligado</g> - O anel de luz do leitor está desligado.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 14:16:41</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">771896632</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">0h1wV7AIFxXH3fT+FduGJjAxW214xAzrNUNYOZ/pWzI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="7d1fabca-1ab2-466c-8d06-84212af60720"><source><g id="18">Warming up/Initializing</g> - The LED light ring flickers slowly (pulsates) while the system is warming up.When you move to Scan mode, a <x id="20"/> icon is displayed on the toolbar and the progress of the initialization is displayed.This takes approximately 7 minutes.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6"><g id="18">Warming up/Initializing</g> - The LED light ring flickers slowly (pulsates) while the system is warming up.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">When you move to Scan mode, a <x id="20"/> icon is displayed on the toolbar and the progress of the initialization is displayed.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">This takes approximately 7 minutes.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6"><g id="18">Aquecendo/Inicializando</g> - O anel de luz LED pisca lentamente (pulsa) enquanto o sistema está aquecendo,</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Quando você passa para o modo Digitalizar, um ícone <x id="20"/> é exibido na barra de ferramentas e o progresso da inicialização é exibido.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Isso leva aproximadamente 7 minutos.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">06/05/2024 14:17:59</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2006641191</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">nTziUvD5L+BUPT2B/JUUT9U5Ml15DeAsKMia2W6tLmE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="7" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-386886819</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Lwo2jbH2s3PVn3NJ8pYUCUeQwwH2aM9MJhGP9cxX3x4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="8" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1841638664</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">gxd0bENoG1+F//E6+r72vKkj7S44+dRK7XEzoTK9InQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="eebb995a-e684-47b5-9315-6df311885afb"><source><g id="29">Standby/Ready/Scanning/Sending</g> - The LED light ring is turned on and is constant.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9"><g id="29">Standby/Ready/Scanning/Sending</g> - The LED light ring is turned on and is constant.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9"><g id="29">Em espera/Pronto/Digitalizando/Enviando</g> - O anel de luz LED está ligado e permanece constante.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="9" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/08/2024 10:23:44</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1750633238</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">BXMlRNjtr5tZDuHXZu5F2oVIn/2XiLEDulmtPgEHCvI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0b0d1aca-1e72-48ed-936f-248ca45e7e25"><source><g id="38">Maintenance</g> - The LED light ring flickers quickly indicating that maintenance is in progress.The <g id="42">Login</g> page is displayed once the maintenance is complete.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10"><g id="38">Maintenance</g> - The LED light ring flickers quickly indicating that maintenance is in progress.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">The <g id="42">Login</g> page is displayed once the maintenance is complete.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10"><g id="38">Manutenção</g> - O anel de luz LED pisca rapidamente, indicando que a manutenção está em andamento.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">A página <g id="42">de Login</g> é exibida quando a manutenção for concluída.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="10" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="Source"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/28/2023 16:15:29</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-258833307</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">XKgmPCjNGn3SKg6D5mUrFc6qb0Hkx516lB9AGUxmSh0=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="11" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1733569714</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">6jxgf4AoxDoOgPyMg5SuNK/527iikGF3Oymels2Mimc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="63f6a628-ba5e-44c6-8499-d8d418f95b8e"><source><g id="49">Error</g> - The LED light ring flickers quickly and an error message is displayed on the screen.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12"><g id="49">Error</g> - The LED light ring flickers quickly and an error message is displayed on the screen.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12"><g id="49">Erro</g> - O anel de luz LED pisca rapidamente e uma mensagem de erro é exibida na tela.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="12" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">259377597</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">O5ZERRiF2TInL9V5kvjU4+KyoYVOdfapyUiMqF5tyss=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="73456d35-bce0-450d-995b-534aec4aadbd"><source>To switch the wand on or off when in an active scan, firmly press one of the side buttons on the wand.A sound is emitted indicating that scanning has started or stopped.You can control the volume, as described in <x id="53"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">To switch the wand on or off when in an active scan, firmly press one of the side buttons on the wand.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">A sound is emitted indicating that scanning has started or stopped.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="15">You can control the volume, as described in <x id="53"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">Para ligar ou desligar o leitor durante uma digitalização ativa, pressione firmemente um dos botões laterais do leitor.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">É emitido um som, indicando que a digitalização foi iniciada ou interrompida.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="15">Você pode controlar o volume, conforme descrito em <x id="53"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="13" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">160245403</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">pnyz0SeME0/bfTe47XDMS9Rqhzb1nszsSXiYgQXn2ZM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="14" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2144512900</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">7PFjdOG5zuKVCKxFrarNbwUyU8GAycugZWFfMRBw+r8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="15" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-129606438</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">8dsylCtS+2i+s/cby0Z45TrDHrJWzkqpIyBJV/CMXRQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="c0826fac-983f-441c-9fb5-7f21bc2d099d"><source>The wand should always be placed in the cradle with the cable positioned at the base and the optical window facing the cradle (away from you).If the wand is incorrectly placed in the cradle, a message is displayed, prompting you to check the wand placement.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="16">The wand should always be placed in the cradle with the cable positioned at the base and the optical window facing the cradle (away from you).</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17">If the wand is incorrectly placed in the cradle, a message is displayed, prompting you to check the wand placement.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="16">O leitor deve ser sempre colocado no suporte com o cabo posicionado na base e a janela óptica voltada para o suporte (longe de você).</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="17">Se o leitor estiver colocada incorretamente no suporte, será exibida uma mensagem, solicitando que você verifique o posicionamento do leitor.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="16" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">54332849</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YRiGZReTWxLCKjGVLsEkBY7o43H9420KracSeF79KJE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="17" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">08/08/2024 10:21:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:48:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-9969</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">anSSqMBAa76HPXBG1IOXTe5qzHheZSVpoIhI91msqhg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file><file original="C:\Data\My Documents\Studio 2011\Projects\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR\en-US\222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_1\Content\10. iTero scanner features and tools\Working with the Occlusal.htm.xlf" datatype="x-sdlfilterframework2" source-language="en-us" target-language="pt-br"><header><reference><internal-file form="base64">UEsDBBQAAAAIACQ0GVm+uKp0EgkAALliAAAQAAAAa2tiNXV1NXUuaHp2LnhsZu1dX3PbuBF/v5n7
