learance tool</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Trabalhando com a ferramenta Espaço Livre Oclusal</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/01/2020 09:31:03</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 20:58:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1630790899</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">4k3zSuXthmNPD63BZ8hxGuqoZSc9P1OhSICpG+4aIwY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a58a6223-0a9b-4982-ad07-1c8b9762229e"><source>The Occlusal Clearance tool <x id="4"/> enables you to view the contact and distance between the opposing teeth<x id="5"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">The Occlusal Clearance tool <x id="4"/> enables you to view the contact and distance between the opposing teeth<x id="5"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">A ferramenta Espaço Livre Oclusal<x id="4"/> permite visualizar o contato e a distância entre os dentes opostos<x id="5"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">QkkRvgDPvPYvGpVEV/bUwLIHnnxIR9DBnytgCcQ+2Ts=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:29:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">643931430</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a02e2b1d-b8b9-470c-9e55-5df2179dcf57"><source>The Occlusal Clearance tool can be accessed while in View mode and from the Viewer.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">The Occlusal Clearance tool can be accessed while in View mode and from the Viewer.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">A ferramenta Espaço Livre Oclusal pode ser acessada quando se estiver em modo Visualizar e no Visualizador.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/01/2020 09:34:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 21:00:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">71445212</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">cA8fJJGoTxX86BVIgpLTjZMM6ubdrtQFu34FZwz+7Zw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="27d437fb-3894-4c3e-bcc1-0aa232bd65b8"><source><g id="11">Note:</g> The Occlusal Clearance tool is displayed only after you have scanned the upper and lower jaws, and the bite.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6"><g id="11">Note:</g> The Occlusal Clearance tool is displayed only after you have scanned the upper and lower jaws, and the bite.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6"><g id="11">Nota:</g> a ferramenta Espaço Livre Oclusal é exibida somente após a digitalização das mandíbulas superior e inferior, e da mordida.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalT