="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/01/2020 09:36:57</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 21:00:59</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1381827816</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">WBpUXzVqGmO11ZcEhNC/pykLQoBHOOA+qaKU6HrFM+w=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="acce1da6-9243-4fe9-b049-4513d45c927c"><source>If necessary, reduce the prepped tooth and rescan the area, as described in <x id="21"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">If necessary, reduce the prepped tooth and rescan the area, as described in <x id="21"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="11" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">yeluqjLN1D5g+zhd46eX2/Nw5lLayfAAS2aptKS9d0w=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="98426941-dbec-40f4-bdc1-503a8039d7b6"><source>If necessary, reduce the relevant tooth, erase the relevant section from the model, and rescan the area, as described in <x id="23"/>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">If necessary, reduce the relevant tooth, erase the relevant section from the model, and rescan the area, as described in <x id="23"/>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12">Se necessário, reduza o dente relevante, apague a seção relevante do modelo e digitalize-o novamente, conforme descrito em <x id="23"/>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="12" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">RZOSiC/bbi74eXpxS810fPhJ0PRbAmVrYVzY1oNS6vw=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/02/2024 18:20:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">-2019994162</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ba6ecb39-5834-4494-9366-cd5389b21fdb"><source>If required, you can change the occlusal values displayed on the opposing teeth.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">If required, you can change the occlusal values displayed on the opposing teeth.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="13">Se necessário, você pode alterar os valores oclusais exibidos nos dentes opostos.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="13" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/09/2019 21:49:35</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/22/2019 18:36:33</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1196278021</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">1huIaXxZLnUSvXRf7mPexu8WCnQ1AKwcYUpiZ1xtqpA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="1ccdcadf-0f1d-458d-8bc8-2d43b608bbad"><source>On the legend, tap <g id="29">Scale</g>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">On the legend, tap <g id="29">Scale</g>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="14">Na legenda, toque em <g id="29">Escala</g>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="14" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="JnSEHIAYP7k24SlgKVZQSraN18wiXhiq1mWE3qMNDzE="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\A