<seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">The area within the loupe is displayed in the image pane on the right.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">The display in the image pane changes according to the position of the loupe.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">A área dentro da lupa é exibida no painel de imagens à direita.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="20">A exibição no painel de imagens muda de acordo com a posição da lupa.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="19" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="F2hFvyvLgrY7q9Ncy4yR+zi5uEG1leAHkYBldYtIlCM="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/13/2020 15:03:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/13/2020 15:03:12</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1895265133</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">F2hFvyvLgrY7q9Ncy4yR+zi5uEG1leAHkYBldYtIlCM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="20" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="3zQgwGmU4897a83b2usB4kblmjKqSyFM3OimZD5V8OY="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/13/2020 15:03:57</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/15/2020 16:16:37</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2117540307</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">3zQgwGmU4897a83b2usB4kblmjKqSyFM3OimZD5V8OY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="8fbd557f-f81d-4880-b735-7122d73d1aed"><source>Image pane on the right showing the area of interest</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">Image pane on the right showing the area of interest</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="21">Painel de imagens à direita, mostrando a área de interesse</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="21" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/14/2020 07:39:02</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/15/2020 16:26:44</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">477047107</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Q/20JK5TV7seBMTHA9YELybodgTq3VhSQcCWE9EuyMA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="131ef5d5-f434-495a-bfcc-205b85456ab7"><source>Zooming in to and out of the images in the image pane</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">Zooming in to and out of the images in the image pane</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="22">Aumentar e diminuir o zoom das imagens no painel de imagens</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="22" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="V36fUmvpG6s/dQ9dZ8efIsoxCp0wwcXLDub3FcDHE8s="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/13/2020 15:28:35</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/13/2020 15:28:35</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">13786068</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">V36fUmvpG6s/dQ9dZ8efIsoxCp0wwcXLDub3FcDHE8s=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0e81e941-44e1-41de-a32a-f42ec39e4107"><source>In order to better evaluate the scanned image in the image pane, you can zoom in to and out of the image, as well as adjust the contrast and brightness of the image.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">In order to better evaluate the scanned image in the image pane, you can zoom in to and out of the image, as well as adjust the contrast and brightness of the image.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="23">Para avaliar melhor a imagem digitalizada no painel de imagens, você pode aumentar e diminuir a imagem, bem como ajustar o contraste e o brilho da mesma.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="23" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/14/2020 07:41:01</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/15/2020 16:22:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1708728867</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">fYNjwYZteRiDRhg6LmPG2bf9O75cEKReqjph68a39qM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a1f16c53-2bb5-4900-a349-28127acd6bf9"><source>You can zoom in to or out of the selected area of the image displayed in the image pane using the following methods:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">You can zoom in to or out of the selected area of the image displayed in the image pane using the following methods:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="24">Você pode aumentar ou diminuir o zoom na área selecionada das imagem exibida no painel de imagens usando os seguintes métodos:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="24" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG