vant sliders in the brightness and contrast toolbar.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="35">Você pode definir o brilho e o contraste de cada uma das imagens exibidas no visor, ajustando os cursores correspondentes na barra de ferramentas de brilho e contraste.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="35" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/14/2020 08:17:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/14/2020 08:17:14</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1802187847</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">s8XYLFcWVLQXB6hBrUT86o4agFmkRlWDfdYO4eafEgw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="14"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5a9c695c-0000-4a4c-8dc3-2aba11277a18"><source><g id="47">Brightness </g>refers to the overall lightness or darkness of an image.Increasing the brightness makes every pixel in the image lighter, and vice versa.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="36"><g id="47">Brightness </g>refers to the overall lightness or darkness of an image.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="37">Increasing the brightness makes every pixel in the image lighter, and vice versa.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="36"><g id="47">Brilho </g>refere-se à claridade ou escuridão geral de uma imagem.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="37">Aumentar o brilho torna cada pixel da imagem mais claro e vice-versa.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="36" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="Oq3krjA51paJX8mmeeZ9Ep0glpVkM7fA2G4mOOIoXPc="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1637956966</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Oq3krjA51paJX8mmeeZ9Ep0glpVkM7fA2G4mOOIoXPc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="37" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="Q4R2gBbPnQNqhGKpBNxsMtTZxMwUTu6ZfQ5c9OQcfq8="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/01/2020 16:06:05</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/21/2020 20:02:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">730056685</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Q4R2gBbPnQNqhGKpBNxsMtTZxMwUTu6ZfQ5c9OQcfq8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="14"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="03d35400-da67-45de-adc6-adbac5fdb5f8"><source><g id="58">Contrast</g> is the difference in <g id="61">brightness</g> between objects in an image.Increasing the contrast makes light areas lighter and dark areas darker, and vice versa.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38"><g id="58">Contrast</g> is the difference in <g id="61">brightness</g> between objects in an image.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39">Increasing the contrast makes light areas lighter and dark areas darker, and vice versa.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38"><g id="58">Contraste</g> é a diferença de <g id="61">brilho</g> entre os objetos de uma imagem.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39">Aumentar o contraste torna as áreas claras mais claras e as áreas escuras mais escuras, e vice-versa.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="38" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="0UW9WgQE74ITBSH+oazuiPhFwWw6lM+lo+Xai4uNqns="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1623311664</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">0UW9WgQE74ITBSH+oazuiPhFwWw6lM+lo+Xai4uNqns=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="39" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="yO6kytJfRSeTwJyKOUm2alpXkbB+qsmWGvPDBtAbYEk="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/11/2019 15:31:45</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/24/2019 03:54:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1804435904</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">yO6kytJfRSeTwJyKOUm2alpXkbB+qsmWGvPDBtAbYEk=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="4fcd958e-0e7f-444d-a2a3-d5ec329fd0e4"><source>By default, the brightness and contrast toolbar is collapsed.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40">By default, the brightness and contrast toolbar is collapsed.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40">Por padrão, a barra de ferramentas de brilho e contraste fica recolhida.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="40" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="US1uyuPGaamre31H5ZLyvLo60nHxQtinE/NMYa+1KiI="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/20/2020 00:20:35</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/20/2020 00:26:15</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-422184351</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">US1uyuPGaamre31H5ZLyvLo60nHxQtinE/NMYa+1KiI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="9e56c241-d3e5-4852-b877-7b38ebe8e81d"><source><g id="69">Note:</g> The color and brightness controls are displayed only when an image is displayed in the image pane, and not when the loupe is in its default position in the right pane.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="41"><g id="69">Note:</g> The color and brightness controls are displayed only when an image is displayed in the image pane, and not when the loupe is in its default position in the right pane.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="41"><g id="69">Nota:</g> Os controles de cor e brilho são exibidos apenas quando uma imagem é exibida no painel de imagens, e não quando a lupa está na posição padrão no painel direito.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="41" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1527438860</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">kSQf9IaVezay6kU2qEAN6OdCvh2qGOjM1zTp0QRZCZU=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="7cfb592d-5d25-4db3-b371-0f24b1195348"><source>The contrast and brightness image controls are reset to their default values when selecting a different jaw, pushing the loupe back to its default position, or when exiting the tool.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="42">The contrast and brightness image controls are reset to their default values when selecting a different jaw, pushing the loupe back to its default position, or when exiting the tool.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="42">Os controles de contraste e brilho da imagem são redefinidos para seus valores padrão ao selecionar uma mandíbula diferente, empurrando a lupa de volta à sua posição padrão, ou ao sair da ferramenta.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="42" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="tavEpoUkT3suBAAFitByf7IZut+cwShHgjpmXGy8Drg="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/15/2020 16:20:34</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/15/2020 16:20:34</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1752841994</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">tavEpoUkT3suBAAFitByf7IZut+cwShHgjpmXGy8Drg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="27158447-0283-44f6-a4ee-fde51004a9c9"><source>To adjust the brightness and contrast of the images in the image pane:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="43">To adjust the brightness and contrast of the images in the image pane:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="43">Para ajustar o brilho e o contraste das imagens no painel de imagens:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="43" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="E3WavJ+CdYALB3BZmatBjjUD2iJ6jvaqySf704Wxflo="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/14/2020 08:31:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/15/2020 16:20:45</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1747557062</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">E3WavJ+CdYALB3BZmatBjjUD2iJ6jvaqySf704Wxflo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="4a10b819-0cd3-4792-a8a1-eba386427dbc"><source>Tap <x id="71"/> on the left edge of the image pane to display the brightness and contrast adjustment toolbar.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="44">Tap <x id="71"/> on the left edge of the image pane to display the brightness and contrast adjustment toolbar.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="44">Toque <x id="71"/> na borda esquerda do painel de imagens para exibir a barra de ferramentas de ajuste de brilho e contraste.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="44" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="OoVisONXvUeEoM4zU5xx/oRNLX22LLJrSQH1U0dq3iI="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-741254385</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">OoVisONXvUeEoM4zU5xx/oRNLX22LLJrSQH1U0dq3iI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="f856ba74-ae0e-44b8-a26f-e541a3f2ba2a"><source>Brightness and contrast toolbar is collapsed</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="45">Brightness and contrast toolbar is collapsed</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="45">A barra de ferramentas de brilho e contraste fica recolhida</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="45" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="YzZsvM9z33x8LRbBn9+hLqDrr4okF2pIHf+OxYjHLeI="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/20/2020 00:13:55</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/20/2020 00:25:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">347546434</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YzZsvM9z33x8LRbBn9+hLqDrr4okF2pIHf+OxYjHLeI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="14"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d07cdaf3-7fb7-432d-a9dc-b4965b1cdd7d"><source>A brightness and contrast adjustment toolbar is displayed on the window in the image pane.By default, the brightness level is set to the lowest position and the contrast is set to the middle position.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="46">A brightness and contrast adjustment toolbar is displayed on the window in the image pane.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="47">By default, the brightness level is set to the lowest position and the contrast is set to the middle position.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="46">É exibida uma barra de ferramentas de ajuste de brilho e contraste na janela do painel de imagens.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="47">Por padrão, o nível de brilho é fixado na posição mais baixa e o contraste é fixado na posição do meio.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="46" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">NEARUACER\veren</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">02/16/2024 13:23:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">06/12/2024 15:49:36</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">JONATAS-CAMPOS\Gabriel</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-697962</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">xp8jwB0van512qG7hB2G2Ruia4jMu+EKbssDK4xrUYI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="47" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="JxLp2/26tFsq7MtY900Ej7tQAhHXKK2bUZ2cdcnua3A="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/11/2019 15:35:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/24/2019 03:55:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">289934349</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">JxLp2/26tFsq7MtY900Ej7tQAhHXKK2bUZ2cdcnua3A=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5b7af44a-0f09-4518-a592-ad11b4aec9fa"><source>Brightness and contrast toolbar</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="48">Brightness and contrast toolbar</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="48">Barra de ferramentas de brilho e contraste</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="48" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/20/2020 00:26:38</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/20/2020 00:26:38</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1849588582</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">tZokGVYMRdO5+WDMvM8af78O2MAyZJxVTGBoaYzx0go=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2735f7e1-8c53-4abc-ac4f-070ab8af6f25"><source>Move the slider up or down to adjust the brightness <x id="75"/>or contrast.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="49">Move the slider up or down to adjust the brightness <x id="75"/>or contrast.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="49">Mova o cursor deslizante para cima ou para baixo para ajustar o brilho <x id="75"/>ou o contraste.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="49" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="sBURxX3VvKR3Le7VuoXETrnlTfDNk50PGa6x6vjxHZQ="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1766361159</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">sBURxX3VvKR3Le7VuoXETrnlTfDNk50PGa6x6vjxHZQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="e339fe2a-7100-400d-9e71-b7c96372f640"><source><g id="81">Tip:</g> You can tap anywhere in the slider area and drag up or down to adjust the settings.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="50"><g id="81">Tip:</g> You can tap anywhere in the slider area and drag up or down to adjust the settings.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="50"><g id="81">Dica:</g> Para ajustar as configurações, você pode tocar em qualquer lugar da área deslizante e arrastar para cima ou para baixo.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="50" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="V8Vn0HbWgwOWPZR46PEj5/SVxEdEAKFbbfVbXp1Q8j0="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1643610018</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">V8Vn0HbWgwOWPZR46PEj5/SVxEdEAKFbbfVbXp1Q8j0=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="1f77f0ee-18eb-49e7-861c-350dcaf40a41"><source>Tap <x id="83"/> to collapse the toolbar.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="51">Tap <x id="83"/> to collapse the toolbar.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="51">Toque em <x id="83"/> para recolher a barra de ferramentas.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="51" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="xxdFu0LIJ+sL/mcuI+Ig3J0GtnANA8jACs4Z9w/m1cY="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">553366716</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">xxdFu0LIJ+sL/mcuI+Ig3J0GtnANA8jACs4Z9w/m1cY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="13"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="fb2a0b4d-49a0-4168-bac6-3d154a26f08c"><source>Capturing the Review tool images</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="52">Capturing the Review tool images</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="52">Capturando imagens da ferramenta Revisão</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="52" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="yGigmgtCooAG3OuFXFUCNdmCcaaaZiIjKIS7hezIDS8="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/02/2020 11:32:27</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/21/2020 20:07:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-974385726</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">yGigmgtCooAG3OuFXFUCNdmCcaaaZiIjKIS7hezIDS8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="91541a48-1bf9-4c0f-a91a-3540d978bb5c"><source>If required, you can capture the images displayed when using the Review tool.These images become part of the patient’s export package and can later be downloaded from MyiTero.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="53">If required, you can capture the images displayed when using the Review tool.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="54">These images become part of the patient’s export package and can later be downloaded from MyiTero.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="53">Se necessário, você pode capturar as imagens exibidas ao usar a ferramenta Revisão.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="54">Essas imagens se tornam parte do pacote de exportação do paciente e podem ser baixadas posteriormente do MyiTero.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="53" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="heDU/eJ1iZtXE6rXP34tDD/KzwpaUnCMh+zEnFtELUY="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/11/2019 15:36:43</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/23/2019 01:12:42</sdl:value><s