type="seg" mid="1"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="1" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:rep id="b4AASTzMyvkcDCb2GtMTZFheEa7HFKGQ8BjFxfThFbs="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">b4AASTzMyvkcDCb2GtMTZFheEa7HFKGQ8BjFxfThFbs=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="4e6f154e-8270-4ee4-b985-b7c19d824bd8"><source>Tools:Snapshot</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2">Tools:Snapshot</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="2"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="2" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">GG119x51BokF8sxt2cnmDj8HW9KeWEoBff67g+GYtZ8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="6"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="722ce178-9be4-44a5-9aad-a05259a6acf4"><source>Working with the Snapshot tool</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Working with the Snapshot tool</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3">Trabalhando com a ferramenta Snapshot</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/25/2020 10:03:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 15:23:40</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1888229042</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">HykQmO1O6r/9uA1uKITjWNkwYMDFnUYYINJFL5935vg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="7c6a462c-e119-4002-88ea-2ab1814b3f1c"><source>The Snapshot tool enables you to capture screenshots of the scanned model.These screenshots become part of the patient’s export package and can later be downloaded from MyiTero.In addition, these screenshots can be added to the iTero Scan Report, created in MyiTero.<x id="9"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">The Snapshot tool enables you to capture screenshots of the scanned model.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">These screenshots become part of the patient’s export package and can later be downloaded from MyiTero.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">In addition, these screenshots can be added to the iTero Scan Report, created in MyiTero.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7"><x id="9"/></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">A ferramenta Snapshot lhe permite capturar imagens do modelo digitalizado.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Essas capturas de tela se tornam parte do pacote de exportação do paciente e podem ser baixadas posteriormente no MyiTero.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Além disso, essas capturas de tela podem ser adicionadas ao Relatório de Digitalização do iTero, criado no MyiTero.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7"><x id="9"/></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/25/2020 10:04:00</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 15:23:50</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2109279060</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">fSt9x2DOpRHNQ+iTkquHC8i/1JY13jnP3rE1wC4DoOE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="5" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/17/2022 00:48:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 00:48:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2035510777</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">v93bkBze4BtY3NwZDF4+brFxKOnqEubj9W9glt3xslM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="6" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/17/2022 00:48:58</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 00:48:58</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1000536041</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">zGiIZiNknYkL3yWE9/SdvUBORcCq0mEAEyKPibJPWF4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="7" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/12/2022 04:45:51</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/12/2022 05:26:54</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="72eecd98-f85d-42e2-a53f-98bd164aec87"><source>Once the image has been captured, you can add annotations, if required.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Once the image has been captured, you can add annotations, if required.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Assim que a imagem for capturada, é possível adicionar anotações, se necessário.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="8" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/25/2020 10:06:01</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 15:24:25</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1634766476</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">KLxszIQDYt/93lg+Gw/ukCVLDfpCLnpO+9Uwx+MY3AY=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="6b7eabec-9f50-452c-948b-6f9ef63fdc3a"><source>By default, each time you tap the Snapshot tool, the following images are captured and saved in a separate folder, whose name includes the Order ID, and date and time of the screenshots:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">By default, each time you tap the Snapshot tool, the following images are captured and saved in a separate folder, whose name includes the Order ID, and date and time of the screenshots:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">Por padrão, sempre que você toca na ferramenta Snapshot, as seguintes imagens são capturadas e salvas em uma pasta separada, cujo nome inclui o ID do pedido e a data e hora das capturas de tela:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="9" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/10/2022 07:53:44</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 00:49:04</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-299702788</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Gptpv65I7sNV88ADnfKYPqzB1L3B/S2+jewEwF+o4AA=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-def