2aa"><source>Each set of screenshots is saved in a separate folder and saved in a folder with the patient’s name, which can be downloaded from MyiTero as a zipped file.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18">Each set of screenshots is saved in a separate folder and saved in a folder with the patient’s name, which can be downloaded from MyiTero as a zipped file.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="18">Cada conjunto de capturas de tela é salvo em uma pasta separada e em uma pasta com o nome do paciente, que pode ser baixada no MyiTero como um arquivo compactado.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="18" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/11/2019 15:40:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/23/2019 01:13:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1361464475</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">n2J/ZYfjZfSdzPQGOjI/jBcpbOEA+t+Z1PlFbeWo5Tw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a372db99-3c3b-41d9-b060-87e28c6367ca"><source>Screenshots can be captured from any window that includes the Snapshot tool <x id="44"/> on the scanner toolbar.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">Screenshots can be captured from any window that includes the Snapshot tool <x id="44"/> on the scanner toolbar.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="19">As capturas de tela podem ser feitas em qualquer janela que inclua a ferramenta Snapshot <x id="44"/> na barra de ferramentas do scanner.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="19" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"