="seg" mid="25">In <g id="55">View</g> mode, tap the Snapshot tool  <x id="56"/> on the toolbar.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="25">No modo <g id="55">visualização</g>, toque na ferramenta Snapshot na  <x id="56"/> na barra de ferramenta.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="25" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:26</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-6175064</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">rXIbdrdU/wsnYiobbYfolnhlYlK3h2pdh+YncC3FQsw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3d5bbc2a-85bb-4ecd-91b2-d92a774f5d28"><source>View mode – with Snapshot tool</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26">View mode – with Snapshot tool</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="26">Modo de visualização – com a ferramenta Snapshot</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="26" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/25/2020 10:14:01</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 00:49:19</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1726717441</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">uFjz0MgdEGfY+V/xtuVm0qfuWLATtg5l52lKGUTb33I=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="4f2daf7c-ed6c-4903-9607-69719e2f3b11"><source>The screen flashes, indicating that the screenshot was captured.A thumbnail of the screenshot is displayed on the bottom left of the window and remains for 7 seconds.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27">The screen flashes, indicating that the screenshot was captured.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28">A thumbnail of the screenshot is displayed on the bottom left of the window and remains for 7 seconds.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="27">A tela pisca, indicando que a captura de tela foi feita.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28">Uma miniatura da captura de tela é exibida na parte inferior esquerda da janela e permanece por 7 segundos.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="27" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/11/2019 15:41:33</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/23/2019 01:13:38</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1334038139</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">0jp5Jh+B3MIWKhRqX/HThR65Lrie9zlLFWYYelzxM88=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="28" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/19/2021 17:05:29</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 00:49:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">671868873</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">JuO627/TY9KQc906m+xDLgpbrl3WbElcvNg1yEiOGvo=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="43ddc910-c632-4c37-ab1a-5ef578a74529"><source>Screen capture thumbnail is displayed after taking a screen capture</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">Screen capture thumbnail is displayed after taking a screen capture</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">A miniatura da captura de tela é exibida assim que a imagem é capturada</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="29" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/25/2020 10:15:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/20/2020 15:34:31</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2061687030</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">zv36g4rV62xL+uViBAfDQzUneIH0UBrFnC7Sa1gEBZ8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="15f6c3dd-7b19-4737-a649-27cd7cea5dca"><source>Tap the thumbnail if you would like to add annotations to the screenshot.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">Tap the thumbnail if you would like to add annotations to the screenshot.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">Toque na miniatura se desejar adicionar anotações na captura de tela.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="30" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/14/2020 08:45:27</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 00:49:23</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1859054756</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">focPQFn5jOv3B8u1