dow view</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="28">Modelo em uma visualização de duas janelas</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="28" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="GeDZlb21q/fIhGBUFhss4g+PLpsAe6DjJ3oXXimziAE="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/10/2019 00:49:11</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/23/2019 01:25:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">419998271</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">GeDZlb21q/fIhGBUFhss4g+PLpsAe6DjJ3oXXimziAE=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="18"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="f691b5b4-7648-4deb-81c9-c0aa755833f1"><source>Relevant for Orthodontic procedures only.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29">Relevant for Orthodontic procedures only.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="29"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="29" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:rep id="osbMFYRKZCPe3AL9xfvanh/pDnMDVIaRK+Gvqb3ZoNg="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">osbMFYRKZCPe3AL9xfvanh/pDnMDVIaRK+Gvqb3ZoNg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="279174cb-630a-4b9b-9ce3-c48c5bc046fc"><source>Display the model in a 5-window view, with the upper and lower jaws separately, and both jaws from the left, center, and right (Gallery view).Each model can be controlled separately, for better evaluation.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">Display the model in a 5-window view, with the upper and lower jaws separately, and both jaws from the left, center, and right (Gallery view).</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31">Each model can be controlled separately, for better evaluation.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="30">Exibe o modelo na visualização em cinco janelas, com as mandíbulas superior e inferior vistas separadamente, e ambas as mandíbulas à esquerda, centro e direita (visualização Galeria).</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="31">Cada modelo pode ser controlado separadamente, para melhor avaliação.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="30" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="Source"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">10/02/2020 15:11:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">10/21/2020 20:58:41</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1695179939</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ixZM7UleGz+YAsQZHDAJmOgiKWB2xRodT95Eowa4Y70=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="31" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:rep id="c1eSLtU1gE4a4l1+blaa4lllKqyn7ge9Yg3iRR71ho4="/><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">12/10/2019 00:37:21</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">12/24/2019 01:42:30</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-468747474</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">c1eSLtU1gE4a4l1+blaa4lllKqyn7ge9Yg3iRR71ho4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="711459bf-407a-4f19-ac61-eb23ce0eb50f"><source>Model in a 5-window view</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32">Model in a 5-window view</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="32">Modelo em uma visualização de cinco ja