:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-608962140</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FslqDmLvPQjBA3EOXBWhXy4vnYUlofjo5SMK9LGXmh4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="19"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d6f6f32f-7ead-41f0-ab79-e8c0d32de81e"><source>Relevant for Restorative procedures only.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38">Relevant for Restorative procedures only.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="38"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="38" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:rep id="WgRL/wdjK7DCOl0Wa98kZ1HHm5cPumasyMlKzlgY/6Y="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">WgRL/wdjK7DCOl0Wa98kZ1HHm5cPumasyMlKzlgY/6Y=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="701c4744-f2a1-470b-b0ba-7fa9ab1e3d38"><source>Toggle between viewing the model in color or monochrome.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39">Toggle between viewing the model in color or monochrome.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="39">Alternar entre visualizar o modelo em cores ou monocromático.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="39" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="Source"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 10:18:50</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 00:20:18</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">775546544</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Rvr/jm0xf93ojkkdo+l6LGXd/iQhFoSJ5qWOtQMu340=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="1a291776-d145-4e72-b571-911d16ac0fa8"><source>Show/hide the occlusal clearance between the opposing teeth, as described in <x id="59"/>.This option is enabled only if the bite was scanned.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40">Show/hide the occlusal clearance between the opposing teeth, as described in <x id="59"/>.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="41">This option is enabled only if the bite was scanned.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="40">Mostrar/ocultar o espaço livre oclusal entre os dentes opostos, conforme descrito na <x id="59"/>.</mrk><mrk mtype="seg" mid="41">Essa opção só é ativada se a mordida foi digitalizada.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="40" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">03/07/2023 16:33:24</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2027351138</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">nt19qd0P5iz4pb4PRKyFj+BoUIzqzXB6YifYMWXApKg=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="41" locked="true" conf="Translated" origin="tm" origin-system="NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="100" text-match="SourceAndTarget"><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">11/09/2022 10:46:05</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">11/17/2022 00:20:22</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-MP0FQK1\ASUS</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-899874901</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">uumB+pJPrIe1JVQjg4gOZRS14F6PFgrSnbuHsGJFmm0=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="18"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="079d9f1e-b20b-4920-ad98-fed2be16f522"><source><g id="70">Note:</g> When the case status is <g id="73">iTero Modeling</g>, it is in the early stages of modeling, and the margin line and die tools are disabled.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="42"><g id="70">Note:</g> When the case status is <g id="73">iTero Modeling</g>, it is in the early stages of modeling, and the margin line and die tools are disabled.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="42"/></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="42" locked="true" conf="Draft"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">nALAzmzX2CADSOi0imq3NwR0AA46BArOyruRCDPWhyw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="10"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:cxt id="5"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="1bae79d5-b285-42f1-b9fb-0614802f0908"><source>When the modeling process is completed, <x id="77"/>the changes appear in color on the model and the tools are displayed in color, indicating that they are active.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="43">When the modeling process is completed, <x id="77"/>the changes appear in color on the model and the tools are displayed in color, indicating that they are active.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="43">Quando o processo de modelagem for concluído <x id="77"/>as alterações vão aparecer em cores no modelo e as ferramentas também vão ser exibidas em cores, indicando que elas estão ativas.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="43" conf="ApprovedTranslation" origin="interactive" percent="77"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="222818 Rev.3 LuminaPro-pt-BR_NG_Core-pt-BR2" percent="77"><sdl:prev-origin/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">BTU3bMymtpsQV6AbM/UD2z3UEf1yONRK/VifyXgz9pc=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-0BKV72R\xzgab</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">08/29/2024 03:40:39</sdl:value><sdl:value key="FuzzyMatchRepair">true</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">BTU3bMymtpsQ